address_line1":"Fritz Toussaintstraat, 8\/1050","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"See U is het programma voor de nieuwe tijdelijke bezetting van de voormalige Fritz Toussaintkazerne in Elsene, volledig in het teken van duurzame ontwikkeling.\r\nSee U verwelkomt een veertigtal projecten om deze unieke historische site nieuw leven in te blazen. Deze projecten vertrekken vanuit het perspectief van een sociale en duurzame toekomst. De bedoeling is dat See U een uitnodiging wordt om het definitieve project Usquare.brussels te ontdekken.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"See U","address_street_name":"Rue Fritz Toussaint","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":"1050","email":"contact@see-u.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.see-u.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Fritz Toussaint, 8\/1050","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"As part of a temporary occupation approach, See U has welcomed more than fifty project leaders since spring 2019 to breathe new life into this unique historical site. The projects that animate the former Fritz Toussaint barracks in Ixelles are part of a discovery process, in line with the perspective of a social and sustainable future. See U is an invitation to discover the final Usquare.brussels project.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"See U","address_street_name":"Rue Fritz Toussaint","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":"1050","email":"contact@see-u.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.see-u.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Fritz Toussaint, 8\/1050","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"See U"