_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"parcours@lafonderie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 99 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Ransfort 27, 27","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":" La Fonderie's tour guides invite visitors to discover Brussels so they may better understand and analyse the city.\r\nThe urban guided tours with their varied themes address questions deeply rooted in the past but which relate to modern, everyday life such as: work, industrial techniques, urban growth, immigration, social welfare and housing. Some visits concentrate on a neighbourhood; others ask questions related to economic, political or social issues. More than twenty tours are available in several languages for a large and diverse public.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"La Fonderie - Br\u00fcsseler Museum f\u00fcr Industrie und Arbeit","address_street_name":"Rue Ransfort 27","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"parcours@lafonderie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 99 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Ransfort 27, 27","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"La Fonderie bietet seit rund 30 Jahren Stadtf\u00fchrungen mit dem Schiff oder zu Fu\u00df. Das j\u00e4hrlich erneuerte und erweiterte Programm bietet eine gro\u00dfe Themenvielfalt, die zahlreiche Besucher anzieht. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"La Fonderie","address_street_name":"Rue Ransfort 27","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"parcours@lafonderie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 99 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Ransfort 27, 27","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"La Fonderie - Museo de la Industria y del Trabajo de Bruselas","address_street_name":"Rue Ransfort 27","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"parcours@lafonderie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 99 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Ransfort 27, 27","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Desde hace casi 30 a\u00f1os, la Fonderie ofrece visitas guiadas de la ciudad, tanto en barco como a pie. Estas visitas, que son famosas y atraen a varios miles de visitantes al a\u00f1o, se actualizan con regularidad y se completan todos los a\u00f1os con nuevos temas o dispositivos. El p\u00fablico objetivo de estas rutas es amplio: desde ni\u00f1os hasta grupos de adultos. La mayor\u00eda de las visitas est\u00e1n disponibles tanto para individuos y familias como para grupos que los soliciten.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"La Fonderie - Mus\u00e9e bruxellois des industries et du travail","address_street_name":"Rue Ransfort 27","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"parcours@lafonderie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lafonderie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 410 99 50","phone_booking":"+32 2 410 99 50","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue Ransfort 27, 27","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"La Fonderie - Mus\u00e9e bruxellois des industries et du travail","address_street_name":"Rue Ransfort 27","a