translations":{"fr":["Gastronomie"],"nl":["Gastronomie"],"en":["Gastronomy"]}},"tags":["exterior"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-06-08T18:05:04+02:00","published_at":"2021-09-07T17:11:54+02:00","backoffice_id":238575,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.13269424171239},{"id":533537,"date_start":"2022-06-11","date_end":"2022-06-12","date_next":"2022-06-11","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[4,6],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"End of Season","shortdescr":"Festival des cours de l'acad\u00e9mie !","longdescr":"Ce sont chaque semaine plus de 600 \u00e9l\u00e8ves qui participent aux cours de musique et de danse du monde de l\u2019acad\u00e9mie de Muziekpublique. Ils apprennent le oud, le chant diphonique, le cajon flamenco, le tango, les boleadoras, le cavaquinho, les percussions orientales, le violon manouche ou la kora. D\u2019autres apprennent \u00e0 jouer ensemble le r\u00e9pertoire de musiques turques, de musiques des balkans ou du folk d\u2019Europe. Ils se perfectionnent dans un instrument et d\u00e9couvrent par ce biais la richesse d\u2019une culture, puis partagent des moments de musique avec leurs professeurs et d\u2019autres \u00e9l\u00e8ves.\r\n\r\nTraditionnellement, l\u2019End Of Season met \u00e0 l\u2019honneur les \u00e9l\u00e8ves et leurs professeurs. Lors de ces deux sessions de spectacle, ils pr\u00e9senteront leur travail, fruit de plusieurs semaines de cours, et feront r\u00e9sonner de mani\u00e8re unique toutes les cultures musicales qui vivent, s\u2019\u00e9panouissent et se m\u00e9langent \u00e0 Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nVenez les applaudir, et qui sait\u2026 peut-\u00eatre serez-vous l\u2019ann\u00e9e prochaine avec eux sur les planches du Moli\u00e8re.","performers":"les \u00e9l\u00e8ves de l'Acad\u00e9mie","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/533537.html"},"nl":{"name":"End of Season","shortdescr":"Cursus festival Muziekpublique","longdescr":"Dit is telkens \u00e9\u00e9n van de hoogtepunten van het jaar, als de leerlingen die met meer dan 500 wekelijks een cursus muziek of dans in de academie van Muziekpublique volgen, tonen wat ze geleerd hebben. Tijdens het End of Season Festival reizen we ongeveer de hele wereld af: van West-Afrika, via Zuid-Spanje naar de Balkan, om via het Midden-Oosten uit te komen aan de andere kant van de Oceaan: Latijns-Amerika!\r\n\r\nHet hele jaar werkten de leerlingen hard aan vingerzettingen, kwarttonen, zevenkwartsmaten, keelzang of \u2018soniquete\u2019, zetten ze hun passen om in passie. Het resultaat kan je op een zeer geanimeerde avond en namiddag bewonderen in een spektakel dat uitblinkt in diversiteit.\r\n\r\nDe Muziekpublique Academy is de meest diverse, eigenzinnige en levendige muziekacademie in de Europese Unie. Elke week kan je er les volgen bij grote namen op de Belgische folk- en traditionele muziek-sc\u00e8ne, zoals Vardan Hovanissian, Osvaldo Hernandez, Renaud Dardenne en Osman Martins. In totaal zijn er zo\u2019n 50 verschillende muziek- en danslessen: kora, darbouka, flamencodans, Ierse fluit, Braziliaanse gitaar \u2026 en als je al een degelijk niveau hebt kan je je ook inschrijven bij \u00e9\u00e9n van onze ensembles: Balkan, Oost-West, American Roots, Swing Manouche \u2026","performers":"students of the academy","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/533537.html"},"en":{"name":"End of Season","shortdescr":"Festival of Academy courses","longdescr":"Every week more than 600 students take part in courses on music and dance from around the world at Muziekpublique\u2019s Academy. They learn the oud, diphonic singing, oriental percussion, the flamenco cajon, the tango, the boleadoras, the cavaquinho, gipsy (\u201cmanouche\u201d) violin or the kora. Others learn to play together the repertoire of Turkish musical traditions, various kinds of music from the Balkans or folk music from across Europe. They improve their mastery of an instrument and discover through this experience the richness of the culture in question. Then they share musical moments with their teachers and other students.\r\n\r\nTraditionally, the End Of Season throws the spotlight on the students and their teachers. In the course of these two shows they will present their work, the fruit of several weeks of study, and in this way, thanks to them, all the musical cultures that live, blossom, and intermingle in Brussels will be have a chance to resound.\r\n\r\nCome and applaud them, and who knows?\u2026 perhaps next year you will be among t hem, treading the boards of the Moli\u00e8re.","performers":"students of the academy","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/533537.html"},"de":{"name":"End of Season","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/533537.html"},"it":{"name":"End of Season","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/533537.html"},"sp":{"name":"End of Season","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/533537.html"},"pt":{"name":"End of Season","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/533537.html"},"cn":{"name":"End of Season","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/533537.html"}},"place":{"id":238099,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique est le centre des musiques traditionnelles du monde de Bruxelles. Etablie dans le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Moli\u00e8re au c\u0153ur du quartier africain, l\u2019asbl organise plus de 100 concerts par an et deux festivals (Hide & Seek Festival etc.). Par ailleurs Muziekpublique propose aussi 50 cours de musique et de danse du monde, comptant plus de 600 \u00e9l\u00e8ves. Ensuite, l\u2019asbl d\u00e9veloppe certains artistes et projets via son label, qui est aussi une agence de booking et de management. La musique traditionnelle a donc trouv\u00e9 un endroit id\u00e9al o\u00f9 se d\u00e9velopper et les artistes y constituent un r\u00e9seau vivant et dynamique cr\u00e9ant des liens de qualit\u00e9 avec le public. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Galerij van de Naamsepoort, 3","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Muziekpublique verspreidt en promoot muziek- en danstradities via een ambitieus programma van concerten, cursussen en projecten. Een jaarrond concertprogramma met Belgische en internationale artiesten vormt de kern van de activiteiten van de organisatie. Van contemplatieve tot feestelijke concerten vinden het hele jaar door plaats in het prachtige Moli\u00e8re Theater, aan de Naamsepoort, maar ook op verschillende plaatsen de hoofdstad.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique, keeps music and dance traditions alive and kicking in Brussels through an ambitious programme of concerts, courses, and projects. A year-round concert programme, featuring Belgian and international artists, forms the core of the foundation\u2019s activities. From the contemplative to the madly festive concerts take place indoors,  in the small Moli\u00e8re Theatre, in the arcade at the Porte de Namur and outdoors, around the city and throughout the year.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","