uvrir et d\u2019approfondir la connaissance de soi et du monde qui l\u2019entoure. Chaque exposition se veut participative et ludique, avec un accent important mis sur le dialogue parents-enfants. Il s'agit \u00e0 chaque fois d'une cr\u00e9ation et d'une r\u00e9alisation enti\u00e8rement originale de l\u2019\u00e9quipe du Mus\u00e9e des Enfants, conseill\u00e9e par de nombreux sp\u00e9cialistes tel que p\u00e9dopsychiatres et psychologues.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Kindermuseum","address_street_name":"Burgemeestersstraat","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kindermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Burgemeestersstraat, 15","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Het Kindermuseum is een ware Europese pionnier. \r\nGevestigd in een prachtig herenhuis met een totale tentoonstellingsoppervlakte van 600 m\u00b2 illustreert het Kindermuseum door middel van haar tentoonstellingen en activiteiten de filosofie dat voor de vorming en ontwikkeling van een goede wereldori\u00ebntatie de participatieve en psychologische dimensie echt wezenlijk is. In deze ruimtes vind je nochtans geen virtuele, noch hoogtechnologische snufjes: het kind wordt in een herkenbare en re\u00eble spelsituatie geplaatst dankzij de decors en de houten spelletjes die de zelfkennis, de kennis van de ander en van de omringende wereld stimuleren. Het Museum biedt ludieke tentoonstellingen aan waarin de deelname en de dialoog volwassene\/ouder-kinderen een zeer belangrijke rol spelen.  Bij het creatieproces van elke tentoonstelling wordt de raad ingewonnen van  externe specialisten zoals kinderartsen, -psychiaters en -psychologen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Children\u2019s Museum","address_street_name":"rue du Bourgmestre","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"rue du Bourgmestre, 15","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Pioneer in Europe, The Children\u2019s Museum is located in a beautiful mansion which offers a 600m2 exhibition spaces. In this educational environment, where playing has a key role, you won\u2019t find computers nor video games. Stage settings and scenery, wooden toys, workshops are but some examples of the different means the Museum has put in place to help children in the discovery of the world that surrounds them, as well as themselves. Every exhibition is an exclusive creation that benefits from the guidance of various external specialists in different areas of the educational work fields.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e des Enfants - das Br\u00fcsseler Kindermuseum","address_street_name":"Rue du Bourgmestre","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue du Bourgmestre, 15","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Das Br\u00fcsseler Kindermuseum pr\u00e4sentiert in seinem stattlichen Herrenhaus in der Gemeinde Ixelles wechselnde thematische Ausstellungen f\u00fcr wissbegierige Kinder. Auf den 600 m\u00b2 Ausstellungsfl\u00e4che gibt es ganz sicher weder Computer noch Spielekonsolen, daf\u00fcr aber Holzspiele und spannende Installationen, die die Neugierde anregen und den Entdeckergeist wecken. Das Konzept, das - in Zusammenarbeit mit Kinderpsychologen - von dem Kindermuseum selbst entwickelt wurde, legt ein besonderes Augenmerk 