\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Caf\u00e9 Des Halles est un super endroit dans ce qui \u00e9tait le march\u00e9 couvert d'une des places les plus anim\u00e9es de Bruxelles. Enti\u00e8rement r\u00e9nov\u00e9, l'endroit h\u00e9berge des coins salons o\u00f9 l\u2019on peut discuter tranquillement dans les fauteuils en cuir, et dans les caves vo\u00fbt\u00e9s un club o\u00f9 se d\u00e9roulent de tr\u00e8s belles soir\u00e9es.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Caf\u00e9 des Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cafedeshalles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cafedeshalles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 33 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Sint-Goriksplein","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Caf\u00e9 Des Halles, in wat ooit een overdekte markthal was pal in het midden van \u00e9\u00e9n van de meest geanimeerde pleinen van Brussel (Sint-Goriks), is een caf\u00e9 met in de gewelfde kelders een club waar regelmatig goede feestjes gebouwd worden. Boven is het gezellig keuvelen in de lederen zetels. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Caf\u00e9 Des Halles Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_name":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cafedeshalles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cafedeshalles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 33 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place Saint-G\u00e9ry","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Caf\u00e9 Des Halles is located in a fully renovated ancient covered market place at the very lively Place Saint-G\u00e9ry. You can chill and chat in the black leather chairs, and party in the club in the vaulted cellars.","description_