6 - 8 jaar","8 - 10 jaar","10 - 12 jaar","12 - 14 jaar","14 - 16 jaar","16 - 18 jaar"],"en":["Kindergarden","Primary school","Secondary school","6 - 8 years","8 - 10 years","10 - 12 years","12 - 14 years","14 - 16 years","16 - 18 years"]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-06-10T01:36:29+02:00","published_at":"2021-07-27T14:22:40+02:00","backoffice_id":236124,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"sport","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.14921454815129},{"id":535543,"date_start":"2022-06-15","date_end":"2022-07-06","date_next":"2022-06-15","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":57,"translations":{"fr":"Clubbing","nl":"Clubbing","en":"Clubbing"}},"others":{"list":[257],"translations":{"fr":["Afterwork"],"nl":["Afterwork"],"en":["Afterwork"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Ap\u00e9RHONE - afterwork","shortdescr":"Tous les mercredis du mois de juin les Ap\u00e9RHONES debarquent en Gare Maritime de Bruxelles. Venez profiter de la vari\u00e9t\u00e9 que les vins des C\u00f4tes du Rh\u00f4ne offerts de 18h \u00e0 19h. Ceci en version speed dating ou plut\u00f4t extra d\u00e9tendue au bar.","longdescr":"D\u00e8s le mois de juin, une brise fraiche et l\u00e9g\u00e8re venant du Sud de la France s\u2019emparera de la Gare Maritime de Bruxelles. A moins qu\u2019il ne s\u2019agisse d\u2019un ouragan de g\u00e9n\u00e9rosit\u00e9 gourmande qui viendra \u00e9veiller les papilles des visiteurs occasionnels ou assidus de la Food Market.\r\n\r\nC\u2019est dans ce nouveau lieu incontournable de la street food, o\u00f9 se c\u00f4toient les cuisines du monde avec leurs \u00e9choppes tenues par des chefs renomm\u00e9s ou des gloires montantes, que les C\u00f4tes du Rh\u00f4ne battront pavillon tous les mercredis en fin d\u2019apr\u00e8s-midi.\r\n\r\nDans une version ApeRHONE afterwork d\u00e9contract\u00e9e comme on les aime dans notre pays \u00ab sans chichis \u00bb, les oenophiles amateurs ou experts pourront vous faire voyager:\r\n\r\nPROGRAMME\r\nmercredi 15 juin : Engagements environnementaux\r\nmercredi 22 juin : Panache grenache\r\nmercredi 29 juin : Recherche de l'excellence\r\nmercredi 6 juillet : Vins fra\u00eecheur blanc et ros\u00e9s\r\n\r\nDe 18h00 \u00e0 19h00, des sommeliers \u00ab volants \u00bb vous inviteront \u00e0 leur \u00ab C\u00f4te du Rh\u00f4ne speed tastings \u00bb et divulgueront leurs meilleurs conseils et astuces en version speed date pour animer vos piqueniques, bbq's, d\u00e9jeuners ou grandes soir\u00e9es. Leurs noms : Vicky, Kristel, Anca, Lou, Salvator, Maxime, Stefanie, des professionnels belges renomm\u00e9s de la tribu \"OntheRh\u00f4neAgain\", qui vous parlent \u00ab vin \u00bb de mani\u00e8re totalement d\u00e9complex\u00e9e. Go\u00fbter \u00e0 leur enthousiasme sinc\u00e8re et contagieux, c\u2019est se faire plaisir sans mod\u00e9ration. Sharing is pairing par les chefs de la gare maritime : de petits plats \u00e0 d\u00e9guster en accord avec les vins pr\u00e9sent\u00e9s. \r\n \r\nPour prolonger la soir\u00e9e, vous aurez le loisir de commander \u00e0 la carte des vins du Rh\u00f4ne (\u00e9galement de vignerons belges) au bar et des plats \u00e0 partager aux diff\u00e9rents stands food, accompagn\u00e9 d'un dj.\r\n \r\nEt vous repartirez \u00e0 coup s\u00fbr encore plus malin, gr\u00e2ce au mat\u00e9riel didactique mis \u00e0 votre disposition : connaissance de base\/r\u00e9gion\/diversit\u00e9\/c\u00e9pages principaux et cadeaux fra\u00eecheur au bar.\r\n \r\nPour s\u2019inscrire, consultez le site de la Gare maritime: https:\/\/www.garemaritime-foodmarket.be\/events-studio\/","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/535543.html"},"nl":{"name":"Ap\u00e9RHONE - afterwork","shortdescr":"Ap\u00e9RHONE time! Kom en proef de verscheidenheid die C\u00f4tes du Rh\u00f4ne te bieden heeft. Elke woensdag in van 18u tot 19u geven onze sommeliers hun beste tips tijdens de speeddate-sessies. Op hetzelfde moment kan je aan de bar verscheidene Rh\u00f4ne wijnen bestellen en genieten van de gerechtjes van de foodstands.","longdescr":"Gare Maritime ontpopt zich in juni elke woensdag tot een ontspannen afterwork-plek met \u2018Ap\u00e9RHONE\u2019. Proef er karaktervolle Rh\u00f4ne-wijnen vergezeld van gastronomische gerechten en laat je in een paar slokken transporteren naar Zuid-Frankrijk. Zowel amateurs als gevorderde oenofielen kunnen er terecht voor tips & tricks en - uiteraard - heerlijke proevertjes.\r\n\r\nWAT STAAT ER OP HET PROGRAMMA?\r\nWoensdag 15 juni: Duurzaamheid\r\nWoensdag 22 juni: Panache grenache\r\nWoensdag 29 juni: Het streven naar uitmuntendheid\r\nWoensdag 6 juli: Frisse witte en ros\u00e9 wijnen\r\n\r\nVan 18u tot 19u delen \u2018vliegende\u2019 sommeliers hun beste tips om picknicks, lunches of feesten op te fleuren. Sommeliers Vicky, Kristel, Anca, Lou, Salvator, Maxime en Stefanie maken deel uit van het \u2018OnTheRh\u00f4neAgain\u2019-team en delen hun oprechte, aanstekelijke enthousiasme en kennis tijdens enkele speeddate-sessies. Tegelijkertijd kan je aan de bar Rh\u00f4ne-wijnen bestellen van zowel Franse als Belgische wijnboeren \u00e9n smullen van de heerlijke gerechten van de verschillende eetstandjes.\r\n\r\nNEEM DEEL AAN EEN VAN DE APERH\u00d4NES!\r\nHoe schrijf je je in? Je kan je inschrijven op de site van Gare Maritime: https:\/\/www.garemaritime-foodmarket.be\/events-studio\/. Aarzel niet want het aantal plaatsen is beperkt tot 32 personen per sessie.\r\n\r\nEen deelname kost 30\u20ac per persoon voor 4 wijnen en 4 sharing gerechten van de food stands van Gare Maritime.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.garemaritime-foodmarket.be\/events-studio\/","email":"marie@alicebown.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/535543.html"},"en":{"name":"Ap\u00e9RHONE - afterwork","shortdescr":"Every Wednesday in June The Ap\u00e9RHONES disembark at the Gare Maritime in Brussels. Come and enjoy the variety that C\u00f4tes du Rh\u00f4ne wines has to offer from 6pm to 7pm. This in a speed dating version or a more relaxed version at the bar.","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/535543.html"},"de":{"name":"Ap\u00e9RHONE - afterwork at Gare Maritime","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/535543.html"},"it":{"name":"Ap\u00e9RHONE - afterwork at Gare Maritime","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/535543.html"},"sp":{"name":"Ap\u00e9RHONE - afterwork at Gare Maritime","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/535543.html"},"pt":{"name":"Ap\u00e9RHONE - afterwork at Gare Maritime","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/535543.html"},"cn":{"name":"Ap\u00e9RHONE - afterwork at Gare Maritime","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/535543.html"}},"place":{"id":258279,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La Gare Maritime : l'ancienne gare de fret devenue jungle urbaine, neutre en \u00e9nergie !\r\n\r\nElle offre le cadre id\u00e9al pour les \u00e9v\u00e9nements culturels innovants, les tournages de films ou s\u00e9ances photo, les march\u00e9s et foires, les lancements et promotions de produits. Les halles de la Gare Maritime ont \u00e9t\u00e9 transform\u00e9es en ville int\u00e9rieure. Elle comportera son propre food hall (\u00e0 partir de septembre 2021), des magasins exclusifs et des bureaux. Dans ce complexe, des espaces uniques et inspirants sont entrecoup\u00e9s de structures en bois chaleureuses. Le b\u00e2timent se pr\u00eate \u00e0 l'organisation de rencontres en petit comit\u00e9 ou de grands happenings. La nef monumentale, attrait architectural, est baign\u00e9e de lumi\u00e8re naturelle indirecte et offre suffisamment d'espace pour les activit\u00e9s int\u00e9rieures bien fr\u00e9quent\u00e9es.\r\nTout \u00e9v\u00e8nement dans la Gare Maritime sera un \u00e9v\u00e8nement \u00e9co-responsable. La durabilit\u00e9 \u00e9tait \u00e0 l'avant-plan pendant les r\u00e9novations du b\u00e2timent. L'\u00e9nergie renouvelable est produite sur place, utilisant la g\u00e9othermie et des panneaux photovolta\u00efques. Sur les promenades vertes bordant la nef centrale, des jardins \u00e0 th\u00e8me et des arbres \u00e0 haut tronc ont \u00e9t\u00e9 amen\u00e9s - comme si le parc voisin se faufile dans le b\u00e2timent. \r\nLa Gare Maritime, un lieu unique : attractif, novateur, ambitieux.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Picardstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Picardstraat","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Gare Maritime: van industrieel goederenstation tot energieneutrale urban jungle!\r\n\r\nDe Gare Maritime is de perfecte setting voor innovatieve, culturele evenementen, film- en fotoshoots, markten, beurzen, lanceringen en promoties. De historische stationshallen van de Gare Maritime zijn omgevormd tot overdekte stad, met foodhall (vanaf september 2021), exclusieve winkels en kantoren. Het gebouwencomplex biedt een waaier aan unieke, inspirerende ruimtes afgewisseld met warme houten volumes: perfect voor de organisatie van kleine en grootschalige happenings. D\u00e9 architecturale eyecatcher is de monumentale middenbeuk die baadt in indirect daglicht en over meer dan voldoende ruimte beschikt voor overdekte activiteiten met veel bezoekers.\r\nEen event in de Gare Maritime is een groen event. Tijdens de renovatie van het gebouw was duurzaamheid een speerpunt. Energie wordt ter plaatse hernieuwbaar opgewekt met geothermie en zonnepanelen. De groene wandelboulevards aan weerszijden van de middenbeuk zijn voorzien van thematuinen en hoogstammige bomen, alsof het aangrenzende park het gebouw binnenstroomt. Gare Maritime is een unieke plek: aantrekkelijk, vernieuwend en ambitieus.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Picard","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Gare Maritime - From industrial freight station to energy neutral urban jungle!\r\n\r\nIt is the perfect setting for innovative cultural events, film or photo shoots, trade shows, fairs, product launches or promotions. \r\nThe historic station concourse that was part of the Gare Maritime has been transformed into an indoor city with its own food hall (coming September 2021), exclusive shops and offices. Countless unique and inspiring areas and warm, wooden structures alternate in this building complex. It is perfectly suited to accommodate both small and major events. The monumental nave is a true architectural eye-catcher, bathed in indirect sunlight and providing ample space for well-attended indoor activities.\r\nAny event in the Gare Maritime is a green event. Sustainability has been key during the renovation works. The building generates its own energy from renewable sources, using geothermics and solar panels. The green boulevards on either side of the nave are lined with themed gardens and tall trees, as if the adjacent park found its way inside. \r\nThe Gare Maritime is a unique place - attractive, innovative and ambitious.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picar