"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"nl":["Theater"],"en":["Theatre"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"La\u00efka","shortdescr":"De l\u2019ironie \u00e0 la farce, de la satire politique \u00e0 la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 crue, Ascanio Celestini et David Murgia nous emm\u00e8nent dans un monde engag\u00e9, peupl\u00e9 de personnages attachants, de violences et de po\u00e9sie. Ce triptyque est propos\u00e9 dans le sens inverse de leur cr\u00e9ation.","longdescr":"Cette histoire se d\u00e9roule dans une banlieue quelconque, en p\u00e9riph\u00e9rie urbaine et humaine. Depuis la fen\u00eatre de son appartement o\u00f9 il vit avec Pierre, J\u00e9sus-Christ improbable observe le va-et-vient d\u2019un clochard migrant qui a install\u00e9 ses quartiers sur le parking du supermarch\u00e9 voisin, d\u2019une vieille femme, voisine de l\u2019immeuble, d\u2019une autre encore \u00e0 la t\u00eate embrouill\u00e9e et de la prostitu\u00e9e du quartier br\u00fble des pneus pour se r\u00e9chauffer. Et ce pauvre Christ, qui n\u2019est finalement pas un dieu mais un homme fait \u00ab de chair, de sang et de mots \u00bb, scrute \u00e0 distance depuis son petit paradis-studio, impuissant, ce bas monde r\u00e9duit \u00e0 1000 m2 de bitume.\r\n\r\nProduction et diffusion Charline Hamaite - Festival de Li\u00e8ge.","performers":"Texte et mise en sc\u00e8ne Ascanio Celestini - Avec David Murgia - Musique Maurice Blanchy (accord\u00e9on) - Voix-off Yolande Moreau - Traduction Patrick Bebi - Composition musicale Gianluca Casadei - R\u00e9gie Philippe Kariger.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lerideau.brussels\/","email":"billetterie@lerideau.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 737 16 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 737 16 01","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/514824.html"},"nl":{"name":"La\u00efka","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/514824.html"},"en":{"name":"La\u00efka","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/514824.html"},"de":{"name":"La\u00efka","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/514824.html"},"it":{"name":"La\u00efka","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/514824.html"},"sp":{"name":"La\u00efka","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/514824.html"},"pt":{"name":"La\u00efka","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/514824.html"},"cn":{"name":"La\u00efka","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/514824.html"}},"place":{"id":944,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Le Rideau","address_street_name":"Rue Goffart","address_street_number":"7 A","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@rideaudebruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.rideaudebruxelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 737 16 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 737 16 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Goffart, 7 A","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Fond\u00e9 le 17 mars 1943 par Claude Etienne, le Rideau de Bruxelles est la compagnie th\u00e9\u00e2trale la plus ancienne de la capitale, et m\u00eame du pays. Subventionn\u00e9 par la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonie-Bruxelles, n'a jusqu'ici connu que trois directeurs artistiques : son fondateur Claude Etienne jusqu'\u00e0 son d\u00e9c\u00e8s (1992), Jules-Henri Marchant, et depuis octobre 2007, Michael Delaunoy. Le Rideau privil\u00e9gie la cr\u00e9ation contemporaine en r\u00e9v\u00e9lant les \u00e9critures belges et internationales les plus singuli\u00e8res et les nouvelles pratiques sc\u00e9niques. Il se veut aussi lieu de m\u00e9moire active, en particulier \u00e0 travers une exploration renouvel\u00e9e du r\u00e9pertoire belge francophone du XX\u00e8me si\u00e8cle et d'oeuvres internationales fondatrices de la modernit\u00e9 \r\nLe Rideau f\u00eate lors de cette saison 2018\/2019, 75 ans d'audace et pr\u00e9sentera ses spectacles HORS LES MURS dans des th\u00e9\u00e2tres partenaires et amis durant les travaux de r\u00e9novation de sa maison de th\u00e9\u00e2tre situ\u00e9e rue Goffart \u00e0 Ixelles. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Le Rideau","address_street_name":"Goffartstraat","address_street_number":"7 A","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@rideaudebruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.rideaudebruxelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 737 16 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 737 16 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Goffartstraat, 7 A","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Gesticht op 17 maart 1943 door Claude Etienne is Le Rideau het oudste theatergezelschap van Brussel. Le Rideau streeft  ernaar een schouwburg te zijn voor hedendaagse - zowel Belgische als buitenlandse - auteurs. Sinds 2007 wordt het geleid door Michael Delaunoy, steeds trouw aan de ontdekkingsgeest dankzij een boeiende programmatie die de relatie tussen het intieme en de wereld onderzoekt. Le Rideau de Bruxelles is aan het werk in verschillende zalen zoals de Po\u00e8me 2, Theatre Marni, Atelier 210, Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National en Petit Varia.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Le Rideau","address_street_name":"Rue Goffart","address_street_number":"7 A","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@rideaudebruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.rideaudebruxelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 737 16 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 737 16 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Goffart, 7 A","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Le Rideau","address_street_name":"Rue Goffart","address_street_number":"7 A","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@rideaudebruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.rideaudebruxelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 737 16 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 737 16 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Goffart, 7 A","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Le Rideau","address_street_name":"Rue Goffart","address_street_number":"7 A","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@rideaudebruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.rideaudebruxelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 737 16 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 737 16 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Goffart, 7 A","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Le Rideau","address_street_name":"Rue Goffart","address_street_number":"7 A","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@rideaudebruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.rideaudebruxelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 737 16 01","phone_booking":"+32 2 737 16 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1