re)\r\n\u2022 Onrust (electro coldwave one woman show)\r\n\u2022 The Zombie Crows (psychobilly made in Hellgium)\r\n\u2022 Easy Ego (punk garage)\r\n\u2022 Baka (punch rock)\r\n\u2022 Slovenians (punk rock)\r\n\u2022 Silicon Tree (indie pop rock)\r\n\u2022 Gut Model (post-punk indie bleep-funk)\r\n\r\n\u2022 Johnny Flamingo\r\nEt si Toots Thielemans n'avait pas coup\u00e9 ses ongles avant de prendre Sesamestreet et que John Terra n'\u00e9tait qu'un embryon, le Flamingo trouverait-il l'inspiration ailleurs pour correspondre \u00e0 l'ambition de l'homme ordinaire de la rue ?\r\nwww.johnnyflamingo.bandcamp.com\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=duXjBVVPHmo\r\n\r\n\u2022 Onrust\r\n'Techno tantrique pour agit\u00e9s' (rhythmic industrial meets drony psychedelica)\r\nwww.soundcloud.com\/onrust1979\r\nwww.facebook.com\/onrust79\r\nwww.facebook.com\/onrust79\/videos\/464482661812234\r\n\r\n\u2022 The Zombie Crows\r\nDe la dynamite gonfl\u00e9 un max, saupoudr\u00e9 d'un cocktail explosif compos\u00e9 d\u2019\u00e9nergie rare, de hargne, de puissance, le tout ficel\u00e9 solidement par du punch plein les jambes ainsi que la passion plein les rythmes\u2026\r\nwww.facebook.com\/The-Zombie-Crows-583536048458232\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=C8K1v2qbh6U\r\n\r\n\u2022 Easy Ego\r\nDu fin fond de l'enfer du Rock'n'Roll, Easy Ego exsude son chemin d'un enregistreur cassette pourri vers le public. En mission pour ramener la musique la plus immorale, simpliste, grasse dans les clubs, le groupe est compos\u00e9 par quelques personnages embl\u00e9matiques de la sc\u00e8ne underground bruxelloise.\r\nhttps:\/\/drinkanddriverecords.bandcamp.com\/album\/spit-on-your-bitch\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=DSIGKGLUlTM\r\n\r\n\u2022 Baka\r\nBaka : Expression utilis\u00e9e au Japon pour d\u00e9signer un imb\u00e9cile; groupe belge \"Punch-Rock-Alternatif-Tragi-Comique-Expressionniste\" francophone !\r\nwww.soundcloud.com\/user-994362021\r\nwww.facebook.com\/BAKAbruxelles\r\nwww.facebook.com\/BAKAbruxelles\/videos\/1274851052670977\r\n\r\n\u2022 Slovenians\r\nGroupe punk rock bruxellois actif depuis 2012. Connus pour leurs shows intenses et leur frontman fulgurant, les Slovenians m\u00e9langent des influences punk telles que The Dead Kennedy's, The New Bomb Turks et Minor Threat avec des doses fougueuses de rock\u2019n\u2019roll, de blues et de garage-rock.\r\nwww.slovenians.be\r\nwww.facebook.com\/slovenians\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=aCtuBEAhuBo\r\n\r\n\u2022 Silicon Tree\r\nAlternant entre \u00e9nergie et sensibilit\u00e9, et entre sonorit\u00e9s \u00e9lectriques et acoustiques, la musique de Silicon Tree repose sur des textes accrocheurs et des m\u00e9lodies d'une grande efficacit\u00e9. Influences: Radiohead (premiers albums), Pixies, dEUS, Placebo, Last Shadow Puppets, Travis\u2026\r\nwww.silicontreemusic.com\r\nwww.facebook.com\/Silicon-Tree-268473056496477\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=3Q8xaKQL39g\r\n\r\n\u2022 Gut Model (post-punk indie bleep-funk)\r\nGut Model fait le grand \u00e9cart entre garage poisseux et clubbing synth\u00e9tique. Des textures bleep funky et des voix tordues nous entra\u00eenent dans un d\u00e9lire intelligible.\r\nwww.facebook.com\/gutmodelband\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=EPBeaMvkhvM\r\n\r\n+ DJ Erectionocturn\r\nwww.facebook.com\/Soir\u00e9e-Boucan-101720271290605\r\nwww.facebook.com\/101720271290605\/videos\/232067911358436\r\n\r\n+ DJ Armand D\u00e9goutant (makeTROUBLE!)\r\nwww.facebook.com\/groups\/www.maketrouble.net\r\nwww.facebook.com\/MakeTrouble-Livingdeadpunks-107778292620818\r\n\r\n+ DJ Dr. Green (Rat Rock \/ Harelbeke Punkfestrival Belgium)\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=XjpA1SV7JD\r\nThis time Dr. Green goes punk !\r\n\r\n> Pr\u00e9vente 10 \u20ac (quantit\u00e9 limit\u00e9e) https:\/\/be.ticketgang.eu\/orgFrameSaleNew.php?org=363754&event=112942\r\n> A l\u2019entr\u00e9e 15 \u20ac\r\n\r\nPowered by Ricky Billy","performers":"Johnny Flamingo, Onrust, The Zombie Crows, Baka, Easy Ego, Slovenians, Silicon Tree, Gut Model","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/events\/951166282232011","email":"herman@maketrouble.net","phone_contact":"+32 495 31 71 00","phone_booking":"+32 495 31 71 00","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/532090.html"},"nl":{"name":"Punk Chicken Fest","shortdescr":"Punk show for the world music day \u2022 Belgian bands","longdescr":"Punk show for the world music day \u2022 Belgian bands\r\nRicky Billy, figuur van de Brusselse undergroundscene, biedt ons een festival aan met een programma van Belgische rock-punk-indie-pop-electro-wave-psychobilly groepen voor de dag van het muziekfestival. Ook zullen er drie dj's aanwezig zijn om je te laten dansen.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Johnny Flamingo (punk - garagecore)\r\n\u2022 Onrust (electro coldwave one woman show)\r\n\u2022 The Zombie Crows (psychobilly made in Hellgium)\r\n\u2022 Easy Ego (punk garage)\r\n\u2022 Baka (punch rock)\r\n\u2022 Slovenians (punk rock)\r\n\u2022 Silicon Tree (indie pop rock)\r\n\u2022 Gut Model (post-punk indie bleep-funk)\r\n\r\n\u2022 Johnny Flamingo\r\nWat als Toots Thielemans zijn nagels niet had geknipt voordat hij Sesamstraat ging opnemen en John Terra niet meer dan potgrond was, zou de Flamingo dan nog ergens anders inspiratie vinden om de ambitie van de gewone man in de straat te evenaren ?\r\nwww.johnnyflamingo.bandcamp.com\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=duXjBVVPHmo\r\n\r\n\u2022 Onrust\r\n'Tantrische techno voor de rustelozen' (ritmische industrial meets drony psychedelica)\r\nwww.facebook.com\/onrust79\r\nwww.soundcloud.com\/onrust1979\r\nwww.facebook.com\/onrust79\/videos\/464482661812234\r\n\r\n\u2022 The Zombie Crows\r\nDynamiet tot het maximum opgeblazen, besprenkeld met een explosieve cocktail samengesteld uit zeldzame energie, agressiviteit, kracht, allemaal stevig aan elkaar verbonden met punch vol benen en passie vol ritmes...\r\nwww.facebook.com\/The-Zombie-Crows-583536048458232 (1571-46)\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=C8K1v2qbh6U\r\n\r\n\u2022 Easy Ego\r\nVanuit de diepten van de Rock'n'Roll-hel baant Easy Ego zich vanuit een rotte cassetterecorder een weg naar het publiek. Op een missie om de meest immorele, simplistische, olieachtige muziek terug naar de clubs te brengen, bestaat de groep uit enkele emblematische personages uit de Brusselse undergroundscene.\r\nhttps:\/\/drinkanddriverecords.bandcamp.com\/album\/spit-on-your-bitch\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=DSIGKGLUlTM\r\n\r\n\u2022 Baka\r\nBaka: uitdrukking die in Japan wordt gebruikt om een \u200b\u200bdwaas aan te duiden; Belgische groep \"Punch-Rock-Alternative-Tragi-Comic-Expressionist\" Franstalig!\r\nwww.facebook.com\/BAKAbruxelles\r\nwww.soundcloud.com\/user-994362021\r\nwww.facebook.com\/BAKAbruxelles\/videos\/1274851052670977\r\n\r\n\u2022 Slovenians\r\nEen Belgische punkrockband uit Brussel, actief sinds 2012. De Slovenians, bekend om hun intense shows en zinderende frontman, versmelten punkinvloeden als The Dead Kennedy's, The New Bomb Turks en Minor Threat met pittige doses rock 'n roll, blues en garagerock.\r\nwww.slovenians.be\r\nwww.facebook.com\/slovenians\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=aCtuBEAhuBo\r\n\r\n\u2022 Silicon Tree\r\nAfwisselend tussen energie en gevoeligheid, en tussen elektrische en akoestische geluiden, is de muziek van Silicon Tree gebaseerd op pakkende teksten en zeer effectieve melodie\u00ebn. Invloeden: Radiohead (eerste albums), Pixies, dEUS, Placebo, Last Shadow Puppets, Travis\u2026\r\nwww.silicontreemusic.com\r\nwww.facebook.com\/Silicon-Tree-268473056496477\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=3Q8xaKQL39g\r\n\r\n\u2022 Gut Model\r\nGut Model  doet de splitsingen tussen sticky garage en synthetisch clubbing. Bleep funky texturen en vervormde stemmen leiden ons naar een verstaanbaar delirium.\r\nwww.facebook.com\/gutmodelband\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=EPBeaMvkhvM\r\n\r\n+ DJ Erectionocturn\r\nwww.facebook.com\/Soir\u00e9e-Boucan-101720271290605\r\nwww.facebook.com\/101720271290605\/videos\/232067911358436\r\n\r\n+ DJ Armand D\u00e9goutant (makeTROUBLE! \/ LivingDeadPunks)\r\nwww.facebook.com\/groups\/www.maketrouble.net\r\nwww.facebook.com\/MakeTrouble-Livingdeadpunks-107778292620818\r\n\r\n+ DJ Dr. Green (Rat Rock \/ Harelbeke Punkfestrival Belgium )\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=XjpA1SV7JD\r\nThis time Dr. Green goes punk !\r\n\r\n> Voorverkoop 10 \u20ac (Beperkte hoeveelheid): https:\/\/be.ticketgang.eu\/orgFrameSaleNew.php?org=363754&event=112942\r\n> Bij de ingang 15 \u20ac\r\n\r\nPowered by Ricky Billy","performers":"Johnny Flamingo, Onrust, The Zombie Crows, Baka, Easy Ego, Slovenians, Silicon Tree, Gut Model","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/532090.html"},"en":{"name":"Punk Chicken Fest","shortdescr":"Punk show for the world music day \u2022 Belgian bands","longdescr":"Punk show for the world music day \u2022 Belgian bands\r\nRicky Billy, figure of the Brussels underground scene, offers us a festival with a program of Belgian rock-punk-indie-pop-electro-wave-nowave-psychobilly groups for the day of the music festival. Three DJs will also be there to make you dance.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Johnny Flamingo (punk - garagecore)\r\n\u2022 Onrust (electro coldwave one woman show)\r\n\u2022 The Zombie Crows (psychobilly made in Hellgium)\r\n\u2022 Easy Ego (punk garage)\r\n\u2022 Baka (punch rock)\r\n\u2022 Slovenians (punk rock)\r\n\u2022 Silicon Tree (indie pop rock)\r\n\u2022 Gut Model (post-punk indie bleep-funk)\r\n\r\n\u2022 Johnny Flamingo\r\nWhat if Toots Thielemans hadn't clipped his nails before taking up Sesamestreet and John Terra was just potting soil, would the Flamingo find inspiration elsewhere to match the ambition of the common man in the street ?\r\nwww.johnnyflamingo.bandcamp.com\r\nwww.facebook.com\/groups\/3127315880616798\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=duXjBVVPHmo\r\n\r\n\u2022 Onrust\r\n'Tantric techno for the restless' (rhythmic industrial meets drony psychedelica)\r\nwww.soundcloud.com\/onrust1979\r\nwww.facebook.com\/onrust79\r\nwww.facebook.com\/onrust79\/videos\/464482661812234\r\n\r\n\u2022 The Zombie Crows\r\nDynamite inflated to the max, sprinkled with an explosive cocktail composed of rare energy, aggressiveness, power, all tied together solidly with punch full of the legs as well with passion full of rhythms...\r\nwww.facebook.com\/The-Zombie-Crows-583536048458232\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=C8K1v2qbh6U\r\n\r\n\u2022 Easy Ego\r\nFrom the depths of Rock'n'Roll hell, Easy Ego exudes its way from a rotten cassette recorder to the public. On a mission to bring the most immoral, simplistic, oily music back to the clubs, the group is made up of a few emblematic characters from the Brussels underground scene.\r\nhttps:\/\/drinkanddriverecords.bandcamp.com\/album\/spit-on-your-bitch\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=DSIGKGLUlTM\r\n\r\n\u2022 Baka\r\nBaka: Expression used in Japan to designate a fool; Belgian group \"Punch-Rock-Alternative-Tragi-Comic-Expressionist\" French-speaking!\r\nwww.soundcloud.com\/user-994362021\r\nwww.facebook.com\/BAKAbruxelles\r\nwww.facebook.com\/BAKAbruxelles\/videos\/1274851052670977\r\n\r\n\u2022 Slovenians\r\nA Belgian punk rock band from Brussels, active since 2012. Known for their blistering delivery and firecracker frontman, Slovenians melds punk influences such as The Dead Kennedy\u2019s, The New Bomb Turks and Minor Threat with feisty doses of rock \u2019n roll, blues and garage rock.\r\nwww.slovenians.be\r\nwww.facebook.com\/slovenians\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=aCtuBEAhuBo\r\n\r\n\u2022 Silicon Tree\r\nAlternating between energy and sensitivity, and between electric and acoustic sounds, Silicon Tree's music is based on catchy lyrics and highly effective melodies. Influences: Radiohead (first albums), Pixies, dEUS, Placebo, Last Shadow Puppets, Travis\u2026\r\nwww.silicontreemusic.com\r\nwww.facebook.com\/Silicon-Tree-268473056496477\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=3Q8xaKQL39g\r\n\r\n\u2022 Gut Model\r\nGut Model makes the splits between sticky garage and synthetic clubbing. Bleep funky textures and twisted voices lead us into an intelligible delirium.\r\nwww.facebook.com\/gutmodelband\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=EPBeaMvkhvM\r\n\r\n+ DJ Erectionocturn\r\nwww.facebook.com\/Soir\u00e9e-Boucan-101720271290605\r\nwww.facebook.com\/101720271290605\/videos\/232067911358436\r\n\r\n+ DJ Armand D\u00e9goutant (makeTROUBLE!)\r\nwww.facebook.com\/groups\/www.maketrouble.net\r\nwww.facebook.com\/MakeTrouble-Livingdeadpunks-107778292620818\r\n\r\n+ DJ Dr. Green (Rat Rock \/ Harelbeke Punkfestrival)\r\nwww.youtube.com\/watch?v=XjpA1SV7JD\r\nThis time Dr. Green goes punk !\r\n\r\n> Presale 10 \u20ac (Limited quantity) https:\/\/be.ticketgang.eu\/orgFrameSaleNew.php?org=363754&event=112942\r\n> Doors 15 \u20ac\r\n\r\nPowered by Ricky Billy","performers":"Johnny Flamingo, Onrust, The Zombie Crows, Baka, Easy Ego, Slovenians, Silicon Tree, Gut Model","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/532090.html"},"de":{"name":"Punk Chicken Fest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/532090.html"},"it":{"name":"Punk Chicken Fest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/532090.html"},"sp":{"name":"Punk Chicken Fest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/532090.html"},"pt":{"name":"Punk Chicken Fest","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact