 l\u2019apr\u00e8s midi.\r\nNos embl\u00e9matiques DJ Daddy-K et Nicky Sanchez cl\u00f4tureront bien s\u00fbr cette belle journ\u00e9e !\r\nEvere gets green : cette ann\u00e9e on fait le tri \u00e0 Evere en f\u00eate","longdescr":"ANIMATIONS\r\n10:00 > 18:00 Brocante\r\n11:00 > 12:00 Harmonie st cecilia ( notre-dame)\r\n12:00 > 13:00 Harmonie de ster ( notre-dame)\r\n12:00 > 19:00 Ch\u00e2teaux gonflables\r\n12:00 > 19:00 Skate\r\n12:00 > 19:00 Simulateurs de course\r\n12:00 > 19:00 Grimages\r\n12:00 > 19:00 Photobooth\r\n12:00 > 01:30 Stands forains\r\n13:00 > 14:00 Fanfare mobile\r\n14:00 > 17:00 Echassier, sculpture de ballon\r\n17:00 > 20:00 Bulles \u00e0 savon\r\n21:30 > 22:00 Echassier, lumineux\r\n22:30 > 23:00 Echassier, lumineux\r\n.......................................\r\nCONCERTS\r\n13:45 Opening\r\n14:00 Moi et le Theo\r\n15:30 Open Mic\r\n17:00 Manu Lanvin and the devil blues\r\n18:30 Graaf!\r\n20:00 Thierry Luthers chante Johnny\r\n22:00 Boogie Boy and the Woogies \r\n23:00 Feu d\u2019artifice\r\n23:30 Dj daddy-k & Nicky Sanchez","performers":"Moi et le Theo, Manu Lanvin, Graaf!, Thierry luthers, Boogie Boy and the Woogies, Dj daddy-k & Nicky Sanchez","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 247 63 77","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/534203.html"},"nl":{"name":"Evere feest","shortdescr":"Kom samen met ons feesten op zaterdag 18 juni voor het gemeentehuis. Op het programma : gratis concerten en animaties gedurende de hele namiddag. DJ DADDY-K en Nicky Sanchez sluiten zoals gewoonlijk deze mooie dag af !\r\n[10:49] VERLEYSEN Daisy\r\nEvere gets green : dit jaar zullen we sorteren op Evere feest","longdescr":"ANIMATIES\r\n10:00 > 18:00 Rommelmarkt\r\n11:00 > 12:00 Harmonie st cecilia (onze lieve vrouw)\r\n12:00 > 13:00 Harmonie de ster (onze lieve vrouw)\r\n12:00 > 19:00 Springkasteel\r\n12:00 > 19:00 Skate\r\n12:00 > 19:00 race simulator\r\n12:00 > 19:00 Schminkstand\r\n12:00 > 19:00 Photobooth\r\n12:00 > 01:30 kermiskramen\r\n13:00 > 14:00 bewegende fanfare\r\n14:00 > 17:00 Steltloper, ballonplooier\r\n17:00 > 20:00 Zeepbellen\r\n21:30 > 22:00 steltloper, lichtgevend\r\n22:30 > 23:00 steltloper, lichtgevend\r\n.......................................\r\nCONCERTS\r\n13:45 Opening\r\n14:00 Ik en den Theo\r\n15:30 Open Mic\r\n17:00 Manu Lanvin and the devil blues\r\n18:30 Graaf!\r\n20:00 Thierry Luthers chante Johnny\r\n22:00 Boogie Boy and the Woogies\r\n23:00 Vuurwerk\r\n23:30 Dj daddy-k & Nicky Sanchez","performers":"Ik en den Theo, Manu Lanvin, Graaf!, Thierry luthers, Boogie Boy and the Woogies, Dj daddy-k & Nicky Sanchez","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.evere.brussels","email":"events@evere.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/534203.html"},"en":{"name":"Evere en f\u00eate","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/534203.html"},"de":{"name":"Evere en f\u00eate","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/534203.html"},"it":{"name":"Evere en f\u00eate","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/534203.html"},"sp":{"name":"Evere en f\u00eate","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/534203.html"},"pt":{"name":"Evere en f\u00eate","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"