0e0 la d\u00e9couverte des plantes sauvages comestibles (\u00e9t\u00e9)","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Balade \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte des plantes sauvages comestibles (\u00e9t\u00e9)","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Balade \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte des plantes sauvages comestibles (\u00e9t\u00e9)","copyright":null}}},{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/a4ad31445321a888ce17e42f0701f8a4d9191f86.jpg","width":768,"height":720,"ratio":1.07,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Balade \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte des plantes sauvages comestibles (\u00e9t\u00e9)","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Balade \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte des plantes sauvages comestibles (\u00e9t\u00e9)","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Balade \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte des plantes sauvages comestibles (\u00e9t\u00e9)","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-06-19","doors":null,"start":"10:00:00","end":"12:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-06-19","doors":null,"start":"13:00:00","end":"15:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-06-19","doors":null,"start":"16:00:00","end":"18:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":9}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":["exterior"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-03-18T04:35:03+01:00","published_at":"2022-03-17T17:42:53+01:00","backoffice_id":249889,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":534713,"date_start":"2022-06-19","date_end":"2022-06-19","date_next":"2022-06-19","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours"}},"others":{"list":[252],"translations":{"fr":["Bruxelles pour les enfants"],"nl":["Brussel voor kinderen"],"en":["Brussels for kids"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Family Day: Op\u00e9ration exploration","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Le palais t\u2019accueille en mode festif ! Les aventuri\u00e8res, b\u00e2tisseurs, arch\u00e9ologues, historiennes et explorateurs de tous poils pourront plonger sous terre et s\u2019immerger dans le pass\u00e9 prestigieux de Bruxelles et son palais, \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte des myst\u00e8res qui font son histoire.\r\n\r\nOp\u00e9ration exploration\r\nPr\u00eate pour l\u2019aventure ? Chausse tes bottes ou tes baskets, prends ta lampe de poche et viens d\u00e9couvrir les parties cach\u00e9es du site arch\u00e9ologique (r\u00e9serve, sortie de secours\u2026). R\u00e9veille l\u2019aventuri\u00e8re qui est en toi !\r\n\r\nInfos pratiques :\r\nPrix : normal\/individuel | 10 \u20ac. Groupe\/senior (+15 personnes, +65) | 8\u20ac. R\u00e9duit | 5\u20ac.\r\nEntr\u00e9e gratuite jusqu\u2019\u00e0 18 ans, pour les enfants accompagn\u00e9s de leurs parents. Activit\u00e9s comprises dans le prix d\u2019entr\u00e9e.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/534713.html"},"nl":{"name":"Family Day: Verkenningsmissie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Het paleis ontvangt je in feeststemming! Al wie houdt van avontuur, bouwen, archeologie, geschiedenis en speuren kan de ondergrond induiken en zich onderdompelen in het prestigieuze verleden van Brussel en zijn paleis. Zo ontdek je de mysteries die deel uitmaken van de geschiedenis van de stad.\r\n\r\nVerkenningsmissie\r\nKlaar voor avontuur? Trek je laarzen of sneakers aan, neem een zaklamp en ontdek de verborgen delen van de archeologische site (opslagplaats, nooduitgang, enzovoort). Maak de avonturier in je wakker!\r\n\r\nPraktische informatie:\r\nnormaal\/individueel | \u20ac 10. Groep\/senior (+ 15 personen, + 65) | \u20ac 8.\r\nKortingstarief | \u20ac 5. Gratis toegang tot 18 jaar, voor kinderen onder begeleiding van hun ouders.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":"+32 2 500 45 54","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/534713.html"},"en":{"name":"Family Day: Operation Exploration","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"The palace welcomes you in a festive atmosphere! Your budding adventurers, builders, archaeologists, historians and explorers can dive underground and immerse themselves in the prestigious past of Brussels and its palace, discovering the mysteries that make its history.\r\n\r\nOperation Exploration\r\nReady for an adventure? Wearing boots or trainers and equipped with a torch, come and discover the hidden parts of the archaeological site (storeroom, emergency exit...). Wake up the adventurer in you!\r\n\r\nPractical information:\r\nPrice: regular ticket - \u20ac10. Groups of 15+ people and seniors (+65 years) - \u20ac8.\r\nConcessions - \u20ac5\r\nUnder 18s accompanied with their parents - free.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/534713.html"},"de":{"name":"Family Day: Verkenningsmissie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/534713.html"},"it":{"name":"Family Day: Verkenningsmissie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/534713.html"},"sp":{"name":"Family Day: Verkenningsmissie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/534713.html"},"pt":{"name":"Family Day: Verkenningsmissie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/534713.html"},"cn":{"name":"Family Day: Verkenningsmissie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/534713.html"}},"place":{"id":258195,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Autrefois, l\u2019impressionnant palais du Coudenberg dominait la ville de Bruxelles. Charles Quint et d\u2019autres souverains parmi les plus puissants que l\u2019Europe ait connus ont habit\u00e9 cette r\u00e9sidence princi\u00e8re du 12e au 18e si\u00e8cle, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce qu\u2019un terrible incendie la d\u00e9truise \u00e0 jamais. Les ruines de ce palais ont disparu pendant de nombreuses ann\u00e9es dans les sous-sols. Aujourd\u2019hui, ces vestiges forment un site arch\u00e9ologique enchanteur constitu\u00e9 d\u2019un r\u00e9seau de salles et de passages souterrains.\r\n \r\nAu cours de votre visite, vous d\u00e9couvrirez les b\u00e2timents principaux du palais et vous fl\u00e2nerez dans la rue Isabelle, qui est aujourd\u2019hui souterraine. Dans le mus\u00e9e du Coudenberg, qui est abrit\u00e9 dans l\u2019h\u00f4tel d\u2019Hoogstraeten, sont expos\u00e9es les plus belles d\u00e9couvertes arch\u00e9ologiques effectu\u00e9es lors des diff\u00e9rentes campagnes de fouilles men\u00e9es sur le site du Coudenberg\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Coudenbergpaleis","address_street_name":"Paleizenplein","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Paleizenplein, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Ooit werd Brussel gedomineerd door het reusachtige Coudenbergpaleis. Keizer Karel en het kruim van de Europese adel verbleven er tussen de twaalfde en de achttiende eeuw. Tot het noodlot toesloeg en een brand het prachtige gebouw verwoestte. Vele resten bleven echter intact en verdwenen ... onder de grond. Nu is het een betoverende archeologische site, een netwerk van gewelfde gangen, zalen en verborgen kamers.\r\n \r\nTijdens een bezoek ontdek je de hoofdgebouwen van het paleis en flaneer je door de Isabellastraat, die nu onder de grond ligt! In het museum van de Coudenberg, dat in het bovengrondse Hof van Hoogstraeten ondergebracht is, kan je de mooiste archeologische voorwerpen bewonderen die in de loop van de verschillende opgravingswerken op de Coudenbergsite werden ontdekt.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Coudenberg Palace","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Once upon a time, the Coudenberg Palace towered over the city of Brussels. Charles V and many other of the most powerful rulers ever to reign in Europe made this princely residence their home between the 12th and 18th centuries, until it was consumed by a terrible fire.  Every trace of this prestigious palace simply disappeared underground for many years. Today, however, these ruins constitute a fascinating archeological site incorporating a network of underground passages and chambers.\r\n \r\nWhen you visit it you can explore the principal buildings of the palace and enjoy a stroll along the Rue Isabelle, which is now underground.  In the Coudenberg Museum, located in Hoogstraeten House, the finest of the archeological discoveries made during the various excavations of the Coudenberg site are displayed.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Coudenberg Palast","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ein unterirdischer Parcours, in dessen Verlauf Sie die \u00dcberreste des Palastes von Charles V. entdecken k\u00f6nnen. Seit dem Mittelalter \u00fcberragt eine f\u00fcrstliche Residenz auf dem Coudenberg die Stadt Br\u00fcssel. Das architektonische Ensemble, das sich seit dem 12. Jahrhundert immer wieder weiterentwickelt hat, gilt als einer der sch\u00f6nsten Pal\u00e4ste Europas und eine der wichtigsten Residenzen von Karl V. Dieses prestigetr\u00e4chtige Geb\u00e4ude wurde bei einem Brand im Februar 1731 schwer besch\u00e4digt. Vierzig Jahre sp\u00e4ter wurden die Ruinen des Palasts dem Erdboden gleichgemacht, um Platz f\u00fcr den Place Royale zu machen. Die \u00dcberreste dieses Geb\u00e4udes bilden heute die arch\u00e4ologische St\u00e4tte des Coudenberg. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Coudenberg Palazzo","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"\"Il sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\tSito Archeologico di Coudenbergl sito...\"\r\n\r\nIl sito archeologico di Coudenberg vi svela un percorso sotterraneo e un museo dedicati a Carlo V sulla Place de Palais a Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nSito Archeologico di Coudenberg\r\n\r\nl sito riunisce vestigia dell'antico palazzo di Bruxelles, della residenza di Hoogstraeten e della Rue Isabelle. Un'affascinante passeggiata che vi conduce sotto il pav\u00e9 della place Royale, alla scoperta dei resti del Palazzo di Coudenberg che fu una delle residenze principali di Carlo V. \u00a0\r\n\r\nMuseo del Coudenberg\r\nil museo vi invita a scoprire un'esposizione permanente di oggetti trovati durante gli scavi effettuati sul sito negli ultimi 25 anni. potete combinare la vostra visita con quella del Museo BELvue.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Coudenberg Palacio","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"En el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas....\r\n\r\nEn el emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico de Coudenberg encontrar\u00e1s un recorrido subterr\u00e1neo y un museo dedicado al Palacio Carlos V, en la Place des Palais de Bruselas.\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg\r\n\r\nEl emplazamiento arqueol\u00f3gico Coudenberg est\u00e1 compuesto de vestigios del antiguo Palacio de Bruselas, del Hotel Hoogstraeten y de la Rue Isabelle.\u00a0Este fascinante paseo te llevar\u00e1 a descubrir los <b>vestigios del Palacio Coudenberg<\/b>, que fue una de las residencias de Carlos V.\r\n\r\nMuseo Coudenberg\r\n\r\nInstalado en los vestigios del antiguo Hotel de Hoogstraeten, el Museo Coudenberg  te invita a descubrir una <b>exposici\u00f3n permanente<\/b> de objetos hallados durante las distintas <b>excavaciones arqueol\u00f3gicas<\/b> realizadas los \u00faltimos 25 a\u00f1os.\u00a0Podr\u00e1s combinar tu visita del Coudenberg con la del Museo BELvue.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.coudenberg.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 500 45 54","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place des Palais, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Palais du Coudenberg","address_street_name":"Place des Palais","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@coudenberg.brussels","website":"htt