en the last sunday of the month from 10:00 to 13:00"}}],"prices":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":["exterior"],"is_part_of":"V\u00e9lo tourisme","accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-31T20:05:03+02:00","published_at":"2022-01-24T13:43:30+01:00","backoffice_id":246002,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.20966378445954},{"id":522470,"date_start":"2022-06-26","date_end":"2022-06-26","date_next":"2022-06-26","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours"}},"others":{"list":[109],"translations":{"fr":["Espaces verts"],"nl":["Groene zones"],"en":["Green spaces"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Les plantes m\u00e9dicinales","shortdescr":"(F: 14h): Venez d\u00e9couvrir, voir, toucher, sentir et go\u00fbter ces plantes qui nous font du bien. Le Scheutbos offre une v\u00e9ritable pharmacie \u00e0 ciel ouvert. Mais quelles sont ces plantes qui agissent sur notre sant\u00e9 ? Et par quels m\u00e9canismes ? R\u00e9servation et masque obligatoires","longdescr":"Soigner sa prostate, renforcer le foie, diminuer la tension art\u00e9rielle, r\u00e9guler les menstruations, r\u00e9duire les inflammations, combattre les infections et bien d\u2019autres choses encore sont possibles avec les plantes qui poussent au Scheutbos. Depuis une bonne d\u00e9cennie, la science a compris et valid\u00e9 - ou invalid\u00e9 \u2013 certains savoirs ancestraux. Cette visite vous permettra d\u2019appr\u00e9hender le fonctionnement et les enjeux d\u2019une dizaine de plantes m\u00e9dicinales, embl\u00e9matiques de nos r\u00e9gions.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.scheutbos.be\/","email":"scheutbos@yahoo.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/522470.html"},"nl":{"name":"Les plantes m\u00e9dicinales","shortdescr":"(NL: 9u30) Kom en zie, ruik, raak aan en proef die planten die goed voor onze gezondheid zijn. Het Scheutbos is een echte openlucht apotheek. Hoe planten de menselijke gezondheid be\u00efnvloeden? Wat zijn de mechanismen ervan?","longdescr":"De prostaat genezen, de lever versterken, de bloeddruk verlagen, de menstruatie reguleren, een ontsteking matigen, de infecties bestrijden en tal van andere aandoeningen kunnen met de planten die in het scheutbos groeien behandeld worden. Sinds een tiental jaren heeft het wetenschappelijk onderzoek de traditionele kennis over geneeskrachtige planten bevestigd \u2026 of ontkend. Dit bezoek aan het Scheutbos biedt je de gelegenheid om de werking van een tiental emblematische planten uit onze streken te ontdekken.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/522470.html"},"en":{"name":"Les plantes m\u00e9dicinales","shortdescr":"in french or dutch","longdescr":"in french or dutch","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/522470.html"},"de":{"name":"Les plantes m\u00e9dicinales","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/522470.html"},"it":{"name":"Les plantes m\u00e9dicinales","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_con