019architecture Art D\u00e9co","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/530808.html"}},"place":{"id":248760,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Fondation Boghossian \u2013 Villa Empain","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt, 67","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"La Villa Empain, remarquable t\u00e9moin de l\u2019architecture Art d\u00e9co, abrite la Fondation Boghossian, centre d\u2019art et de dialogue entre les culture d\u2019Orient et d\u2019Occident. Une programmation riche et vari\u00e9e de performances, conf\u00e9rences, \u00e9v\u00e9nements festifs, rencontres internationales, visites guid\u00e9es et activit\u00e9s pour enfants est propos\u00e9e au public.","description_print":"Dans la prestigieuse villa Empain, cette fondation vise \u00e0 d\u00e9velopper \u00e0 Bruxelles un centre de cr\u00e9ation et de dialogue entre l\u2019Orient et l\u2019Occident. Une programmation vari\u00e9e d\u2019activit\u00e9s culturelles est pr\u00e9vue pour le public.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOGHOSSIAN FOUNDATION - VILLA EMPAIN","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Boghossian Stichting - Villa Empain","address_street_name":"Franklin Rooseveltlaan","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Franklin Rooseveltlaan, 67","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Een centrum voor kunst en dialoog tussen de oosterse en de westerse cultuur . E\u00e9n van de belangrijkste doelstellingen van de Boghossian-stichting is het oprichten van een centrum van culturele en artistieke dialoog tussen het Oosten en het Westen. Haar uitvalsbasis is de prestigieuze villa Empain, waarin ze allerhande culturele activiteiten organiseert voor het publiek.","description_print":"Een centrum voor kunst en dialoog tussen de oosterse en de westerse cultuur . E\u00e9n van de belangrijkste doelstellingen van de Boghossian-stichting is het oprichten van een centrum van culturele en artistieke dialoog tussen het Oosten en het Westen. Haar uitvalsbasis is de prestigieuze villa Empain, waarin ze allerhande culturele activiteiten organiseert voor het publiek.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOGHOSSIAN FOUNDATION - VILLA EMPAIN","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Boghossian Foundation - Villa Empain","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt, 67","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"A villa in Art Deco style which is now home to the Boghossian Foundation: a centre for art and dialogue between Oriental and Western culture.\r\n\r\n  ","description_print":"A villa in Art Deco style which is now home to the Boghossion Foundation: a centre for art and dialogue between Oriental and Western culture.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOGHOSSIAN FOUNDATION - VILLA EMPAIN","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Boghossian-Stiftung \u2013 Villa Empain","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt, 67","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Die Anfang der 1930er-Jahre erbaute Villa Empain ist ein bemerkenswertes Beispiel der Art D\u00e9co-Architektur. Sie geh\u00f6rte einst einer der reichsten Familien Europas, die heute fast vollst\u00e4ndig verarmt ist. Die Villa steht seit 2007 unter Denkmalschutz.\r\n\r\nJugendstil, Art D\u00e9co und Moderne: Ihr Architekt Michel Polak (1885\u20131948) kombinierte Zierelemente des Br\u00fcsseler Jugendstils mit Formen der Moderne: Ein Gesamtkunstwerk, bei dem Formen und edle Materialien der eleganten Ausstattung untrennbar zu einer ungew\u00f6hnlichen und imposanten Einheit verschmelzen.\r\n\r\nVom drohenden Verfall zur aufwendigen Restaurierung: Nach der zwischenzeitlichen Nutzung als sowjetische Botschaft und als Studio des Fernsehsenders RTL wurde die Villa nach aufwendiger Restaurierung zur imposanten Kulisse der Kulturstiftung Fondation Boghossian.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOGHOSSIAN FOUNDATION - VILLA EMPAIN","virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Fondation Boghossian \u2013 Villa Empain","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt, 67","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"La Villa Empain \u00e8 uno straordinario esempio di architettura Art Deco costruita all'inizio degli anni '30. Oggi ospita il Centro de'Art e Dialogo tra Oriente e Occidente....\r\n\r\nLa Villa Empain \u00e8 uno straordinario esempio di architettura Art Deco costruita all'inizio degli anni '30. Oggi ospita il Centro de'Art e Dialogo tra Oriente e Occidente.\r\nVilla Empain \u00e8 anche la sede internazionale della Fondazione Boghossian, che opera in molti paesi dal 1992.\r\nEdificio classificato dal 2007, \u00e8 stata interamente restaurata seguendo scrupolosamente le strutture originali.\r\n\r\nDa non perdere.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Villa Empain, Fundaci\u00f3n Boghossian","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt, 67","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"La Villa Empain es un testigo destacado de la arquitectura Art d\u00e9co.\r\nConstruida a principios de los a\u00f1os 1930 y ubicada en el centro de la capital europea, se ha convertido en un Centro de Arte y de Di\u00e1logo imprescindible.\u00a0\r\n\r\nEs igualmente la sede internacional de la Fundaci\u00f3n Boghossian, que trabaja en distintos pa\u00edses desde el a\u00f1o 1992. Declarado monumento en el a\u00f1o 2007, ha sido restaurando siguiendo los criterios del edificio original.\u00a0A fecha de hoy, alberga diferentes exposiciones y actividades.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Fondation Boghossian \u2013 Villa Empain","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@boghossianfoundation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.villaempain.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 627 52 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt, 67","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Fondation Boghossian \u2013 Villa Empain","address_street_name":"Avenue Franklin Roosevelt","address_street_number":"67","address_street_box":n