},"sunday":{"is_open":false}},"translations":{"fr":["lundi, mardi, mercredi et jeudi: \u00e0 partir de 20:00","vendredi, samedi et dimanche: ferm\u00e9"],"nl":["maandag, dinsdag, woensdag en donderdag: van 20:00","vrijdag, zaterdag en zondag: gesloten"],"en":["monday, tuesday, wednesday and thursday: from 20:00","friday, saturday and sunday: closed"]},"date_start":"2022-06-26","date_end":"2022-06-30","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":15},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Pr\u00e9vente"},"nl":{"name":"Voorverkoop"},"en":{"name":"Presale"}},"value":13},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[5,19,11,7,8,12,10],"translations":{"fr":["Enfants 9-12 ans","Enseignants","Famille","Jeunes 12-15 ans","Jeunes 15-18 ans","LGTBQIA","Seniors"],"nl":["Kinderen 9-12 j.","Leerkrachten","Familie","Jongeren 12-15 j.","Jongeren 15-18 j.","LGTBQIA","Senioren"],"en":["Children 9-12 yr.","Teachers","Family","Youth 12-15  yr.","Youth 15-18  yr.","LGTBQIA","Seniors"]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-11T16:35:05+02:00","published_at":"2022-05-11T16:05:05+02:00","backoffice_id":253540,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"concert","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.58480354764257},{"id":492948,"date_start":"2022-06-28","date_end":"2022-06-28","date_next":"2022-06-28","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[4,7],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"The Chats - Dennis Cometti - SOLD OUT","shortdescr":"Le groupe punk australien adoub\u00e9 par Josh Homme, Dave Grohl et Iggy Pop","longdescr":"Le groupe punk australien, The Chats, se fait conna\u00eetre en octobre 2017 avec \u00ab Smoko \u00bb, un premier titr\u00e9 g\u00e9nialissime au clip low-budget. Vu plus de 8 millions de fois sur YouTube, le morceau a rapidement \u00e9t\u00e9 \u00e9rig\u00e9 au rang de nouvel hymne de la jeunesse australienne. A partir de l\u00e0, tout s\u2019encha\u00eene. Le groupe est rep\u00e9r\u00e9 par Josh Homme et assure les premi\u00e8res parties d\u2019Iggy Pop ou encore des Queens Of The Stone Age. Avec des lignes de basse simples, une batterie \u00e9nerv\u00e9e et un chorus explosif qui rappelle Cosmic Psychos, The Chats remet le punk sur le devant de la sc\u00e8ne et ce n\u2019est pas Dave Grohl qui dira le contraire !\r\n\r\nDennis Commetti\r\n\r\nDennis Cometti est un groupe de garage punk minimaliste, influenc\u00e9 par des groupes tels que les Ramones et Mummies. Le duo est compos\u00e9 du batteur Mitch et du guitariste Alex, respectivement membres des formations Aborted Tortoise et Ghoulie. Rendez-vous \u00e0 l\u2019Orangerie pour d\u00e9couvrir Dennis Cometti, premi\u00e8re partie de The Chats \u00e0 l\u2019occasion de leur tourn\u00e9e mondiale.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","email":"info@botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 37 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/492948.html"},"nl":{"name":"The Chats - Dennis Cometti - SOLD OUT","shortdescr":"Australische punkers brengen rauwe energie die Josh Homme en Iggy Pop bijna jaloers maakt","longdescr":"De punkers van The Chats leren we kennen in 2017 met 'Smoko', een viraal liedje op YouTube met een fijne clip, dat uitgroeit tot een anthem voor de jeugd in Australi\u00eb en ver daarbuiten.\r\n\r\nHet levert hen adelbrieven op van Josh Homme, die de pub-punk-\/shed-rockgroep meeneemt op tour met Queens of The Stone Age, terwijl ook Iggy Pop de jongens uitnodigt voor support slots.\r\n\r\nTijdens die shows bewijzen de garagerockers over een rauwe energie en een heerlijk je-m'en-foutisme te beschikken. Met vocals die het midden houden tussen spoken word, zang en spit, een DIY-aanpak waarmee ze gewoon hun eigen zin blijven doen en een brandende dosis pit (indien nodig aangewakkerd met discountpils), kan het niet anders dan dat ook debuutalbum 'High risk behaviour' een succes wordt.\r\n\r\nZe stellen de plaat voor in de Botanique; dat wordt ongetwijfeld een losgeslagen feest waarop moshen de norm is.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/492948.html"},"en":{"name":"The Chats - Dennis Cometti - SOLD OUT","shortdescr":"Australian punks bringing fun and a raw energy that rivals Josh Homme and Iggy Pop","longdescr":"The Chats are a pub-punk shed-rock band from Queensland, Australia. They began playing together in high school, releasing their debut self titled EP a month away from graduating. About nine months out of high school, The Chats went back into the studio to record their follow up EP, \"Get This In Ya\". The second EP sat online for half a year until the band had a viral hit with the music video for their song \"Smoko\", which racked in millions of views on Youtube in a couple of days. Since then, The Chats have become notorious for their loud and chaotic live shows and their zero fucks attitude. The Chats have sold out shows in Australia, New Zealand, England, Scotland, and Europe. They've toured with Australian punk legends Cosmic Psychos, US rock heavyweights Queens of the Stone Age, and fellow pisswrecks Pist Idiots. With a debut album in the works, as well as national and international tours, The Chats aren't showing any signs of slowing down soon.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/492948.html"},"de":{"name":"The Chats","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/492948.html"},"it":{"name":"The Chats","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/492948.html"},"sp":{"name":"The Chats","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/492948.html"},"pt":{"name":"The Chats","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/492948.html"},"cn":{"name":"The Chats","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/492948.html"}},"place":{"id":11,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"L\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gant Centre Culturel de la Communaut\u00e9 fran\u00e7aise est joliment situ\u00e9 dans les anciens jardins botaniques pr\u00e8s de la petite ceinture de Bruxelles. Vous pouvez assister \u00e0 des concerts dans les espaces intimes \u00e0 l\u2019ambiance chaleureuse, dont  les plus connus sont l\u2019Orangerie, la Rotonde, le Mus\u00e9e et le Witloof Bar. \r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Koningsstraat","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","address_line1":"Koningsstraat, 236","address_line2":"1210 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":"In de voormalige botanische tuinen aan de kleine ring, thans het klassevolle cultuurcentrum van de Franse Gemeenschap, is het goed toeven. Concerten vinden er plaats op een unieke locatie, in sfeervolle en intieme ruimtes. De kwalitatieve eclectische programmatie staat zeer open voor nieuwe trends.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"The former botanical gardens provide the unique location for the stylish cultural centre of the French community and are a great place to relax. Concerts are held in the intimate surroundings of its eight spaces and multipurpose halls, of which the most famous are the Orangerie, the Rotonde, the Museum, and the Witloof Bar.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Le Botanique z\u00e4hlt ohne Zweifel zu den sch\u00f6nsten und spektakul\u00e4rsten Veranstaltungsorten Br\u00fcssels. Das von 1826 bis 1829 von der \u201eSoci\u00e9t\u00e9 Royale d'Horticulture\u201c erbaute, ehemalige Gew\u00e4chshaus im neoklassizistischen Stil mit Eisen- und Glasarchitektur beherbergt seit 1984 einen hochkar\u00e4tigen Veranstaltungsort.\r\n\r\nInmitten des botanischen Gartens von Saint-Josse-ten-Noode, einer der 19 Br\u00fcsseler Gemeinden, w\u00e4chst und gedeiht heute ein quicklebendiger Ort der Kultur, der vor allem f\u00fcr Musikveranstaltungen, als Galerie und Caf\u00e9 genutzt wird. H\u00f6hepunkt des Jahres bildet im Fr\u00fchling das Musikfestival \u201eLes Nuits Botaniques\".","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Questo grande edificio, che doveva ospitare le collezioni di un precedente giardino botanico, \u00e8 stato costruito fra il 1826 ed il 1829. L'artista-arredatore Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois Gineste diresse i lavori secondo progetto dell'architetto Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys. Rispettando la struttura tradizionale degli aranceti, ha immaginato un'imponente cupola rotonda centrale, affiancata da due ali ciascuna delle quali terminante in un padiglione leggermente sporgente. Grazie alla sua regolarit\u00e0 e semplicit\u00e0, la costruzione illustra perfettamente i principi dello stile neoclassico. Alle vetrate che riempiono gli spazi tra le colonne della sala circolare e che coprono il portico delimitato dal colonnato stesso, si aggiungono le serre adiacenti alle ali laterali. Inizialmente si era pensato di organizzare feste all'interno di questo ambiente magico, e a questo scopo venne allestita una grande sala fra l'aranceto orientale e la sala rotonda, ma questa diventer\u00e0 poi la sala degli erbari dal 1870. Fino al 1939, l'edificio verr\u00e0 utilizzato per il suo scopo originale. Riacquistato dallo Stato nel 1970, il locale diventer\u00e0 il Centro Culturale della Federazione Vallonia-Bruxelles e verr\u00e0 inaugurato come tale nel 1984. Oggi ospita numerosi eventi culturali dedicati all'arte contemporanea e vi si svolgono festival, tra i quali il famoso Nuits du Botanique, che hanno contribuito ad affermare la sua reputazione. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Este enorme edificio, pensado para albergar las colecciones de un antiguo jard\u00edn bot\u00e1nico, fue construido entre 1826 y 1829. El artista-decorador Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois Gineste dirigi\u00f3 las obras a partir de los planos del arquitecto Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys. Respetando la estructura tradicional de los invernaderos de naranjas, imagin\u00f3 una imponente rotonda central con c\u00fapula flanqueada por dos pasillos que terminaban en un pabell\u00f3n ligeramente en relieve. Gracias a su regularidad y simplicidad, la elevaci\u00f3n ilustra a la perfecci\u00f3n los principios del estilo neocl\u00e1sico. Las vidrieras situadas en los intercolumnios de la rotonda y que cubren el p\u00f3rtico delimitado por esta misma columnata se suman a los invernaderos adosados a los pasillos laterales. Pronto se pens\u00f3 en organizar fiestas en este lugar m\u00e1gico, para lo cual se acondicion\u00f3 una sala entre el invernadero de naranjas oriental y la rotonda, pero a partir de 1870 se convirti\u00f3 en la sala de los herbarios. Hasta 1939 cumpli\u00f3 las funciones teniendo en cuenta su vocaci\u00f3n inicial. Recomprado por el Estado en 1970, el lugar se convirti\u00f3 en el centro cultural de la Federaci\u00f3n Valonia-Bruselas y se inaugur\u00f3 como tal en 1984. A d\u00eda de hoy este lugar alberga numerosas manifestaciones culturales dedicadas a la creaci\u00f3n contempor\u00e1nea y se ha vuelto prestigioso por los festivales que se celebran en \u00e9l, tales como las \u00abNoches del bot\u00e1nico\u00bb. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[15],"translations":{"fr":["Rogier"],"nl":["Rogier"],"en":["Rogier"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"fr":["Nord"],"nl":["Noord"],"en":["North"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":5,"location":{"lat":50.85461438,"lon":4.36620044},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-04-12T16:05:05+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:13+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":11,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"L\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gant Centre Culturel de la Communaut\u00e9 fran\u00e7aise est joliment situ\u00e9 dans les anciens jardins botaniques pr\u00e8s de la petite ceinture de Bruxelles. Vous pouvez assister \u00e0 des concerts dans les espaces intimes \u00e0 l\u2019ambiance chaleureuse, dont  les plus connus sont l\u2019Orangerie, la Rotonde, le Mus\u00e9e et le Witloof Bar. \r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Koningsstraat","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","address_line1":"Koningsstraat, 236","address_line2":"1210 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":"In de voormalige botanische tuinen aan de kleine ring, thans het klassev