"],"en":["Youth 12-15  yr.","Youth 15-18  yr."]}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[259,265],"translations":{"fr":["Chien d'assistance","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Assistentiehonden","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Assistance dogs","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-06-02T01:35:10+02:00","published_at":"2021-08-27T11:14:15+02:00","backoffice_id":237837,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"misc","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.18883877831423},{"id":534239,"date_start":"2022-06-23","date_end":"2022-07-02","date_next":"2022-07-02","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":118,"translations":{"fr":"Festival","nl":"Festival","en":"Festival"}},"others":{"list":[119],"translations":{"fr":["Cin\u00e9ma"],"nl":["Cinema"],"en":["Cinema  "]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Brussels International Film Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Du 23 juin au 02 juillet 2022, soyez pr\u00e9sents pour la 5\u00e8me \u00e9dition du Brussels International Film Festival ! L\u2019UGC de Brouck\u00e8re, Bozar, le Cin\u00e9ma Galeries et le Palace vous ouvriront leurs portes pour un voyage en image en plein c\u0153ur de la capitale.\r\nComp\u00e9titions \u00e0 3 niveaux, avant-premi\u00e8res, classiques restaur\u00e9s, projections en plein air, masterclasses, s\u00e9ances pour le jeune public... \r\nMais le BRIFF, c\u2019est aussi l\u2019occasion de rencontrer des invit\u00e9s prestigieux.\r\n\r\nDepuis 2018, Costa-Gavras, Terry Gilliam, Abel Ferrara, Claudia Cardinale, G\u00e9rard Depardieu, Beno\u00eet Del\u00e9pine, Mathieu Amalric, Samuel Benchetrit, Catherine Frot, Bouli Lanners, Emilie Dequenne, ainsi que des talents \u00e9mergents, belges ou internationaux nous ont fait l'honneur de leur visite au BRIFF.\r\n\r\nProcurez-vous un pass et assistez \u00e0 tous les rendez-vous que le BRIFF vous propose !\r\n\r\nInfos & tickets : www.briff.be","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.briff.be","email":"info@briff.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 248 08 72","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/534239.html"},"nl":{"name":"Brussels International Film Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"VAN 23 juni tot 02 juli: wees present op de 5de editie van het Brussels International Film Festival! Cinema\u2019s UGC de Brouck\u00e8re, Bozar, Galeries en Palace openen hun deuren en nemen je mee op een filmische reis in hartje Brussel.\r\n3 competities, avant-premi\u00e8res, gerestaureerde klassiekers, openluchtvoorstellingen, masterclasses, vertoningen voor een jong publiek... \r\nHet BRIFF is ook een uitgelezen kans om gerenommeerde gasten te ontmoeten zoals Costa-Gavras, Terry Gilliam, Abel Ferrara, Claudia Cardinale, G\u00e9rard Depardieu, Beno\u00eet Del\u00e9pine, Mathieu Amalric, Samuel Benchetrit, Catherine Frot, Bouli Lanners, Emilie Dequenne\u2026 maar ook opkomend Belgisch en\/of internationaal talent.\r\nBestel je filmpas en woon alle evenementen bij die het BRIFF aanbiedt in de partnerbioscopen in hartje Brussel!\r\n\r\nMeer info : www.briff.be","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/534239.html"},"en":{"name":"Brussels International Film Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"From June 23rd to July 2nd 2022, be there for the Brussels International Film Festival 5th edition! UGC de Brouck\u00e8re, Bozar, Galeries and Palace will open their doors to offer you a real journey through images in the heart of the city. \r\n3-level competitions, premieres, restored classics, open air screenings, masterclasses, screenings for young audiences... \r\nBut the BRIFF is also an opportunity to meet prestigious guests such as Costa-Gavras, Terry Gilliam, Abel Ferrara, Claudia Cardinale, G\u00e9rard Depardieu, Beno\u00eet Del\u00e9pine, Mathieu Amalric, Samuel Benchetrit, Catherine Frot, Bouli Lanners, Emilie Dequenne as well as emerging Belgian and International talent.\r\nGet your pass and attend all the events that BRIFF is offering you!\r\n\r\nMore info : www.briff.be","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/534239.html"},"de":{"name":"Brussels International Film Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/534239.html"},"it":{"name":"Brussels International Film Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/534239.html"},"sp":{"name":"Brussels International Film Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/534239.html"},"pt":{"name":"Brussels International Film Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/534239.html"},"cn":{"name":"Brussels International Film Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/534239.html"}},"place":{"id":275775,"tra