-15","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":true,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours"}},"others":{"list":[255],"translations":{"fr":["Visites d'expositions"],"nl":["Tentoonstelling"],"en":["Exhibition guided tours"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["nl","fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Visites guid\u00e9es pour individuels","shortdescr":"Du 10 mai 2022 au 22 janvier 2023, laissez-vous entra\u00eener par un guide \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte de Train World et de l\u2019expo Royals & Trains.","longdescr":"Du 10 mai 2022 au 22 janvier 2023, laissez-vous entra\u00eener par un guide \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte de Train World et de l\u2019expo Royals & Trains.\r\nTrain World vous offre la possibilit\u00e9, en tant que visiteur individuel, de r\u00e9server une visite guid\u00e9e anim\u00e9e par un guide professionnel en fran\u00e7ais ou en n\u00e9erlandais, quelques week-ends chaque mois.\r\n\r\nLa visite guid\u00e9e, d'une dur\u00e9e de maximum deux heures, vous pr\u00e9sente les points cl\u00e9s de l\u2019exposition temporaire et les pi\u00e8ces ma\u00eetresses de l\u2019exposition permanente de Train World.\r\n\r\nSelon l'heure de la s\u00e9ance \u00e0 laquelle vous participez (11h ou 14h), vous pourrez sillonner Train World librement, soit avant 14h si vous \u00eates inscrits \u00e0 la visite guid\u00e9e de l'apr\u00e8s-midi, soit apr\u00e8s 13h si vous \u00eates inscrits \u00e0 la visite guid\u00e9e du matin.\r\n\r\n           Mai              -                Juin                  -            Juillet\r\n\r\n14\/05\/2022 NL\/FR  |    01\/06\/2022 NL\/FR  |    09\/07\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN\r\n15\/05\/2022 NL\/FR  |    03\/06\/2022 NL\/FR  |    10\/07\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN\r\n18\/05\/2022 NL\/FR  |    11\/06\/2022 NL\/FR  |    23\/07\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN\r\n20\/05\/2022 NL\/FR  |    12\/06\/2022 NL\/FR  |    24\/07\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN\r\n28\/05\/2022 NL\/FR  |    25\/06\/2022 NL\/FR  |    \r\n29\/05\/2022 NL\/FR  |    26\/06\/2022 NL\/FR  |    \r\n \r\n\r\n        Ao\u00fbt                    -             Septembre         -            Octobre\r\n\r\n13\/08\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN        |    10\/09\/2022 NL\/FR  |    08\/10\/2022 NL\/FR\r\n14\/08\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN        |    11\/09\/2022 NL\/FR  |    09\/10\/2022 NL\/FR\r\n27\/08\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN        |    24\/09\/2022 NL\/FR  |    12\/10\/2022 NL\/FR\r\n28\/08\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN        |    25\/09\/2022 NL\/FR  |    14\/10\/2022 NL\/FR\r\n                                                                                |    22\/10\/2022 NL\/FR\r\n                                                                                |    23\/10\/2022 NL\/FR\r\n                                                                                |    26\/10\/2022 NL\/FR\r\n                                                                                |    28\/10\/2022 NL\/FR \r\n\r\n     Novembre          -            D\u00e9cembre      -            Janvier\r\n\r\n12\/11\/2022 NL\/FR  |    02\/12\/2022 NL\/FR  |    04\/01\/2023 NL\/FR\r\n13\/11\/2022 NL\/FR  |    10\/12\/2022 NL\/FR  |    06\/01\/2023 NL\/FR\r\n16\/11\/2022 NL\/FR  |    11\/12\/2022 NL\/FR  |    14\/01\/2023 NL\/FR\r\n18\/11\/2022 NL\/FR  |    14\/12\/2022 NL\/FR  |    15\/01\/2023 NL\/FR\r\n26\/11\/2022 NL\/FR  |    16\/12\/2022 NL\/FR  |    \r\n27\/11\/2022 NL\/FR  |    \r\n30\/11\/2022 NL\/FR  |  \r\n\r\nCes jours-l\u00e0, nous proposons des visites guid\u00e9es par langue :\r\n\r\n\u00e0 11h00 et 14h00 en fran\u00e7ais\r\n\u00e0 10h30 et 13h30 en n\u00e9erlandais\r\n\u00e0 14h30 en anglais (uniquement pendant les vacances d'\u00e9t\u00e9)\r\n\r\nPlus d'infos : https:\/\/www.trainworld.be\/fr\/expo-royals-trains\/visites-guidees-pour-individuels","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.trainworld.be\/fr\/expo-royals-trains\/visites-guidees-pour-individuels","email":"reservaties@trainworld.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/534054.html"},"nl":{"name":"Gidsbeurten voor individuele bezoekers","shortdescr":"Laat je van 10.05.2022 t.e.m. 22.01.2023 op sleeptouw nemen door een gids voor je individueel bezoek aan Train World tijdens de tijdelijke expo Royals & Trains.","longdescr":"Laat je van 10.05.2022 t.e.m. 22.01.2023 op sleeptouw nemen door een gids voor je individueel bezoek aan Train World tijdens de tijdelijke expo Royals & Trains.\r\nIn het kader van deze tijdelijke tentoonstelling biedt Train World enkele weekends en weekdagen per maand rondleidingen aan in het Nederlands, Frans en Engels voor individuele bezoekers.\r\nDe rondleiding duurt maximaal twee uur en toont je de topstukken van de expo en het museum. \r\n\r\nAfhankelijk van het tijdstip van de sessie waaraan je deelneemt (10u30 of 13u30), kan je, aansluitend op de rondleiding, Train World nog eens zonder gids bezoeken; ofwel v\u00f3\u00f3r 14u00 als je bent ingeschreven voor de middagrondleiding, of na 13u00 als je bent ingeschreven voor de ochtendrondleiding.\r\n\r\n           Mei              -                Juni            -               Juli\r\n\r\n14\/05\/2022 NL\/FR  |    01\/06\/2022 NL\/FR  |    09\/07\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN\r\n15\/05\/2022 NL\/FR  |    03\/06\/2022 NL\/FR  |    10\/07\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN\r\n18\/05\/2022 NL\/FR  |    11\/06\/2022 NL\/FR  |    23\/07\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN\r\n20\/05\/2022 NL\/FR  |    12\/06\/2022 NL\/FR  |    24\/07\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN\r\n28\/05\/2022 NL\/FR  |    25\/06\/2022 NL\/FR  |    \r\n29\/05\/2022 NL\/FR  |    26\/06\/2022 NL\/FR  |    \r\n\r\n        Augustus             -           September        -           Oktober\r\n\r\n13\/08\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN        |    10\/09\/2022 NL\/FR  |    08\/10\/2022 NL\/FR\r\n14\/08\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN        |    11\/09\/2022 NL\/FR  |    09\/10\/2022 NL\/FR\r\n27\/08\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN        |    24\/09\/2022 NL\/FR  |    12\/10\/2022 NL\/FR\r\n28\/08\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN        |    25\/09\/2022 NL\/FR  |    14\/10\/2022 NL\/FR\r\n                                                                                |    22\/10\/2022 NL\/FR\r\n                                                                                |    23\/10\/2022 NL\/FR\r\n                                                                                |    26\/10\/2022 NL\/FR\r\n                                                                                |    28\/10\/2022 NL\/FR  \r\n\r\n     November         -             December        -              Januari\r\n\r\n12\/11\/2022 NL\/FR  |    02\/12\/2022 NL\/FR  |    04\/01\/2023 NL\/FR\r\n13\/11\/2022 NL\/FR  |    10\/12\/2022 NL\/FR  |    06\/01\/2023 NL\/FR\r\n16\/11\/2022 NL\/FR  |    11\/12\/2022 NL\/FR  |    14\/01\/2023 NL\/FR\r\n18\/11\/2022 NL\/FR  |    14\/12\/2022 NL\/FR  |    15\/01\/2023 NL\/FR\r\n26\/11\/2022 NL\/FR  |    16\/12\/2022 NL\/FR  |    \r\n27\/11\/2022 NL\/FR  |    \r\n30\/11\/2022 NL\/FR  |    \r\n\r\nWe voorzien op deze dagen gidsbeurten in verschillende talen:\r\n\r\nom 10u30 en 13u30 in het Nederlands\r\nom 11u00 en 14u00 in het Frans\r\nom 14u30 in het Engels (enkel tijdens de zomervakantie)\r\n\r\nMeer info: https:\/\/www.trainworld.be\/nl\/expo-royals-trains\/gidsbeurten-voor-individuele-bezoekers","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.trainworld.be\/nl\/expo-royals-trains\/gidsbeurten-voor-individuele-bezoekers","email":"reservaties@trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 75 88","phone_booking":"+32 2 224 75 88","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/534054.html"},"en":{"name":"Guided tour for individual visitors","shortdescr":"From 10 May 2022 to 22 January 2023, you can book a guide for your individual visit to Train World during the temporary exhibition Royals & Trains.","longdescr":"From 10 May 2022 to 22 January 2023, you can book a guide for your individual visit to Train World during the temporary exhibition Royals & Trains. \r\nDuring the temporary exhibition on Royals & Trains, guided tours for individual visitors are available during several weekends per month in Dutch, English and French\r\nThis tour lasts a maximum of two hours and takes you round the highlights of the exhibition and museum.\r\n\r\nAfter the tour, depending on the time of your visit (11:00, 14:00 or 14:30), you can continue to freely visit Train World; either before 14:00 or 14:30 if you have booked a lunchtime tour or after 13:00 if you have booked a morning tour.\r\n\r\n        July                               Agust                                 \r\n\r\n09\/07\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN  |    13\/08\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN\r\n10\/07\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN  |    14\/08\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN\r\n23\/07\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN  |    27\/08\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN\r\n24\/07\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN  |    28\/08\/2022 NL\/FR\/EN\r\n\r\nAt 14:30 in English\r\n\r\nThere are guided tours available in french or in dutch at other dates as well but English tours are only offered during the summer break.\r\n\r\nMore info : https:\/\/www.trainworld.be\/en\/exhibition-royals-trains\/guided-tour-for-individual-visitors","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.trainworld.be\/en\/exhibition-royals-trains\/guided-tour-for-individual-visitors","email":"reservaties@trainworld.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/534054.html"},"de":{"name":"Gidsbeurten voor individuele bezoekers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/534054.html"},"it":{"name":"Gidsbeurten voor individuele bezoekers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/534054.html"},"sp":{"name":"Gidsbeurten voor individuele bezoekers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/534054.html"},"pt":{"name":"Gidsbeurten voor individuele bezoekers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/534054.html"},"cn":{"name":"Gidsbeurten voor individuele bezoekers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/534054.html"}},"place":{"id":252663,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Le nouveau mus\u00e9e Train World est la vitrine du pass\u00e9, du pr\u00e9sent et du futur des Chemins de fer.\r\nLes plus belles pi\u00e8ces de la collection historique du mat\u00e9riel roulant des Chemins de fer belges, compl\u00e8tement r\u00e9nov\u00e9es, seront enfin accessibles au public! Toutes ces pi\u00e8ces de valeur seront pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es dans un cadre adapt\u00e9 pour une visite confortable et agr\u00e9able.\r\nPourquoi Schaerbeek? La gare de Schaerbeek est un des fleurons de l\u2019architecture ferroviaire belge et se situe sur le trac\u00e9 de la premi\u00e8re ligne de chemin de fer du continent. Le site est par ailleurs facilement accessible en train, tram et voiture.\r\nTrain World vous promet une exp\u00e9rience unique et vous emm\u00e8ne \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte du pass\u00e9, du pr\u00e9sent et du futur des chemins de fer.","description_print":"Vitrine du pass\u00e9, du pr\u00e9sent et du futur sur le monde ferroviaire, Train World est le nom du nouveau mus\u00e9e des chemins de fer, actuellement en construction pr\u00e8s de la gare de Schaerbeek. Il abritera les pi\u00e8ces les plus pr\u00e9cieuses du patrimoine historique.Train World rendra hommage \u00e0 la riche histoire du train, mais d\u00e9montrera aussi que les chemins de fer n'ont pas fini de jouer un r\u00f4le important dans le d\u00e9veloppement de notre pays.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Prinses Elisabethplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaarbeek","address_line1":"Prinses Elisabethplein","address_line2":"1030 Schaarbeek","description_web":"Train World is een unieke spoorervaring die je van de allereerste stoomlocomotieven tot de flitsende hogesnelheidstreinen brengt! Het is een universum dat een beroep doet op alle zintuigen om de vele verschillende dimensies van de spoorwegen te kunnen bevatten. Een bezoek aan Train World is een actieve en verrassende uitstap. Je wandelt tussen locomotieven, neemt plaats in treinen van 100 jaar oud, bezoekt een spoorweghuisje en loopt over een echte spoorwegbrug. Je ervaart zelfs hoe het voelt om een trein te besturen!","description_print":"Train World is sinds september 2015 het uitstalraam voor de spoorwegen van gisteren, vandaag en morgen in Brussel. De site bevindt zich in Schaarbeek, op nauwelijks 10 minuten met de trein vanuit Brussel-Centraal (bij de Grote Markt). \r\n\r\nDe mooiste stukken uit de collectie historische locomotieven en rijtuigen van de Belgische spoorwegen zijn er te bewonderen, maar daarnaast wordt er ook de belangrijke rol van de trein in de mobiliteit van vandaag en de toekomst ge\u00efllustreerd. Train World is meer dan een museum: het is een belevingscentrum. Een originele scenografie \u2013 ontworpen door kunstenaar Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten - zorgt voor een ervaring waarbij je kan kijken, luisteren, aanraken en verrast worden door de boeiende verhalen uit de wereld van de trein.\r\n\r\n22-10-2019> 15-03-2020 : Tentoonstelling: Paul Delvaux, de man die van treinen hield \r\n\r\nPaul Delvaux (1897-1994) schilderde een meesterlijk oeuvre bijeen, met als inspiratiebron de wereld van de spoorwegen. Zijn surrealistische werken gaan moeiteloos op in de adembenemende scenografie van Train World. Als vanzelf ontstaat een boeiende dialoog.\r\n\r\nDeze expo is h\u00e9t uitgelezen moment om de artistieke evolutie van deze spoorwegliefhebber te ontdekken in een magische setting: van tekeningen, aquarellen en schilderijen uit de jaren 1920 tot monumentale werken uit de jaren 1970, maar ook persoonlijke objecten van de artiest voegen verrassende accenten toe. Dat de schilder in 1984 tot erestationschef van Louvain-la-Neuve werd benoemd, is veelbetekenend.\r\n\r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Train World, the showcase for the railways of yesterday, today and tomorrow, is a must-see tourist attraction in Brussels. The site is located a few minutes by train from Brussels Central station (near the Grand Place).\r\nHere you will be able to admire the loveliest pieces from the collection of historical locomotives and carriages from the Belgian railways, but it will also illustrate the significant role of the train in the mobility of today and in future. Train World is more than a museum: it will be an experience centre. An original scenography \u2013 designed by artist Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten \u2013 will provide an experience in which the audience can look, listen, touch and be surprised by scintillating stories from the world of trains.\r\nThe site comprises the renovated Schaerbeek station, where the ticket office is located, and a new 8,000 m\u00b2 building. A restaurant and a book & gift shop in the station completes the offering. It will also be possible to have a picnic: a restored carriage will be available in the transit area from the station to the new building for this purpose.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"Train World, the showcase for the railways of yesterday, today and tomorrow, is a must-see tourist attraction in Brussels. The site is located a few minutes by train from Brussels Central station (near the Grand Place)\r\nHere you will be able to admire the loveliest pieces from the collection of historical locomotives and carriages from the Belgian railways, but it will also illustrate the significant role of the train in the mobility of today and in future. Train World is more than a museum: it will be an experience centre. An original scenography \u2013 designed by artist Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten \u2013 will provide an experience in which the audience can look, listen, touch and be surprised by scintillating stories from the world of trains.\r\nThe site comprises the renovated Schaerbeek station, where the ticket office is located, and a new 8,000 m\u00b2 building. A restaurant and a book & gift shop in the station completes the offering. It will also be possible to have a picnic: a restored carriage will be available in the transit area from the station to the new building for this purpose.\r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"N\u00e4chste Haltestelle Train World... kleine und gro\u00dfe Eisenbahnfreunde erwartet in Br\u00fcssel ein neues \u201eMekka\": In dem historischen Geb\u00e4ude des ehemaligen Bahnhofs von Schaerbeek erwartet Sie das spektakul\u00e4re Eisenbahnmuseum Train World, dessen Szenographie aus der Feder des belgischen Comic-K\u00fcnstlers Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten stammt.\r\n\r\nSch\u00e4tze aus der Welt der Eisenbahn: Von der \u00e4ltesten Dampflokomotive Belgiens \u00fcber prunkvolle k\u00f6nigliche Wagons bis hin zu den modernen Hochgeschwindigkeitsz\u00fcgen - Train World f\u00fchrt die Besucher durch die belgische Eisenbahngeschichte. Neben historischem und technischem Wissen gibt es auch Anekdoten und Kuriosit\u00e4ten aus der Welt der Eisenbahn zu entdecken. Wie ist eine Schiene aufgebaut, wie schnell fuhren die ersten Dampfloks, wie reisten einst die K\u00f6nige? Antworten auf all diese Fragen geben die Erkl\u00e4rungstafeln, die auch auf Deutsch zur Verf\u00fcgung stehen, sowie die kostenlosen Audioguides (ebenfalls auf Deutsch).\r\n\r\nFahrsimulator: Sie haben schon immer davon getr\u00e4umt, Lokomotivf\u00fchrer zu werden? Dann nehmen Sie Platz im F\u00fchrerstand des Fahrsimulators und begeben sich auf eine Reise durch die Eisenbahngeschichte.\r\n\r\nLeibliches Wohl:\r\n\r\nIn der Brasserie \"RN Express\", die in dem historischen Bahnhofsgeb\u00e4ude untergebracht ist, gibt es Speisen und Getr\u00e4nke. Tiefblaue W\u00e4nde, gl\u00e4serne Kugellampen und Holzmobiliar sorgen f\u00fcr ein besonderes Ambiente.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Train World. Il museo nazionale del treno aprir\u00e0 le porte alla stazione di Schaerbeek.\r\nTesori del mondo ferroviario\r\nTrain World custodir\u00e0 numerosi tesori: la pi\u00f9 antica locomotiva conservata in Belgio, la \u201cpaese di Waes\u201d, o la locomotive a vapore carenata \u201ctipo 12\u201d che aveva stabilito un record di velocit\u00e0 nel 1939.\r\n\r\nSimulatore di guida\r\n\r\nAvete sempre avuto voglia di guidare un treno ? Train World vi sistema in un simulatore di guida! Nel posto dell\u2019autista, potrete osservare i cambi dell\u2019ambiente lungo le linee ferroviarie nel corso degli anni.\r\n\r\nScuole e famiglie\r\n\r\nI vostri bambini potranno approfittare di un\u2019offerta specifica che mette l\u2019accanto sia sul aspetto educativo che divertente. Potranno approfittare di un spazio giochi originale.\r\n\r\nSala eventi\r\n\r\nTrain World entra in stazione e Bruxelles si dota di un nuovo luogo per eventi! Con 550 m\u00b2, la magnifica sala degli sportelli della stazione di Schaerbeek, risalendo al 1913, offrir\u00e0 un quadro unico per eventi. Sar\u00e0 dotata di un\u2019installazione audiovisuale moderna. \r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Train World, la nueva atracci\u00f3n tur\u00edstica de Bruselas.\r\n\r\nTrain World es un escaparate para los ferrocarriles de ayer, hoy y ma\u00f1ana, es la nueva atracci\u00f3n tur\u00edstica de Bruselas. El lugar est\u00e1 situado a pocos minutos en tren de la Estaci\u00f3n Central de Bruselas (cerca de la Grand Place).\r\n\r\nAqu\u00ed tendr\u00e1s la oportunidad de admirar las piezas m\u00e1s encantadoras de la colecci\u00f3n de trenes y vagones hist\u00f3ricos de los ferrocarriles belgas, pero tambi\u00e9n ilustra el importante papel del tren en la movilidad de hoy en d\u00eda y el futuro. Train World es m\u00e1s que un museo: es un centro en el que podr\u00e1s vivir nuevas experiencias. Con una escenograf\u00eda original \u2013 dise\u00f1ada por el artista Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten \u2013 te ofrece una experiencia en la que puedes mirar, escuchar, tocar y sorprenderte con incre\u00edbles historias del mundo de los trenes.\r\nEl lugar, junto con las primeras v\u00edas ferroviarias del continente europeo, incluye la Estaci\u00f3n Schaerbeek renovada donde se encuentra la taquilla y un nuevo edificio de 8.000 m\u00b2. La antigua estaci\u00f3n, construida en 1887, es una las obras maestras de la arquitectura ferroviaria belga y es patrimonio hist\u00f3rico. Y para completar la oferta encontrar\u00e1s un restaurante y una tienda de regalos en la estaci\u00f3n.\r\n\r\nAlgo para todo el mundo\r\n\r\n\u00a1Hay mucho que descubrir en Train World! Por ejemplo, puedes ver el tren de vapor m\u00e1s antiguo preservado en B\u00e9lgica, la \u201cPays de Waes\u201d. O el tren de vapor simplificado \u201cType 12\u201d, que obtuvo el r\u00e9cord de velocidad en 1939. Puedes admirar el esplendor de los aut\u00e9nticos carruajes reales o pasear en el Trans-Europe Express (TEE) de acero inoxidable \u2013 el predecesor del tren de alta velocidad \u2013 que una vez cruz\u00f3 Europa. \u00bfTe gustar\u00eda conducir un tren? Entonces prueba suerte en uno de los simuladores de tren\u2026 o estudia los cambios que han sufrido los ferrocarriles de ayer y hoy desde una cabina de conductor.\r\n\r\nTambi\u00e9n hay cientos de objetos del mundo de los trenes, tales como uniformes, pinturas o modelos de trenes y estaciones, junto con una abundante cantidad de fotos y fragmentos de pel\u00edculas. Tambi\u00e9n cabe destacar la presencia de una aut\u00e9ntica \u201ccasa de guardabarreras\u201d que ha sido incluida en el nuevo edificio. Est\u00e1 amueblada al estilo de los a\u00f1os 50 y el \u00e1tico tiene un paisaje lleno de trenes en miniatura. \r\nColegios y familias con ni\u00f1os peque\u00f1os pueden disfrutar de ofertas espec\u00edficas, con especial atenci\u00f3n en el aspecto educativo relacionado con los juegos. Los ni\u00f1os pueden disfrutar en el \u201ctren de escalada\u201d, un tren de vapor medio enterrado.\r\n\r\nGracias a la cooperaci\u00f3n con los constructores de tren, la tecnolog\u00eda moderna y el desarrollo futuro tambi\u00e9n est\u00e1n en oferta. Ejemplo de esto son las tres cabinas de tren a tama\u00f1o real de los trenes m\u00e1s modernos.\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"Train World es un escaparate para los ferrocarriles de ayer, hoy y ma\u00f1ana, es la nueva atracci\u00f3n tur\u00edstica de Bruselas. El lugar est\u00e1 situado a pocos minutos en tren de la Estaci\u00f3n Central de Bruselas (cerca de la Grand Place).\r\n\r\nAqu\u00ed tendr\u00e1s la oportunidad de admirar las piezas m\u00e1s encantadoras de la colecci\u00f3n de trenes y vagones hist\u00f3ricos de los ferrocarriles belgas, pero tambi\u00e9n ilustra el importante papel del tren en la movilidad de hoy en d\u00eda y el futuro. Train World es m\u00e1s que un museo: es un centro en el que podr\u00e1s vivir nuevas experiencias. Con una escenograf\u00eda original \u2013 dise\u00f1ada por el artista Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten \u2013 te ofrece una experiencia en la que puedes mirar, escuchar, tocar y sorprenderte con incre\u00edbles historias del mundo de los trenes.\r\nEl lugar, junto con las primeras v\u00edas ferroviarias del continente europeo, incluye la Estaci\u00f3n Schaerbeek renovada donde se encuentra la taquilla y un nuevo edificio de 8.000 m\u00b2. La antigua estaci\u00f3n, construida en 1887, es una las obras maestras de la arquitectura ferroviaria belga y es patrimonio hist\u00f3rico. Y para completar la oferta encontrar\u00e1s un restaurante y una tienda de regalos en la estaci\u00f3n.\r\n\r\nAlgo para todo el mundo\r\n\r\n\u00a1Hay mucho que descubrir en Train World! Por ejemplo, puedes ver el tren de vapor m\u00e1s antiguo preservado en B\u00e9lgica, la \u201cPays de Waes\u201d. O el tren de vapor simplificado \u201cType 12\u201d, que obtuvo el r\u00e9cord de velocidad en 1939. Puedes admirar el esplendor de los aut\u00e9nticos carruajes reales o pasear en el Trans-Europe Express (TEE) de acero inoxidable \u2013 el predecesor del tren de alta velocidad \u2013 que una vez cruz\u00f3 Europa. \u00bfTe gustar\u00eda conducir un tren? Entonces prueba suerte en uno de los simuladores de tren\u2026 o estudia los cambios que han sufrido los ferrocarriles de ayer y hoy desde una cabina de conductor.\r\n\r\nTambi\u00e9n hay cientos de objetos del mundo de los trenes, tales como uniformes, pinturas o modelos de trenes y estaciones, junto con una abundante cantidad de fotos y fragmentos de pel\u00edculas. Tambi\u00e9n cabe destacar la presencia de una aut\u00e9ntica \u201ccasa de guardabarreras\u201d que ha sido incluida en el nuevo edificio. Est\u00e1 amueblada al estilo de los a\u00f1os 50 y el \u00e1tico tiene un paisaje lleno de trenes en miniatura. \r\nColegios y familias con ni\u00f1os peque\u00f1os pueden disfrutar de ofertas espec\u00edficas, con especial atenci\u00f3n en el aspecto educativo relacionado con los juegos. Los ni\u00f1os pueden disfrutar en el \u201ctren de escalada\u201d, un tren de vapor medio enterrado.\r\n\r\nGracias a la cooperaci\u00f3n con los constructores de tren, la tecnolog\u00eda moderna y el desarrollo futuro tambi\u00e9n est\u00e1n en oferta. Ejemplo de esto son las tres cabinas de tren a tama\u00f1o real de los trenes m\u00e1s modernos.\r\n\r\nTrain World will exceptionally be completely closed to the public from Monday 14 October to Monday 21 October 2019 and from Monday 16 March to Tuesday 17 March 2020 because of the assembly and dismantling of our exhibition dedicated to Paul Delvaux.\r\n\r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Train World, o novo polo de atra\u00e7\u00e3o de Bruxelas\r\nTrain World, a montra dos caminhos de ferro de ontem, de hoje e de amanh\u00e3, \u00e9 a nova atra\u00e7\u00e3o tur\u00edstica de Bruxelas desde setembro de 2015. O local situa-se em Schaerbeek, a alguns minutos de comboio da Esta\u00e7\u00e3o Central (pr\u00f3ximo da Grand-Place).\r\nN\u00e3o est\u00e3o a\u00ed expostas apenas as pe\u00e7as mais belas da cole\u00e7\u00e3o de locomotivas e de ve\u00edculos hist\u00f3ricos dos caminhos de ferro belgas, mas tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 ilustrado o papel importante do comboio na mobilidade atual e do futuro. Train World \u00e9 mais do que um museu, trata-se de um centro de interpreta\u00e7\u00e3o. A cenografia original \u2013 desenvolvida pelo artista Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten- cria uma experi\u00eancia interativa durante a qual o p\u00fablico pode olhar, ouvir, tocar e deixar-se surpreender por hist\u00f3rias apaixonantes do mundo ferrovi\u00e1rio.\r\nO local, situado ao longo do tra\u00e7ado da primeira linha de caminhos de ferro do continente europeu (Bruxelas\u2013Mechelen, 1835), inclui a esta\u00e7\u00e3o renovada de Schaerbeek, onde se encontra a bilheteira, e uma constru\u00e7\u00e3o nova de 8000 m\u00b2. Note-se que a esta\u00e7\u00e3o, constru\u00edda em 1887, \u00e9 um dos baluartes da arquitetura ferrovi\u00e1ria belga e um monumento classificado. Um estabelecimento de hoteleira e restaura\u00e7\u00e3o situado na esta\u00e7\u00e3o completa a oferta de Train World.\r\nUma oferta muito diversificada destinada a todo o mundo\r\nTrain World aloja in\u00fameros tesouros a descobrir. Por exemplo, \u00e9 poss\u00edvel a\u00ed admirar a locomotiva a vapor mais antiga mantida na B\u00e9lgica, a \u201cPa\u00eds de Waes\u201d. Ou ainda a locomotiva a vapor de carenagem \u201ctipo 12\u201d, que estabeleceu um novo recorde de velocidade em 1939. Tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 poss\u00edvel contemplar aut\u00eanticos e sumptuosos ve\u00edculos reais ou penetrar um dos ve\u00edculos TEE inox, antecessor dos comboios de grande velocidade, que percorriam a Europa na \u00e9poca. Com vontade de assumir o comando de um comboio?\r\nPoder\u00e1 experiment\u00e1-lo, num simulador de condu\u00e7\u00e3o. No lugar do condutor, poder\u00e1 observar as mudan\u00e7as no ambiente das linhas ao longo dos anos.\r\nTrain World apresenta igualmente centenas de objetos do mundo ferrovi\u00e1rio, como uniformes, pinturas ou maquetas de comboios e de esta\u00e7\u00f5es, assim como in\u00fameras fotos e videoclipes. A notar igualmente: a apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o de uma aut\u00eantica casinha de guarda das passagens de n\u00edvel, retomada na nova constru\u00e7\u00e3o de Train World. Estar\u00e1 mobilada com uma decora\u00e7\u00e3o dos anos 50. No s\u00f3t\u00e3o, ser\u00e3o expostos comboios miniatura.\r\nAs escolas e as fam\u00edlias com crian\u00e7as pequenas poder\u00e3o aproveitar uma oferta espec\u00edfica que acentua tanto o aspeto educativo como o l\u00fadico. As crian\u00e7as poder\u00e3o dar espa\u00e7o \u00e0 sua alegria num espa\u00e7o de jogos, como m\u00ednimo, original, especialmente concebido para elas: uma locomotiva a vapor que emerge do solo.\r\nGra\u00e7as \u00e0 colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com os construtores de comboios, as tecnologias modernas e os desenvolvimentos futuros ser\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m abordados. Desse modo, o p\u00fablico poder\u00e1 admirar, por exemplo, tr\u00eas comboios de \u00faltima gera\u00e7\u00e3o.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"fr":["Nord"],"nl":["Noord"],"en":["North"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":14733,"location":{"lat":50.87762766,"lon":4.37866751},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-06-07T16:05:04+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:54:59+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":252663,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Le nouveau mus\u00e9e Train World est la vitrine du pass\u00e9, du pr\u00e9sent et du futur des Chemins de fer.\r\nLes plus belles pi\u00e8ces de la collection historique du mat\u00e9riel roulant des Chemins de fer belges, compl\u00e8tement r\u00e9nov\u00e9es, seront enfin accessibles au public! Toutes ces pi\u00e8ces de valeur seront pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es dans un cadre adapt\u00e9 pour une visite confortable et agr\u00e9able.\r\nPourquoi Schaerbeek? La gare de Schaerbeek est un des fleurons de l\u2019architecture ferroviaire belge et se situe sur le trac\u00e9 de la premi\u00e8re ligne de chemin de fer du continent. Le site est par ailleurs facilement accessible en train, tram et voiture.\r\nTrain World vous promet une exp\u00e9rience unique et vous emm\u00e8ne \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte du pass\u00e9, du pr\u00e9sent et du futur des chemins de fer.","description_print":"Vitrine du pass\u00e9, du pr\u00e9sent et du futur sur le monde ferroviaire, Train World est le nom du nouveau mus\u00e9e des chemins de fer, actuellement en construction pr\u00e8s de la gare de Schaerbeek. Il abritera les pi\u00e8ces les plus pr\u00e9cieuses du patrimoine historique.Train World rendra hommage \u00e0 la riche histoire du train, mais d\u00e9montrera aussi que les chemins de fer n'ont pas fini de jouer un r\u00f4le important dans le d\u00e9veloppement de notre pays.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Prinses Elisabethplein","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaarbeek","address_line1":"Prinses Elisabethplein","address_line2":"1030 Schaarbeek","description_web":"Train World is een unieke spoorervaring die je van de allereerste stoomlocomotieven tot de flitsende hogesnelheidstreinen brengt! Het is een universum dat een beroep doet op alle zintuigen om de vele verschillende dimensies van de spoorwegen te kunnen bevatten. Een bezoek aan Train World is een actieve en verrassende uitstap. Je wandelt tussen locomotieven, neemt plaats in treinen van 100 jaar oud, bezoekt een spoorweghuisje en loopt over een echte spoorwegbrug. Je ervaart zelfs hoe het voelt om een trein te besturen!","description_print":"Train World is sinds september 2015 het uitstalraam voor de spoorwegen van gisteren, vandaag en morgen in Brussel. De site bevindt zich in Schaarbeek, op nauwelijks 10 minuten met de trein vanuit Brussel-Centraal (bij de Grote Markt). \r\n\r\nDe mooiste stukken uit de collectie historische locomotieven en rijtuigen van de Belgische spoorwegen zijn er te bewonderen, maar daarnaast wordt er ook de belangrijke rol van de trein in de mobiliteit van vandaag en de toekomst ge\u00efllustreerd. Train World is meer dan een museum: het is een belevingscentrum. Een originele scenografie \u2013 ontworpen door kunstenaar Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten - zorgt voor een ervaring waarbij je kan kijken, luisteren, aanraken en verrast worden door de boeiende verhalen uit de wereld van de trein.\r\n\r\n22-10-2019> 15-03-2020 : Tentoonstelling: Paul Delvaux, de man die van treinen hield \r\n\r\nPaul Delvaux (1897-1994) schilderde een meesterlijk oeuvre bijeen, met als inspiratiebron de wereld van de spoorwegen. Zijn surrealistische werken gaan moeiteloos op in de adembenemende scenografie van Train World. Als vanzelf ontstaat een boeiende dialoog.\r\n\r\nDeze expo is h\u00e9t uitgelezen moment om de artistieke evolutie van deze spoorwegliefhebber te ontdekken in een magische setting: van tekeningen, aquarellen en schilderijen uit de jaren 1920 tot monumentale werken uit de jaren 1970, maar ook persoonlijke objecten van de artiest voegen verrassende accenten toe. Dat de schilder in 1984 tot erestationschef van Louvain-la-Neuve werd benoemd, is veelbetekenend.\r\n\r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Train World, the showcase for the railways of yesterday, today and tomorrow, is a must-see tourist attraction in Brussels. The site is located a few minutes by train from Brussels Central station (near the Grand Place).\r\nHere you will be able to admire the loveliest pieces from the collection of historical locomotives and carriages from the Belgian railways, but it will also illustrate the significant role of the train in the mobility of today and in future. Train World is more than a museum: it will be an experience centre. An original scenography \u2013 designed by artist Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten \u2013 will provide an experience in which the audience can look, listen, touch and be surprised by scintillating stories from the world of trains.\r\nThe site comprises the renovated Schaerbeek station, where the ticket office is located, and a new 8,000 m\u00b2 building. A restaurant and a book & gift shop in the station completes the offering. It will also be possible to have a picnic: a restored carriage will be available in the transit area from the station to the new building for this purpose.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"Train World, the showcase for the railways of yesterday, today and tomorrow, is a must-see tourist attraction in Brussels. The site is located a few minutes by train from Brussels Central station (near the Grand Place)\r\nHere you will be able to admire the loveliest pieces from the collection of historical locomotives and carriages from the Belgian railways, but it will also illustrate the significant role of the train in the mobility of today and in future. Train World is more than a museum: it will be an experience centre. An original scenography \u2013 designed by artist Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten \u2013 will provide an experience in which the audience can look, listen, touch and be surprised by scintillating stories from the world of trains.\r\nThe site comprises the renovated Schaerbeek station, where the ticket office is located, and a new 8,000 m\u00b2 building. A restaurant and a book & gift shop in the station completes the offering. It will also be possible to have a picnic: a restored carriage will be available in the transit area from the station to the new building for this purpose.\r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"N\u00e4chste Haltestelle Train World... kleine und gro\u00dfe Eisenbahnfreunde erwartet in Br\u00fcssel ein neues \u201eMekka\": In dem historischen Geb\u00e4ude des ehemaligen Bahnhofs von Schaerbeek erwartet Sie das spektakul\u00e4re Eisenbahnmuseum Train World, dessen Szenographie aus der Feder des belgischen Comic-K\u00fcnstlers Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten stammt.\r\n\r\nSch\u00e4tze aus der Welt der Eisenbahn: Von der \u00e4ltesten Dampflokomotive Belgiens \u00fcber prunkvolle k\u00f6nigliche Wagons bis hin zu den modernen Hochgeschwindigkeitsz\u00fcgen - Train World f\u00fchrt die Besucher durch die belgische Eisenbahngeschichte. Neben historischem und technischem Wissen gibt es auch Anekdoten und Kuriosit\u00e4ten aus der Welt der Eisenbahn zu entdecken. Wie ist eine Schiene aufgebaut, wie schnell fuhren die ersten Dampfloks, wie reisten einst die K\u00f6nige? Antworten auf all diese Fragen geben die Erkl\u00e4rungstafeln, die auch auf Deutsch zur Verf\u00fcgung stehen, sowie die kostenlosen Audioguides (ebenfalls auf Deutsch).\r\n\r\nFahrsimulator: Sie haben schon immer davon getr\u00e4umt, Lokomotivf\u00fchrer zu werden? Dann nehmen Sie Platz im F\u00fchrerstand des Fahrsimulators und begeben sich auf eine Reise durch die Eisenbahngeschichte.\r\n\r\nLeibliches Wohl:\r\n\r\nIn der Brasserie \"RN Express\", die in dem historischen Bahnhofsgeb\u00e4ude untergebracht ist, gibt es Speisen und Getr\u00e4nke. Tiefblaue W\u00e4nde, gl\u00e4serne Kugellampen und Holzmobiliar sorgen f\u00fcr ein besonderes Ambiente.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Train World. Il museo nazionale del treno aprir\u00e0 le porte alla stazione di Schaerbeek.\r\nTesori del mondo ferroviario\r\nTrain World custodir\u00e0 numerosi tesori: la pi\u00f9 antica locomotiva conservata in Belgio, la \u201cpaese di Waes\u201d, o la locomotive a vapore carenata \u201ctipo 12\u201d che aveva stabilito un record di velocit\u00e0 nel 1939.\r\n\r\nSimulatore di guida\r\n\r\nAvete sempre avuto voglia di guidare un treno ? Train World vi sistema in un simulatore di guida! Nel posto dell\u2019autista, potrete osservare i cambi dell\u2019ambiente lungo le linee ferroviarie nel corso degli anni.\r\n\r\nScuole e famiglie\r\n\r\nI vostri bambini potranno approfittare di un\u2019offerta specifica che mette l\u2019accanto sia sul aspetto educativo che divertente. Potranno approfittare di un spazio giochi originale.\r\n\r\nSala eventi\r\n\r\nTrain World entra in stazione e Bruxelles si dota di un nuovo luogo per eventi! Con 550 m\u00b2, la magnifica sala degli sportelli della stazione di Schaerbeek, risalendo al 1913, offrir\u00e0 un quadro unico per eventi. Sar\u00e0 dotata di un\u2019installazione audiovisuale moderna. \r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Train World, la nueva atracci\u00f3n tur\u00edstica de Bruselas.\r\n\r\nTrain World es un escaparate para los ferrocarriles de ayer, hoy y ma\u00f1ana, es la nueva atracci\u00f3n tur\u00edstica de Bruselas. El lugar est\u00e1 situado a pocos minutos en tren de la Estaci\u00f3n Central de Bruselas (cerca de la Grand Place).\r\n\r\nAqu\u00ed tendr\u00e1s la oportunidad de admirar las piezas m\u00e1s encantadoras de la colecci\u00f3n de trenes y vagones hist\u00f3ricos de los ferrocarriles belgas, pero tambi\u00e9n ilustra el importante papel del tren en la movilidad de hoy en d\u00eda y el futuro. Train World es m\u00e1s que un museo: es un centro en el que podr\u00e1s vivir nuevas experiencias. Con una escenograf\u00eda original \u2013 dise\u00f1ada por el artista Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten \u2013 te ofrece una experiencia en la que puedes mirar, escuchar, tocar y sorprenderte con incre\u00edbles historias del mundo de los trenes.\r\nEl lugar, junto con las primeras v\u00edas ferroviarias del continente europeo, incluye la Estaci\u00f3n Schaerbeek renovada donde se encuentra la taquilla y un nuevo edificio de 8.000 m\u00b2. La antigua estaci\u00f3n, construida en 1887, es una las obras maestras de la arquitectura ferroviaria belga y es patrimonio hist\u00f3rico. Y para completar la oferta encontrar\u00e1s un restaurante y una tienda de regalos en la estaci\u00f3n.\r\n\r\nAlgo para todo el mundo\r\n\r\n\u00a1Hay mucho que descubrir en Train World! Por ejemplo, puedes ver el tren de vapor m\u00e1s antiguo preservado en B\u00e9lgica, la \u201cPays de Waes\u201d. O el tren de vapor simplificado \u201cType 12\u201d, que obtuvo el r\u00e9cord de velocidad en 1939. Puedes admirar el esplendor de los aut\u00e9nticos carruajes reales o pasear en el Trans-Europe Express (TEE) de acero inoxidable \u2013 el predecesor del tren de alta velocidad \u2013 que una vez cruz\u00f3 Europa. \u00bfTe gustar\u00eda conducir un tren? Entonces prueba suerte en uno de los simuladores de tren\u2026 o estudia los cambios que han sufrido los ferrocarriles de ayer y hoy desde una cabina de conductor.\r\n\r\nTambi\u00e9n hay cientos de objetos del mundo de los trenes, tales como uniformes, pinturas o modelos de trenes y estaciones, junto con una abundante cantidad de fotos y fragmentos de pel\u00edculas. Tambi\u00e9n cabe destacar la presencia de una aut\u00e9ntica \u201ccasa de guardabarreras\u201d que ha sido incluida en el nuevo edificio. Est\u00e1 amueblada al estilo de los a\u00f1os 50 y el \u00e1tico tiene un paisaje lleno de trenes en miniatura. \r\nColegios y familias con ni\u00f1os peque\u00f1os pueden disfrutar de ofertas espec\u00edficas, con especial atenci\u00f3n en el aspecto educativo relacionado con los juegos. Los ni\u00f1os pueden disfrutar en el \u201ctren de escalada\u201d, un tren de vapor medio enterrado.\r\n\r\nGracias a la cooperaci\u00f3n con los constructores de tren, la tecnolog\u00eda moderna y el desarrollo futuro tambi\u00e9n est\u00e1n en oferta. Ejemplo de esto son las tres cabinas de tren a tama\u00f1o real de los trenes m\u00e1s modernos.\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"Train World es un escaparate para los ferrocarriles de ayer, hoy y ma\u00f1ana, es la nueva atracci\u00f3n tur\u00edstica de Bruselas. El lugar est\u00e1 situado a pocos minutos en tren de la Estaci\u00f3n Central de Bruselas (cerca de la Grand Place).\r\n\r\nAqu\u00ed tendr\u00e1s la oportunidad de admirar las piezas m\u00e1s encantadoras de la colecci\u00f3n de trenes y vagones hist\u00f3ricos de los ferrocarriles belgas, pero tambi\u00e9n ilustra el importante papel del tren en la movilidad de hoy en d\u00eda y el futuro. Train World es m\u00e1s que un museo: es un centro en el que podr\u00e1s vivir nuevas experiencias. Con una escenograf\u00eda original \u2013 dise\u00f1ada por el artista Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten \u2013 te ofrece una experiencia en la que puedes mirar, escuchar, tocar y sorprenderte con incre\u00edbles historias del mundo de los trenes.\r\nEl lugar, junto con las primeras v\u00edas ferroviarias del continente europeo, incluye la Estaci\u00f3n Schaerbeek renovada donde se encuentra la taquilla y un nuevo edificio de 8.000 m\u00b2. La antigua estaci\u00f3n, construida en 1887, es una las obras maestras de la arquitectura ferroviaria belga y es patrimonio hist\u00f3rico. Y para completar la oferta encontrar\u00e1s un restaurante y una tienda de regalos en la estaci\u00f3n.\r\n\r\nAlgo para todo el mundo\r\n\r\n\u00a1Hay mucho que descubrir en Train World! Por ejemplo, puedes ver el tren de vapor m\u00e1s antiguo preservado en B\u00e9lgica, la \u201cPays de Waes\u201d. O el tren de vapor simplificado \u201cType 12\u201d, que obtuvo el r\u00e9cord de velocidad en 1939. Puedes admirar el esplendor de los aut\u00e9nticos carruajes reales o pasear en el Trans-Europe Express (TEE) de acero inoxidable \u2013 el predecesor del tren de alta velocidad \u2013 que una vez cruz\u00f3 Europa. \u00bfTe gustar\u00eda conducir un tren? Entonces prueba suerte en uno de los simuladores de tren\u2026 o estudia los cambios que han sufrido los ferrocarriles de ayer y hoy desde una cabina de conductor.\r\n\r\nTambi\u00e9n hay cientos de objetos del mundo de los trenes, tales como uniformes, pinturas o modelos de trenes y estaciones, junto con una abundante cantidad de fotos y fragmentos de pel\u00edculas. Tambi\u00e9n cabe destacar la presencia de una aut\u00e9ntica \u201ccasa de guardabarreras\u201d que ha sido incluida en el nuevo edificio. Est\u00e1 amueblada al estilo de los a\u00f1os 50 y el \u00e1tico tiene un paisaje lleno de trenes en miniatura. \r\nColegios y familias con ni\u00f1os peque\u00f1os pueden disfrutar de ofertas espec\u00edficas, con especial atenci\u00f3n en el aspecto educativo relacionado con los juegos. Los ni\u00f1os pueden disfrutar en el \u201ctren de escalada\u201d, un tren de vapor medio enterrado.\r\n\r\nGracias a la cooperaci\u00f3n con los constructores de tren, la tecnolog\u00eda moderna y el desarrollo futuro tambi\u00e9n est\u00e1n en oferta. Ejemplo de esto son las tres cabinas de tren a tama\u00f1o real de los trenes m\u00e1s modernos.\r\n\r\nTrain World will exceptionally be completely closed to the public from Monday 14 October to Monday 21 October 2019 and from Monday 16 March to Tuesday 17 March 2020 because of the assembly and dismantling of our exhibition dedicated to Paul Delvaux.\r\n\r\n","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Train World, o novo polo de atra\u00e7\u00e3o de Bruxelas\r\nTrain World, a montra dos caminhos de ferro de ontem, de hoje e de amanh\u00e3, \u00e9 a nova atra\u00e7\u00e3o tur\u00edstica de Bruxelas desde setembro de 2015. O local situa-se em Schaerbeek, a alguns minutos de comboio da Esta\u00e7\u00e3o Central (pr\u00f3ximo da Grand-Place).\r\nN\u00e3o est\u00e3o a\u00ed expostas apenas as pe\u00e7as mais belas da cole\u00e7\u00e3o de locomotivas e de ve\u00edculos hist\u00f3ricos dos caminhos de ferro belgas, mas tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 ilustrado o papel importante do comboio na mobilidade atual e do futuro. Train World \u00e9 mais do que um museu, trata-se de um centro de interpreta\u00e7\u00e3o. A cenografia original \u2013 desenvolvida pelo artista Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten- cria uma experi\u00eancia interativa durante a qual o p\u00fablico pode olhar, ouvir, tocar e deixar-se surpreender por hist\u00f3rias apaixonantes do mundo ferrovi\u00e1rio.\r\nO local, situado ao longo do tra\u00e7ado da primeira linha de caminhos de ferro do continente europeu (Bruxelas\u2013Mechelen, 1835), inclui a esta\u00e7\u00e3o renovada de Schaerbeek, onde se encontra a bilheteira, e uma constru\u00e7\u00e3o nova de 8000 m\u00b2. Note-se que a esta\u00e7\u00e3o, constru\u00edda em 1887, \u00e9 um dos baluartes da arquitetura ferrovi\u00e1ria belga e um monumento classificado. Um estabelecimento de hoteleira e restaura\u00e7\u00e3o situado na esta\u00e7\u00e3o completa a oferta de Train World.\r\nUma oferta muito diversificada destinada a todo o mundo\r\nTrain World aloja in\u00fameros tesouros a descobrir. Por exemplo, \u00e9 poss\u00edvel a\u00ed admirar a locomotiva a vapor mais antiga mantida na B\u00e9lgica, a \u201cPa\u00eds de Waes\u201d. Ou ainda a locomotiva a vapor de carenagem \u201ctipo 12\u201d, que estabeleceu um novo recorde de velocidade em 1939. Tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 poss\u00edvel contemplar aut\u00eanticos e sumptuosos ve\u00edculos reais ou penetrar um dos ve\u00edculos TEE inox, antecessor dos comboios de grande velocidade, que percorriam a Europa na \u00e9poca. Com vontade de assumir o comando de um comboio?\r\nPoder\u00e1 experiment\u00e1-lo, num simulador de condu\u00e7\u00e3o. No lugar do condutor, poder\u00e1 observar as mudan\u00e7as no ambiente das linhas ao longo dos anos.\r\nTrain World apresenta igualmente centenas de objetos do mundo ferrovi\u00e1rio, como uniformes, pinturas ou maquetas de comboios e de esta\u00e7\u00f5es, assim como in\u00fameras fotos e videoclipes. A notar igualmente: a apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o de uma aut\u00eantica casinha de guarda das passagens de n\u00edvel, retomada na nova constru\u00e7\u00e3o de Train World. Estar\u00e1 mobilada com uma decora\u00e7\u00e3o dos anos 50. No s\u00f3t\u00e3o, ser\u00e3o expostos comboios miniatura.\r\nAs escolas e as fam\u00edlias com crian\u00e7as pequenas poder\u00e3o aproveitar uma oferta espec\u00edfica que acentua tanto o aspeto educativo como o l\u00fadico. As crian\u00e7as poder\u00e3o dar espa\u00e7o \u00e0 sua alegria num espa\u00e7o de jogos, como m\u00ednimo, original, especialmente concebido para elas: uma locomotiva a vapor que emerge do solo.\r\nGra\u00e7as \u00e0 colabora\u00e7\u00e3o com os construtores de comboios, as tecnologias modernas e os desenvolvimentos futuros ser\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m abordados. Desse modo, o p\u00fablico poder\u00e1 admirar, por exemplo, tr\u00eas comboios de \u00faltima gera\u00e7\u00e3o.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Train World","address_street_name":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trainworld.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trainworld.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 224 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Place Princesse Elisabeth","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":14733,"location":{"lat":50.87762766,"lon":4.37866751},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-06-07T16:05:04+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:54:59+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/5f9da399a27b3ca7bedbbb0b8e622affa69e23c3.jpg","width":6472,"height":4480,"ratio":1.44,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Visites guid\u00e9es pour individuels","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Visites guid\u00e9es pour individuels","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Visites guid\u00e9es pour individuels","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[],"weekschema":[{"days":{"monday":{"is_open":false},"tuesday":{"is_open":false},"wednesday":{"is_open":false},"thursday":{"is_open":false},"friday":{"is_open":false},"saturday":{"is_open":false},"sunday":{"is_open":false}},"translations":{"fr":["lundi, mardi, mercredi, jeudi, vendredi, samedi et dimanche: ferm\u00e9"],"nl":["maandag, dinsdag, woensdag, donderdag, vrijdag, zaterdag en zondag: gesloten"],"en":["monday, tuesday, wednesday, thursday, friday, saturday and sunday: closed"]},"date_start":"2022-05-18","date_end":"2023-01-15","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":18},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"}},"value":1.25}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[252,255,256,257,259,261,263,265,266],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible aux personnes ayant des difficult\u00e9s de compr\u00e9hension","Accessible","Am\u00e9nagements pour les personnes aveugles et malvoyantes","Am\u00e9nagements pour personnes sourdes et malentendantes","Chien d'assistance","Parking accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor blinde en slechtziende personen","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for blind and partially-sighted persons","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet","Brussels Health Safety Label"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-06-07T16:05:04+02:00","published_at":"2022-05-19T10:52:35+02:00","backoffice_id":254054,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.20190228809246},{"id":523499,"date_start":"2021-11-25","date_end":"2025-12-31","date_next":"2025-12-31","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours"}},"others":{"list":[109],"translations":{"fr":["Espaces verts"],"nl":["Groene zones"],"en":["Green spaces"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["nl","fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Nourrir Bruxelles, entre ville et campagne","shortdescr":"D\u00e9couvrez la nature et l\u2019alimentation durable \u00e0 Neerpede (Anderlecht) \u00e0 travers une chasse aux tr\u00e9sors, guid\u00e9 par votre smartphone.","longdescr":"Connaissez-vous la zone de Neerpede \u00e0 Anderlecht ? Un territoire qui regorge de richesses naturelles ! Cette zone est cl\u00e9 pour l\u2019\u00e9quilibre de la ville, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 ses milieux aquatiques, ses zones bois\u00e9es, ses champs et sa biodiversit\u00e9 mais aussi pour \u201cnourrir Bruxelles\u201d.\r\n\r\nCe n\u2019est pas pour rien qu\u2019on voit \u00e9merger ici de nouvelles initiatives de jeunes urbains qui se lancent dans l\u2019agriculture agro\u00e9cologique pleine terre. D\u00e9couvrez ce territoire, sa biodiversit\u00e9, ses projets & enjeux et l\u2019importance d\u2019un bon \u00e9quilibre entre agriculture et nature.\r\n\r\nCOMMENT JOUER ?\r\nLa chasse est 100% gratuite !\r\n\r\nPour participer, t\u00e9l\u00e9chargez l\u2019application TOTEMUS sur votre smartphone, cherchez la balade \u00e0 Neerpede \u00ab Nourrir Bruxelles, entre ville et campagne \u00bb et amusez-vous !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/totemus.be\/les-chasses\/77-bruxelles-neerpede-nourrir-bruxelles-entre-ville-et-campagne","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/523499.html"},"nl":{"name":"Brusselse kost, tussen stad en platteland","shortdescr":"Ontdek de natuur en de duurzame voeding in Neerpede (het Pajottenland van Anderlecht) tijdens een schattenjacht, begeleid door je smartphone.","longdescr":"Ken je Neerpede in Anderlecht? Het is een plek met heel wat wondermooie natuur! Deze zone speelt een belangrijke rol in het natuurlijke evenwicht van Brussel, door de watergebieden, de bosjes, de velden en de biodiversiteit, maar ook als voedsel voor Brussel.\r\n\r\nNiet voor niets ontstaan hier allerlei nieuwe initiatieven van jonge stadsmensen, die gaan voor agro-ecologische landbouw in volle grond. Ontdek deze zone, zijn biodiversiteit, zijn projecten en uitdagingen, en het belang van een goed evenwicht tussen landbouw en natuur.\r\n\r\nHOE GA JE OP SCHATTENJACHT?\r\nDe jacht is 100% gratis !\r\n\r\nOm mee te doen installeer je de de TOTEMUS-app op je smartphone en je zoekt de de wandeling in Neerpede \u201cBrusselse kost, tussen stad en platteland.\u201d Veel plezier!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"info@mvb.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/523499.html"},"en":{"name":"Feeding Brussels, between city and countryside","shortdescr":"Discover nature and sustainable agriculture in Neerpede (Anderlecht), through a treasure hunt, guided by your smartphone.","longdescr":"Do you know the Neerpede area in Anderlecht? An area full of natural resources! This area is essential for the balance of the city, thanks to its aquatic environments, its wooded areas, its fields and its biodiversity, but also for \"feeding  Brussels\". It is not for nothing that new initiatives by young urbanites, who are embarking on agro-ecological farming, are emerging here.\r\nDiscover this territory, its biodiversity, its projects & challenges and the importance of a good balance between agriculture and nature.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/523499.html"},"de":{"name":"Brusselse kost, tussen stad en platteland","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/523499.html"},"it":{"name":"Brusselse kost, tussen stad en platteland","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/523499.html"},"sp":{"name":"Brusselse kost, tussen stad en platteland","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/523499.html"},"pt":{"name":"Brusselse kost, tussen stad en platteland","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/523499.html"},"cn":{"name":"Brusselse kost, tussen stad en platteland","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"perf