9en d\u00e9cembre 2023. Pour faire vivre ce petit oasis de verdure, Pali Pali s\u2019est associ\u00e9 \u00e0 Jardin afin de g\u00e9rer la guinguette du site. L\u2019id\u00e9e est de mettre \u00e0 disposition des \u00e9quipements pour l\u2019ensemble du quartier selon deux principes : cr\u00e9er du lien et vivre ensemble.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Grootgodshuisstraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grootgodshuisstraat, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"In afwachting van de grote renovatie die nodig is om een complex van wooneenheden en gemeenschapsdiensten te cre\u00ebren, heeft het Brusselse OCMW beslist het Hospice Pacheco ter beschikking te stellen voor een vernieuwend project met een sterke sociale en culturele ori\u00ebntatie.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Grand Hospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","desc