verstandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-06-10T01:36:15+02:00","published_at":"2021-09-06T14:08:23+02:00","backoffice_id":238477,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.14938015821857},{"id":533533,"date_start":"2022-06-09","date_end":"2022-06-12","date_next":"2022-06-10","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":84,"translations":{"fr":"Divers","nl":"Varia","en":"Various"}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"The Festival of the New European Bauhaus","shortdescr":"Le New European Bauhaus Festival rassemble des personnes de tous horizons pour d\u00e9battre et fa\u00e7onner notre avenir - un avenir durable, inclusif et beau. C'est une excellente occasion de cr\u00e9er des r\u00e9seaux, d'\u00e9changer des id\u00e9es et de c\u00e9l\u00e9brer un large \u00e9ventail de sujets allant de la science \u00e0 l'art, du design \u00e0 la politique, et de l'architecture \u00e0 la technologie.","longdescr":"Le nouveau festival europ\u00e9en du Bauhaus rassemble des personnes de tous horizons pour d\u00e9battre et fa\u00e7onner notre avenir - un avenir durable, inclusif et beau. C'est une excellente occasion de cr\u00e9er des r\u00e9seaux, d'\u00e9changer des id\u00e9es et de c\u00e9l\u00e9brer un large \u00e9ventail de sujets allant de la science \u00e0 l'art, du design \u00e0 la politique, et de l'architecture \u00e0 la technologie. Le Festival place le Green Deal europ\u00e9en au c\u0153ur de notre vie quotidienne.\r\nLe festival s'articulera autour de quatre piliers : le forum, la foire, la f\u00eate et les \u00e9v\u00e9nements parall\u00e8les. Ceux-ci se d\u00e9rouleront du 9 au 12 juin 2022 \u00e0 Bruxelles et au-del\u00e0. Les personnes du monde entier peuvent suivre le Festival en ligne sur notre plateforme d'\u00e9v\u00e9nements. Vous pouvez regarder les sessions du Forum diffus\u00e9es en direct, visiter l'exposition virtuelle de la Foire, explorer une carte interactive de toutes les activit\u00e9s du Festival et des \u00e9v\u00e9nements parall\u00e8les et nouer des contacts avec vos coll\u00e8gues.","performers":"Shigeru Ban (Architect, Japon); Une \u00e9toile un destin asbl (Belgique); Philippe Close (Bourgmestre de la Ville de Bruxelles); Elke van den Brandt (Ministre du Gouvernement de la R\u00e9gion de Bruxelles-Capitale, charg\u00e9e de la Mobilit\u00e9); C\u2019est moi l\u2019artista \/ Vecinos (Belgique); Patsyki z Franeka (Ukraine); STARS\u2019 WELL (Lettonie); AURA Dance Theatre (Lithuanie); Besac-Arthur (Belgique); Deva (Hongrie)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/new-european-bauhaus-festival.eu\/home","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/533533.html"},"nl":{"name":"The Festival of the New European Bauhaus","shortdescr":"Het New European Bauhaus Festival brengt mensen uit alle lagen van de bevolking samen om te debatteren en vorm te geven aan onze toekomst - een toekomst die duurzaam, inclusief en mooi is. Het is een uitgelezen kans om te netwerken, idee\u00ebn uit te wisselen en een breed scala aan onderwerpen te belichten, van wetenschap tot kunst, van design tot politiek, en van architectuur tot technologie.","longdescr":"Het New European Bauhaus Festival brengt mensen uit alle lagen van de bevolking samen om te debatteren en vorm te geven aan onze toekomst - een toekomst die duurzaam, inclusief en mooi is. Het is een uitgelezen kans om te netwerken, idee\u00ebn uit te wisselen en een breed scala aan onderwerpen te belichten, van wetenschap tot kunst, van design tot politiek, en van architectuur tot technologie. Het Festival brengt de European Green Deal naar het hart van ons dagelijks leven.\r\nHet Festival bestaat uit vier pijlers: het Forum , de Fair, het Fest en Side Events. Deze vinden plaats van 9 tot 12 juni 2022 in Brussel en daarbuiten. Mensen van over de hele wereld kunnen het Festival online volgen op ons evenementenplatform. U kunt de livestreams van de sessies van het Forum bekijken, de virtuele tentoonstelling van de Beurs bezoeken, een interactieve kaart van alle activiteiten van het Fest en de Side Events bekijken en netwerken met collega's","performers":"Shigeru Ban (Architect, Professor, Keio University, Japan); Une \u00e9toile un destin asbl (Belgium); Philippe Close (Mayor, Brussels); Elke van den Brandt (Brussels Minister van Mobiliteit); C\u2019est moi l\u2019artista \/ Vecinos (Belgium); Patsyki z Franeka (Ukraine); STARS\u2019 WELL (Latvia); AURA Dance Theatre (Lithuania); Besac-Arthur (Belgium); Deva (Hungary)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/533533.html"},"en":{"name":"The Festival of the New European Bauhaus","shortdescr":"The New European Bauhaus Festival brings together people from all walks of life to debate and shape our future - one that is sustainable, inclusive and beautiful. It is a great opportunity to network, exchange ideas and celebrate a wide range of topics from science to art, design to politics, and from architecture to technology.","longdescr":"The New European Bauhaus Festival brings together people from all walks of life to debate and shape our future - one that is sustainable, inclusive and beautiful. It is a great opportunity to network, exchange ideas and celebrate a wide range of topics from science to art, design to politics, and from architecture to technology. The Festival brings the European Green Deal to the heart of our daily lives.\r\nThe Festival will consist of four pillars: the Forum , the Fair, the Fest and Side Events. These will take place from 9 to 12 June 2022 in Brussels and beyond. People from all over the world can follow the Festival online on our event platform. You can watch the live-streamed sessions from the Forum, visit the virtual Fair exhibition, explore an interactive map of all Fest and Side events activities and network with colleagues","performers":"Shigeru Ban (Architect, Professor, Keio University, Japan); Une \u00e9toile un destin asbl (Belgium); Philippe Close (Mayor, Brussels); Elke van den Brandt (Minister for Mobility Brussels); C\u2019est moi l\u2019artista \/ Vecinos (Belgium); Patsyki z Franeka (Ukraine); STARS\u2019 WELL (Latvia); AURA Dance Theatre (Lithuania); Besac-Arthur (Belgium); Deva (Hungary)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/533533.html"},"de":{"name":"The Festival of the New European Bauhaus","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/533533.html"},"it":{"name":"The Festival of the New European Bauhaus","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/533533.html"},"sp":{"name":"The Festival of the New European Bauhaus","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/533533.html"},"pt":{"name":"The Festival of the New European Bauhaus","shortde