duction de th\u00e9\u00e2tre musico-litt\u00e9raire, Poema para los Muertos\/Po\u00e8me pour les morts. (Premi\u00e8re francophone\/espagnole)","longdescr":"La chorale Savia Flamenca rend hommage \u00e0 Federico Garc\u00eda Lorca avec une production de th\u00e9\u00e2tre musico-litt\u00e9raire, Po\u00e8me pour les morts.\r\n\r\nFederico Garc\u00eda Lorca, le po\u00e8te et \u00e9crivain andalou de renomm\u00e9e mondiale qui a \u00e9crit sur l'amour, le d\u00e9sir, la passion, l'oppression et la mort. Il a \u00e9t\u00e9 assassin\u00e9 \u00e0 Grenade le 18 ao\u00fbt 1936 par le r\u00e9gime franquiste.\r\n\r\nLe sc\u00e9nariste-r\u00e9alisateur-acteur-chanteur Antonio Jimenez a cr\u00e9\u00e9 un spectacle de flamenco multim\u00e9dia pour comm\u00e9morer le 85\u00e8me anniversaire de ce crime. Avec la po\u00e9sie, le chant, la danse et des images, il \u00e9voque l'\u0153uvre de Federico Garc\u00eda Lorca.\r\n\r\nCAST PROFESSIONEL FLAMENCO\r\nAntonio Paz (direction musicale, arrangements et chant), Sa\u00efdjah la Zambra (chor\u00e9ographie et danse) et Jos\u00e9-Luis Dominguez (arrangements et guitare).\r\n\r\nRESERVEZ VOTRE TICKET\r\n\u20ac 25 par personne\r\nhttps:\/\/saviaflamenca.eventgoose.com","performers":"Savia Flamenca (chorale), Sa\u00efdjah la Zambra (danse), Antonio Paz (cante jondo), Jos\u00e9-Luis Dominguez (guitare), Antonio Jimenez (acteur)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/530822.html"},"nl":{"name":"Poema para los Muertos - Gedicht voor de doden","shortdescr":"Het koor Savia flamenca brengt een eerbetoon aan Federico Garc\u00eda Lorca met een muzikaal-literair theaterproject, Poema para los Muertos","longdescr":null,"performers":"Savia Flamenca (koor), Sa\u00efdjah la Zambra (dans), Antonio Paz (cante jondo), Jos\u00e9-Luis Dominguez (gitaar), Antonio Jimenez (acteur)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/savia-flamenca-garcia-lorca.business.site","email":"mariepaulecarcan@telenet.be","phone_contact":"+32 473 45 26 53","phone_booking":"+32 473 45 26 53","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/530822.html"},"en":{"name":"Poema para los Muertos - Poem for the dead","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":"Savia Flamenca (choire), Sa\u00efdjah la Zambra (dance), Antonio Paz (cante jondo), Jos\u00e9-Luis Dominguez (guitar), Antonio Jimenez (actor)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/530822.html"},"de":{"name":"Poema para los Muertos - Po\u00e8me pour les morts","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/530822.html"},"it":{"name":"Poema para los Muertos - Po\u00e8me pour les morts","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/530822.html"},"sp":{"name":"Poema para los Muertos - Po\u00e8me pour les morts","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/530822.html"},"pt":{"name":"Poema para los Muertos - Po\u00e8me pour les morts","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/530822.html"},"cn":{"name":"Poema para los Muertos - Po\u00e8me pour les morts","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/53082