ospice","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"hospice@pali-pali.com","website":"http:\/\/grand-hospice.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":36966,"location":{"lat":50.85351136,"lon":4.35012167},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-06-05T01:07:40+02:00","published_at":"2021-07-27T16:19:21+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":250146,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Avenue Paul Deschanel","address_street_number":"143","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Avenue Paul Deschanel, 143","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Cactus Bruxelles \u00e0 v\u00e9lo est une association bruxelloise de guides b\u00e9n\u00e9voles locaux ayant \u00e0 coeur Bruxelles et le v\u00e9lo.\r\nIls partagent avec enthousiasme leur passion pour la ville et le v\u00e9lo avec les visiteurs de la ville et les autres Bruxellois. Ils offrent une exp\u00e9rience et une introduction authentique \u00e0 Bruxelles. A v\u00e9lo ils trouvent le rythme id\u00e9al pour vous immerger dans la ville et sa diversit\u00e9.\r\nAvant tout, ils pr\u00e9f\u00e8rent vous guider le long des chemins les moins battus de Bruxelles et cela dans une ambiance conviviale. D\u00e9couvrez Bruxelles pleinement et d\u00e9couvrez plus que vous ne le pensez \u00e0 v\u00e9lo !\r\nZaterdagtour","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Paul Deschanellaan","address_street_number":"143","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaarbeek","address_line1":"Paul Deschanellaan, 143","address_line2":"1030 Schaarbeek","description_web":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo is een Brusselse vereniging van lokale vrijwilligersgidsen met een hart voor Brussel en de fiets.\r\nHun passie voor de stad en de fiets delen ze met veel enthousiasme met bezoekers van de stad en andere Brusselaars. Ze bieden een authentieke ervaring en kennismaking met Brussel en vinden met de fiets het ideale ritme om je onder te dompelen in het veelzijdige Brussel. Liefst van al gidsen ze je langs de minder begane paden de stad in een gemoedelijke sfeer. Beleef Brussel ten volle met te fiets en ontdek meer dan je verwacht!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Avenue Paul Deschanel","address_street_number":"143","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Avenue Paul Deschanel, 143","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"Cactus is a committed group of Brussels residents with a passion for the city and the bike. With an open-minded view on the city our guides set to work with the many possibilities, dynamics and diversity of the city. They make visitors experience this vibrant and complex city. During our guided bike tours, we aim for a convivial atmosphere with space for interaction and encounters. We opt for the bicycle as it is the ideal way to (re)discover Brussels and to move around in the city.\r\nExperience Brussels to the fullest and discover more than you expect!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Avenue Paul Deschanel","address_street_number":"143","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Avenue Paul Deschanel, 143","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Avenue Paul Deschanel","address_street_number":"143","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Avenue Paul Deschanel, 143","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_street_name":"Avenue Paul Deschanel","address_street_number":"143","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cactus.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.cactus.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 497 19 07 14","address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Avenue Paul Deschanel, 143","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Cactus Brussel \u00e0 v\u00e9lo","address_stree