ersonnes sourdes et malentendantes","Chien d'assistance","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Voorzieningen voor blinde en slechtziende personen","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Facilities for blind and partially-sighted persons","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-06-05T01:06:36+02:00","published_at":"2021-05-12T09:11:18+02:00","backoffice_id":231490,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.1399912277661},{"id":534118,"date_start":"2022-06-03","date_end":"2022-06-18","date_next":"2022-06-11","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition"}},"others":{"list":[36,40],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Arts graphiques"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Grafische kunst, vormgeving"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Graphic art"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Tir Group\u00e9","shortdescr":"Une ode \u00e0 la voyoucratie des polars fran\u00e7ais et am\u00e9ricains des ann\u00e9es 70's par une belle collection d'affiches cr\u00e9\u00e9es par Ren\u00e9 FERRACCI","longdescr":"Flic Story, Le Gang, Peur sur la ville... C\u2019est dans l\u2019ombre de ces\r\npolars embl\u00e9matiques que Dave Decat rend \u00e0 nouveau hommage\r\n\u00e0 la voyoucratie urbaine d\u2019antan.\r\nApr\u00e8s les Apaches, la p\u00e8gre de Hambourg et les loubards,\r\nl\u2019illustrateur bruxellois se confronte cette fois-ci \u00e0 l\u2019univers haut\r\nen couleurs des truands des seventies.\r\nExplorant exclusivement le format spectaculaire de l\u2019affiche\r\ncin\u00e9matographique, Dave Decat nous emm\u00e8ne aussi \u00e0 la rencontre\r\ndu plus grand affichiste fran\u00e7ais : Ren\u00e9 Ferracci.\r\nCe dernier a marqu\u00e9 son temps \u00e0 travers une production prolifique,\r\nse caract\u00e9risant entre autres par une virtuosit\u00e9 technique m\u00ealant\r\npeinture, dessin, photomontages et typographie dans des compositions\r\n\u00e9blouissantes. Dou\u00e9 d\u2019une \u00e9nergie cr\u00e9ative in\u00e9puisable, il s\u2019est attaqu\u00e9\r\n\u00e0 tous les genres du cin\u00e9ma populaire, y compris le r\u00e9cit policier.\r\nTir Group\u00e9 rassemble donc des affiches originales de polars sign\u00e9es\r\nFerracci (et accessoirement quelques productions am\u00e9ricaines de la\r\nm\u00eame veine) m\u00eal\u00e9es \u00e0 des oeuvres o\u00f9 Dave Decat se r\u00e9approprie avec\r\nbrio une grammaire visuelle inscrite dans une \u00e9poque. Mais \u00e0 l\u2019inverse\r\nde magnifier la figure du h\u00e9ros, ces (re)cr\u00e9ations picturales se focalisent\r\nsur les trognes des bad guys des films en question.\r\nLa sc\u00e9nographie de l\u2019exposition est compl\u00e9t\u00e9e par un panorama de\r\nlivres et de magazines rendant hommage \u00e0 la culture criminelle typique\r\ndes 70s.\r\nLe vernissage du jeudi 2 juin donne \u00e9galement lieu \u00e0 un concert de\r\nMinos, formation electro instrumentale impr\u00e9gn\u00e9e des BO des Giallos\r\nainsi que des sons New Wave et Krautrock.","performers":"Affiches de Ren\u00e9 FERRACCI, dans la collection de Dave DECAT\r\nCommissaires de l'exposition : Jacques VANDENHEEDE & Jimmy PANTERA","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/lamaisondelimage.be","email":"contact@lamaisondelimage.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 98 11 99","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/534118.html"},"nl":{"name":"Tir Group\u00e9","shortdescr":"Een ode aan de \"voyoucratie\" van de franse en amerikaanse thrillermovies van de jaren 70, door een tentoonstelling van affiches van Ren\u00e9 FERRACCI","longdescr":null,"performers":"Affiches van Ren\u00e9 FERRACCI, in de collectie van Dave DECAT\r\nCommissarissen van de tentoonstelling : Jacques VANDENHEEDE & Jimmy PANTERA","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/534118.html"},"en":{"name":"Tir Group\u00e9","shortdescr":"An ode to the \"voyoucratie\" in the seventies french and american thrillermovies in a collection of posters created by Ren\u00e9 FERRACCI","longdescr":null,"performers":"Posters from Ren\u00e9 FERRACCI, collection from Dave DECAT\r\nCurator of the exhibition : Jacques VANDENHEEDE & Jimmy PANTERA","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/534118.html"},"de":{"name":"Tir Group\u00e9","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/534118.html"},"it":{"name":"Tir Group\u00e9","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/534118.html"},"sp":{"name":"Tir Group\u00e9","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/534118.html"},"pt":{"name":"Tir Group\u00e9","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null