s - Spectacle d'improvisation","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Mal\u00e9dictions - Spectacle d'improvisation","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-04-30","doors":"18:00:00","start":"20:15:00","end":"22:15:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2022-06-11","doors":"18:00:00","start":"20:15:00","end":"22:15:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[255,263],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen"],"en":["Accessible","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-01T01:35:39+02:00","published_at":"2022-03-30T12:58:35+02:00","backoffice_id":250597,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.35962828892923},{"id":535547,"date_start":"2022-06-11","date_end":"2022-06-11","date_next":"2022-06-11","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[4,6],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Worldmusic, Folk & Country"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Moi et le Th\u00e9o en concert pour Pool is Cool !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Avec Moi et le Th\u00e9o\/Ik en den Theo vous (re)d\u00e9couvrez le monde \u00e0 travers les yeux des petits. Enfants, parents et grands-parents marchent comme des robots, dansent la chaise musicale, re\u00e7oivent un souffle \u00e9nergique de l\u2019oncle Jazz, jouent de l'air guitar et m\u00eame plus. Bref, ils explorent les limites ext\u00e9rieures de leur fantaisie.\r\n\r\nEn fonction de la composition du public, Moi et le Th\u00e9o\/Ik en den Theo chantent en fran\u00e7ais, en n\u00e9erlandais ou, dans le meilleur des mondes, en deux langues.\r\n\r\nPiet Maris et Theophane Raballand (tous les deux de Jaune Toujours) font leur truc \u00e0 l'accord\u00e9on, \u00e0 la batterie et aux percussions, mais surtout ... avec le public, qui est sans cesse invit\u00e9 \u00e0 danser, \u00e0 chanter, \u00e0 sauter et \u00e0 imaginer.\r\n\r\nIk en den Theo\/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o veulent aider Flow et leur campagne de Crowdfunding en donnant un concert dans la seule piscine en plein air de Bruxelles !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.pooliscool.org\/event-content\/2022\/6\/11\/je-veux-nager-flow","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/535547.html"},"nl":{"name":"Ik en den Theo in concert voor Pool is Cool !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Bij Ik en den Theo \/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o (her)bekijk je de wereld door kinderogen. Kinderen, ouders en grootouders kunnen rondlopen als robots, stoelendansen, bezoek krijgen van nonkel Jazz, luchtgitaar spelen en nog veel meer... Kortom, ze verkennen de uiterste grenzen van hun fantasie.\r\n\r\nAfhankelijk van de samenstelling van het publiek zingen Ik en den Theo\/Moi et le Th\u00e9o in het Nederlands of in het Frans of, in de beste van alle werelden, in beide talen.\r\n\r\nPiet Maris en Theophane Raballand (allebei van Jaune Toujours) doen hun ding op accordeon en slagwerk ... en met het publiek, dat voortdurend wordt uitgedaagd om mee te zingen, dansen, springen en fantaseren.\r\n\r\nIk en den Theo willen Flow en hun Crowdfunding campagne helpen door een concert te geven in het enige openluchtzwembad van Brussel!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/535547.html"},"en":{"name":"Ik en den Theo\/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o in concert for Pool is Cool","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Ik en den Theo\/Moi et le Th\u00e9o look at the world through children's eyes. Piet Maris and Theophane Raballand ( both of Jaune Toujours) do their thing on accordion and drums... and with the audience. Depending on its composition Ik en den Theo\/Moi et le Th\u00e9o sing in Dutch or French, or in the best of worlds in both languages.\r\n\r\nIk en den Theo\/ Me and the Theo want to help Flow and their Crowdfunding campaign by giving a concert in the only open air swimming pool in Brussels!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/535547.html"},"de":{"name":"Ik en den Theo \/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o en concert pour Pool is Cool !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/535547.html"},"it":{"name":"Ik en den Theo \/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o en concert pour Pool is Cool !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/535547.html"},"sp":{"name":"Ik en den Theo \/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o en concert pour Pool is Cool !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/535547.html"},"pt":{"name":"Ik en den Theo \/ Moi et le Th\u00e9o en concert pour Pool is Cool !","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performer