,"start":"20:00:00","end":"21:30:00"},{"day":"2022-06-09","doors":null,"start":"20:00:00","end":"21:30:00"},{"day":"2022-06-14","doors":null,"start":"20:00:00","end":"21:30:00"},{"day":"2022-06-16","doors":null,"start":"20:00:00","end":"21:30:00"},{"day":"2022-06-21","doors":null,"start":"20:00:00","end":"21:30:00"},{"day":"2022-06-23","doors":null,"start":"20:00:00","end":"21:30:00"},{"day":"2022-06-28","doors":null,"start":"20:00:00","end":"21:30:00"},{"day":"2022-06-30","doors":null,"start":"20:00:00","end":"21:30:00"}],"weekschema":[{"days":{"monday":{"is_open":false},"tuesday":{"is_open":true,"hours":[{"start":"20:00:00","end":"21:30:00"}]},"wednesday":{"is_open":false},"thursday":{"is_open":true,"hours":[{"start":"20:00:00","end":"21:30:00"}]},"friday":{"is_open":false},"saturday":{"is_open":false},"sunday":{"is_open":false}},"translations":{"fr":["lundi, mercredi, vendredi, samedi et dimanche: ferm\u00e9","mardi et jeudi: de 20:00 \u00e0 21:30"],"nl":["maandag, woensdag, vrijdag, zaterdag en zondag: gesloten","dinsdag en donderdag: van 20:00 tot 21:30"],"en":["monday, wednesday, friday, saturday and sunday: closed","tuesday and thursday: from 20:00 to 21:30"]},"date_start":"2021-09-02","date_end":"2022-06-30","is_also_by_appointment":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":60}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-06-10T01:36:14+02:00","published_at":"2021-07-27T14:22:27+02:00","backoffice_id":236126,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"sport","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.14904967006325},{"id":534024,"date_start":"2022-06-14","date_end":"2022-06-14","date_next":"2022-06-14","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[3],"translations":{"fr":["Musique Contemporaine"],"nl":["Hedendaagse Muziek"],"en":["Contemporary music"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["nl","fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Pat Thomas - Seymour Wright - Paul Abbott - Chris Corsano","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Pat thomas - Seymour Wright - Paul Abbott (uk) + Chris Corsano (usa)\r\n\r\nPat Thomas studied classical piano from aged 8 and started playing Jazz from the age of 16. He has since gone on to develop an utterly unique style - embracing improvisation, jazz and new music. He has played with Derek Bailey in Company Week (1990\/91) and in the trio AND (with Noble) \u2013 with Tony Oxley\u2019s Quartet and Celebration Orchestra and in Duo with Lol Coxhill. \r\n\r\n\"Sartorially shabby as Thomas may be, and on first impression even rather stolid, he has a somewhat imperious charisma that\u2019s immediately amplified when he starts to play. Unlike other pianists whose virtuosity seems to be racing ahead of their thought processes Thomas always seems supremely in command of his gift, and his playing, no matter how free and ready to tangle with abstraction, always carries a charge of authoritative exactitude.\" - The Jazzmann \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSeymour Wright\u2019s work is about the creative, situated friction of learning, ideas, people and the saxophone \u2013 music, history, and technique \u00ad\u2013 actual and potential.\r\n\r\nHis solo work is documented on three widely-acclaimed collections - Seymour Wright of Derby (2008), Seymour Writes Back (2015) and Is This Right? (2017).\r\n\r\nCurrent projects include abaria with Ute Kanngiesser; [Ahmed] with Antonin Gerbal, Joel Grip and Pat Thomas; @xcrswx with Crystabel Riley; GUO with Daniel Blumberg; The Experimental Library with Evie Ward; XT with Paul Abbott; a trans-Atlantic duet with Anne Guthrie, and, with Jean-luc Guionnet a project addressing imaginary lacunae in Aby Warburg's Atlas Mnemosyne.\r\n\r\nHis writing has been published in C\/\/A, Sound American, and The Wire.\r\n\r\nwww.seymourwright.com\r\n\r\nPaul Abbott works with real and imaginary drums, synthetic sounds, performance, and writing: exploring how sounds, signs, and the physical body effect each other in an experimental musical play.\r\n\r\nRecent and ongoing collaborations include\u2014XT with Seymour Wright; F.R.David with Will Holder; Rian Treanor Duo; RP Boo Trio with XT; The Creaking Breeze Ensemble with Nathaniel Mackey, Ute Kanngie\u00dfer, Evie Ward, Seymour Wright and Billy Steiger; yPLO with Micheal Speers; Falls with Keira Greene and performances with Cara Tolmie.\r\n\r\nPaul has performed internationally at Cafe OTO, Talbot Rice Gallery, Whitstable Biennale, Whitechapel Gallery, Raven Row, Tate Modern, Counterflows, Next Festival, KW Institute Berlin, Serralves Porto, Empty Gallery HK. He has records released by OTORoku, Empty Editions, Pleasures of The Text, and published with Cesura\/\/Acceso and F.R.David. Residencies include Cafe OTO, KW Institute, Empty Gallery.\r\n\r\nRecent releases include\u2014Deorlaf X (XT), Very Good* (FR David, Will Holder), Ductus (solo), 31.12.18 (XT\/RP Boo) Palina\u2019Tufa (XT) and Stop Constant. He was one of the co-editor\u2019s of Cesura\/\/Acceso and a Sound and Music \u201cEmbedded\u201d resident artist at Cafe OTO 2015-2016.\r\n\r\nwww.paulabbott.net\r\n\r\nChris Corsano (usa)\r\n\r\nOne of the greatest drummers working today, Corsano has developed a percussive language of extraordinary amplitude and infinite resources. His collaborations stretch from free jazz greats (Joe McPhee, Paul Flaherty & more) to noise mavens (Bill Nace, C Spencer Yeh etc) and pop superstars (Bj\u00f6rk). Capable of generating narrative out of permanent ecstasy, Corsano never ceases to be profoundly affirmative and imposing of his language, and being an absolute and charismatic virtuoso, he simultaneously is one of the most noble and generous improvisers of the few last decades. \r\n\r\n\"Corsano, as ever, is a joy to hear - it goes without saying that he has carved out a name for himself as one of the greatest improvisational drummers.\" - Derek Stone, Free Jazz Blog","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lesateliersclaus.com","email":"info@lesateliersclaus.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/534024.html"},"nl":{"name":"Pat Thomas - Seymour Wright - Paul Abbott - Chris Corsano","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Pat Thomas studeerde klassieke piano vanaf 8 jaar en begon jazz te spelen vanaf zijn 16e. Sindsdien heeft hij een volkomen unieke stijl ontwikkeld - improvisatie, jazz en nieuwe muziek. Hij speelde met Derek Bailey in Company Week (1990\/91) en in het trio AND (met Noble) - met Tony Oxley's Quartet and Celebration Orchestra en in Duo met Lol Coxhill.\r\n\r\n\"Hoe sjofel Thomas ook mag zijn, en bij de eerste indruk zelfs nogal stijfjes, hij heeft een ietwat heerszuchtig charisma dat onmiddellijk wordt versterkt wanneer hij begint te spelen. In tegenstelling tot andere pianisten wiens virtuositeit hun denkprocessen vooruit lijkt te rennen, lijkt Thomas altijd oppermachtig in beheersing van zijn gave, en zijn spel, hoe vrij en klaar om te verwarren met abstractie, draagt \u200b\u200baltijd een lading van gezaghebbende nauwkeurigheid met zich mee. - De Jazzmann\r\n\r\nHet werk van Seymour Wright gaat over de creatieve, gesitueerde wrijving van leren, idee\u00ebn, mensen en de saxofoon - muziek, geschiedenis en techniek - actueel en potentieel.\r\n\r\nZijn solowerk is gedocumenteerd in drie alom geprezen collecties - Seymour Wright of Derby (2008), Seymour Writes Back (2015) en Is This Right? (2017).\r\n\r\nLopende projecten zijn onder meer abaria met Ute Kanngiesser; [Ahmed] met Antonin Gerbal, Joel Grip en Pat Thomas; @xcrswx met Crystabel Riley; GUO met Daniel Blumberg; De experimentele bibliotheek met Evie Ward; XT met Paul Abbott; een trans-Atlantisch duet met Anne Guthrie, en met Jean-luc Guionnet een project over denkbeeldige lacunes in Atlas Mnemosyne van Aby Warburg.\r\n\r\nZijn werk is gepubliceerd in C \/\/ A, Sound American en The Wire.\r\n\r\nwww.seymourwright.com\r\n\r\nPaul Abbott werkt met echte en denkbeeldige drums, synthetische geluiden, performance en schrijven: onderzoeken hoe geluiden, tekens en het fysieke lichaam elkaar be\u00efnvloeden in een experimenteel muzikaal spel.\r\n\r\nRecente en lopende samenwerkingen omvatten \u2014 XT met Seymour Wright; FRDavid met Will Holder; Rian Treanor-duo; RP Boo Trio met XT; The Creaking Breeze Ensemble met Nathaniel Mackey, Ute Kanngie\u00dfer, Evie Ward, Seymour Wright en Billy Steiger; yPLO met Michael Speers; Valt met Keira Greene en optredens met Cara Tolmie.\r\n\r\nPaul trad internationaal op in Cafe OTO, Talbot Rice Gallery, Whitstable Biennale, Whitechapel Gallery, Raven Row, Tate Modern, Counterflows, Next Festival, KW Institute Berlin, Serralves Porto, Empty Gallery HK. Hij heeft platen uitgebracht door OTORoku, Empty Editions, Pleasures of The Text, en gepubliceerd met Cesura \/\/ Acceso en F.R.David. Residenties omvatten Cafe OTO, KW Institute, Empty Gallery.\r\n\r\nRecente releases zijn onder meer - Deorlaf X (XT), Very Good * (FR David, Will Holder), Ductus (solo), 31.12.18 (XT \/ RP Boo) Palina'Tufa (XT) en Stop Constant. Hij was een van de co-editors van Cesura \/\/ Acceso en een Sound and Music \u201cEmbedded\u201d resident artist in Cafe OTO 2015-2016.\r\n\r\nwww.paulabbott.net","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/534024.html"},"en":{"name":"Pat Thomas - Seymour Wright - Paul Abbott - Chris Corsano","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/534024.html"},"de":{"name":"Pat Thomas - Seymour Wright - Paul Abbott - Chris Corsano","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/534024.html"},"it":{"name":"Pat Thomas - Seymour Wright - Paul Abbott - Chris Corsano","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/534024.html"},"sp":{"name":"Pat Thomas - Seymour Wright - Paul Abbott - Chris Corsano","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/534024.html"},"pt":{"name":"Pat Thomas - Seymour Wright - Paul Abbott - Chris Corsano","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/534024.html"},"cn":{"name":"Pat Thomas - Seymour Wright - Paul Abbott - Chris Corsano","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/534024.html"}},"place":{"id":248041,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Les Ateliers Claus","address_street_name":"Rue Crickx","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lesateliersclaus.com","website":"http:\/\/www.lesateliersclaus.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 51 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Crickx, 12","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Au d\u00e9part plut\u00f4t ateliers d'artistes, les Ateliers Claus sont petit \u00e0 petit devenus aussi un lieu de musique. Une vraie plateforme de cr\u00e9ation originale et ouverte \u00e0 tous les artistes en qu\u00eate d'aventure et d'exp\u00e9rimentation dont le coeur balance entre Art et Rock 'n Roll!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Les Ateliers Claus","address_street_name":"Crickxstraat","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lesateliersclaus.com","website":"http:\/\/www.lesateliersclaus.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 51 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Crickxstraat, 12","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Les Ateliers Claus bestaat sinds 2006, in eerste instantie als een artiestieke werkplaats, maar hoe langer hoe meer als een spannende broedplek voor podiumtalent. Met ruimte voor Belgische en internationale artiesten binnen al wat opwindend, experimenteel, gedurfd en uniek is. De leuze is niet voor niets \"between art en rock-'n-roll.\"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Les Ateliers Claus","address_street_name":"rue Crickx","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lesateliersclaus.com","website":"http:\/\/www.lesateliersclaus.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 51 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"rue Crickx, 12","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Exists since 2006, initially it was as an artistic studio and working place, today it developed into an exciting stage for up and coming musicians. There's room for Belgian and international artists as long as they're exciting, experimental, adventurous and unique. Between art and rock'n'roll!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Les Ateliers Claus","address_street_name":"Rue Crickx","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lesateliersclaus.com","website":"http:\/\/www.lesateliersclaus.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 51 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Crickx, 12","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Die Ateliers Claus, die urspr\u00fcnglich als K\u00fcnstler-Atelier geplant waren, haben sich in Br\u00fcssel nach und nach auch zu einer Referenz der kreativen Musikszene entwickelt, deren Motto \u201ezwischen Kunst und Rock\u2019n Roll\u201c lauten k\u00f6nnte.\r\n\r\nAls originelle Plattform der Musikkreation, die allen experimentierfreudigen und abenteuerlustigen K\u00fcnstlern - belgisch und international - offensteht, sind die Ateliers Claus eine feste Gr\u00f6\u00dfe in der Br\u00fcsseler Kulturlandschaft geworden.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Les Ateliers Claus","address_street_name":"rue Crickx","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lesateliersclaus.com","website":"http:\/\/www.lesateliersclaus.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 51 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"rue Crickx, 12","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Esiste dal 2006, per lo pi\u00f9 come studio d'arte e laboratorio, ma sta diventando una scena sempre pi\u00f9 emozionante per i musicisti ambiziosi. La sala ospita artisti belgi ed internazionali, a condizione che sappiano affascinare e che siano sperimentali, innovativi ed unici. Tra l'arte e il rock'n'roll! \r\n\r\nVisita il sito per scoprire il programma!  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Les Ateliers Claus","address_street_name":"rue Crickx","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lesateliersclaus.com","website":"http:\/\/www.lesateliersclaus.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 51 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"rue Crickx, 12","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Existe desde 2006, esencialmente como estudio art\u00edstico y taller, pero es cada vez m\u00e1s un escenario palpitante para m\u00fasicos ambiciosos. En la sala act\u00faan artistas belgas e internacionales, siempre que sean fascinantes, experimentales, innovadores y \u00fanicos. \u00a1Entre el arte y el rock and roll! \r\n\r\n\u00a1Visita el sitio web para consultar la programaci\u00f3n!  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Les Ateliers Claus","address_street_name":"Rue Crickx","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lesateliersclaus.com","website":"http:\/\/www.lesateliersclaus.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 51 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Crickx, 12","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Les Ateliers Claus","address_street_name":"Rue Crickx","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lesateliersclaus.com","website":"http:\/\/www.lesateliersclaus.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 51 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Crickx, 12","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":"153188371388067","backoffice_id":10211,"location":{"lat":50.82759285,"lon":4.33933905},"region":"brusse