teliersclaus.com","website":"http:\/\/www.lesateliersclaus.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 51 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"rue Crickx, 12","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Exists since 2006, initially it was as an artistic studio and working place, today it developed into an exciting stage for up and coming musicians. There's room for Belgian and international artists as long as they're exciting, experimental, adventurous and unique. Between art and rock'n'roll!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Les Ateliers Claus","address_street_name":"Rue Crickx","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lesateliersclaus.com","website":"http:\/\/www.lesateliersclaus.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 51 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Crickx, 12","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Die Ateliers Claus, die urspr\u00fcnglich als K\u00fcnstler-Atelier geplant waren, haben sich in Br\u00fcssel nach und nach auch zu einer Referenz der kreativen Musikszene entwickelt, deren Motto \u201ezwischen Kunst und Rock\u2019n Roll\u201c lauten k\u00f6nnte.\r\n\r\nAls originelle Plattform der Musikkreation, die allen experimentierfreudigen und abenteuerlustigen K\u00fcnstlern - belgisch und international - offensteht, sind die Ateliers Claus eine feste Gr\u00f6\u00dfe in der Br\u00fcsseler Kulturlandschaft geworden.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Les Ateliers Claus","address_street_name":"rue Crickx","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lesateliersclaus.com","website":"http:\/\/www.lesateliersclaus.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 51 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"rue Crickx, 12","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Esiste dal 2006, per lo pi\u00f9 come studio d'arte e laboratorio, ma sta diventando una scena sempre pi\u00f9 emozionante per i musicisti ambiziosi. La sala ospita artisti belgi ed internazionali, a condizione che sappiano affascinare e che siano sperimentali, innovativi ed unici. Tra l'arte e il rock'n'roll! \r\n\r\nVisita il sito per scoprire il programma!  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Les Ateliers Claus","address_street_name":"rue Crickx","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lesateliersclaus.com","website":"http:\/\/www.lesateliersclaus.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 51 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"rue Crickx, 12","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Existe desde 2006, esencialmente como estudio art\u00edstico y taller, pero es cada vez m\u00e1s un escenario palpitante para m\u00fasicos ambiciosos. En la sala act\u00faan artistas belgas e internacionales, siempre que sean fascinantes, experimentales, innovadores y \u00fanicos. \u00a1Entre el arte y el rock and roll! \r\n\r\n\u00a1Visita el sitio web para consultar la programaci\u00f3n!  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Les Ateliers Claus","address_street_name":"Rue Crickx","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lesateliersclaus.com","website":"http:\/\/www.lesateliersclaus.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 51 03","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Crickx, 12","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Les Ateliers Claus","address_street_name":"Rue Crickx","address_street_number":"12","address_street_box":null,"email":"inf