","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":497525,"date_start":"2022-06-16","date_end":"2022-06-16","date_next":"2022-06-16","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[4,7],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Frustration + Zombie Zombie - Us\u00e9","shortdescr":"Une double affiche du tonnerre pour f\u00eater les 15 ans du label Born Bad Records !","longdescr":"Si cela fait maintenant une bonne quinzaine d\u2019ann\u00e9e que Frustration fait r\u00e9gner sa loi sur le post-punk hexagonal, cela fait de notre c\u00f4t\u00e9 plusieurs mois que nous courons derri\u00e8re le groupe pour lui trouver une date belge \u00e0 la hauteur de son statut. Et c\u2019est d\u00e9sormais chose faite. Trois ann\u00e9es apr\u00e8s son dernier passage bruxellois, le plus vieux pensionnaire de l\u2019\u00e9curie Born Bad Records est de retour pour sa premi\u00e8re Orangerie. Dans une ambiance qui s\u2019annonce \u00e9lectrique, Frustration sortira l\u2019artillerie lourde, entre classiques de toujours et extraits de son dernier album \u00ab So Cold Streams \u00bb, sorti l\u2019ann\u00e9e derni\u00e8re sur Born Bad. Sur celui-ci, le groupe a r\u00e9ussi le petit exploi de ne pas trahir sa ligne de conduite tout en proposant des choses in\u00e9dites, notamment \u00e0 travers des textes plus engag\u00e9s que jamais ou des rapprochements avec tout un pan de la mythologie coldwave.\r\n\r\nFusion savamment dos\u00e9e de musique \u00e9lectronique, cosmique, de jazz et de dance, Zombie Zombie c\u2019est un univers synth\u00e9tique et organique aussi profond que singulier. Leur dernier album \u201cLivity\u201d, sorti en 2017 chez Versatile Records, creuse encore plus le sillon des rythmiques aux saveurs exotiques m\u00eal\u00e9es aux synth\u00e9tiseurs planants d\u2019\u00c9tienne Jaumet. Le groupe m\u00e9lange sa passion de vieux groupes et son amour de l\u2019electro. Ils ont fait le choix de l\u2019analogique pr\u00e9f\u00e9rant tourner les boutons de leurs vieilles machines plut\u00f4t que de manipuler un laptop sur sc\u00e8ne. Ceci, non pas par pass\u00e9isme, mais par go\u00fbt \u2013 rien ne rempla\u00e7ant le son particulier et le \u201ctouch\u00e9\u201d des machines vintage. La force incontestable de ce trio est de savoir retranscrire de mani\u00e8re simple et efficace, l\u2019\u00e9nergie de leurs albums kraut-disco-analogique en concert. Une musique \u00e0 la fois dansante et planante, un son tout droit venu de l\u2019espace, d\u00e9collage imminent !\r\nComment qualifier la musique de Nicolas Belvalette, aka US\u00c9 ? On peut s\u2019\u00e9vertuer \u00e0 empiler tout ce que cela nous rappelle, punk, indus, noise, kraut... Mais arr\u00eatons ici. En disant \u00e7a, on n'\u00e9voque que la surface, que ce qui pourrait rattacher sa musique \u00e0 quelque autre projet, et c'est donc fonci\u00e8rement inutile. US\u00c9 c'est un mec qui arrive seul sur sc\u00e8ne arm\u00e9 d'une batterie et d'une guitare pos\u00e9e devant lui. En moins de temps qu'il n'en faut pour le dire, vous assistez \u00e0 un d\u00e9chainement rythmique, une s\u00e9ance hypnotique collective, exp\u00e9rience chamanique, le fatras des tom, caisses claires et cymbales, cordes de guitares, tout ca vous ram\u00e8ne \u00e0 l'\u00e9tat primal. Il a d\u00e9j\u00e0 jou\u00e9 \u00e0 Villette Sonique, Festival Indig\u00e8nes, Les 3 Elephants, La Ferme Electrique, La Route du Rock, Freakshow, Levitation Festival, Heart Of Glass Heart Of Gold.  Pour tous ceux qui n'ont pas encore v\u00e9cu cette experience, rendez-vous en premi\u00e8re partie de Frustration.\r\ncoprod Botanique - Go\u00fbte mes Disques","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","email":"info@botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 37 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/497525.html"},"nl":{"name":"Frustration + Zombie Zombie - Us\u00e9","shortdescr":"Het invloedrijke Franse rocklabel palmt de Botanique in","longdescr":"Al 15 jaar regeert Frustration over de Franse post-punkscene. Het oudste lid van Born Bad Records komt voor het eerst in 3 jaar terug naar Brussel om voor het eerst ook de Orangerie in te palmen. Het belooft een knetterende avond te worden, want Frustration brengt het zwaar geschut mee. Tijdloze klassiekers worden afgewisseld met nummers uit nieuwste plaat \u2018So Cold Streams\u2019. Dat nieuwe album is een delicate evenwichtsoefening geworden, die de klassieke sound van de post-punkers koppelt aan meer dan ooit ge\u00ebngageerde lyrics en een hechte band met de coldwave-mythologie.\r\n\r\nDankzij een fusion van elektronisch, kosmisch, jazz en dance heeft Zombie Zombie een geheel eigen sound die even synthetisch als organisch is. Op hun meest recente album 'Livity' (verschenen bij Versatile Records), klinken de ritmes uitbundig en buitenaards, vooral dan dankzij de geweldige synths van \u00c9tienne Jaumet. In het werk van deze heren ontdek je verder een grote liefde voor vintage electronica, het soort dat zich niet op een computer laat maken maar wel door analoge machines. Uit de knoppen laten ze heerlijk effici\u00ebnte kraut-disco rollen, die even simpel als energiek is. Mee opstijgen richting synth-hemel kan op 16 juni!\r\nHoe moet je het noemen, wat Nicolas Belvalette aka US\u00c9 maakt? Er zit punk in, maar ook industrial, noise en kraut. Live doet hij het, gewapend met drum en gitaar, solo en vuurt hij hypnotiserende ritmes op het publiek af als een echte sjamaan. Het bracht hem al in Villette Sonique, op Les Elephants en op Levitation Festival.\r\ncoprod Botanique - Go\u00fbte mes Disques","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/botanique.be\/fr\/concert\/frustration-zombie-zombie-use-2022","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/497525.html"},"en":{"name":"Frustration + Zombie Zombie - Us\u00e9","shortdescr":"French post-punk royalty sounding better than ever","longdescr":"Frustration has been dictating the law in the French post-punk scene for 15 years. 3 years since their last visit to Brussels, Born Bad Records\u2019 elder statesmen return to invade the Orangerie for the first time. It\u2019s going to be an electric evening, with Frustration bringing the heavy hitters. Expect both timeless classics and songs off their new album \u2018So Cold Streams\u2019. Their latest record is quite a feat, balancing their classic sound with lyrics that show more engagement than ever, and links to the cold wave mythology.\r\n\r\ncoprod Botanique - Go\u00fbte mes Disques","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/497525.html"},"de":{"name":"Frustration","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/497525.html"},"it":{"name":"Frustration","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/497525.html"},"sp":{"name":"Frustration","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/497525.html"},"pt":{"name":"Frustration","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/497525.html"},"cn":{"name":"Frustration","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/497525.html"}},"place":{"id":11,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"L\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gant Centre Culturel de la Communaut\u00e9 fran\u00e7aise est joliment situ\u00e9 dans les anciens jardins botaniques pr\u00e8s de la petite ceinture de Bruxelles. Vous pouvez assister \u00e0 des concerts dans les espaces intimes \u00e0 l\u2019ambiance chaleureuse, dont  les plus connus sont l\u2019Orangerie, la Rotonde, le Mus\u00e9e et le Witloof Bar. \r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Koningsstraat","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","address_line1":"Koningsstraat, 236","address_line2":"1210 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":"In de voormalige botanische tuinen aan de kleine ring, thans het klassevolle cultuurcentrum van de Franse Gemeenschap, is het goed toeven. Concerten vinden er plaats op een unieke locatie, in sfeervolle en intieme ruimtes. De kwalitatieve eclectische programmatie staat zeer open voor nieuwe trends.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"The former botanical gardens provide the unique location for the stylish cultural centre of the French community and are a great place to relax. Concerts are held in the intimate surroundings of its eight spaces and multipurpose halls, of which the most famous are the Orangerie, the Rotonde, the Museum, and the Witloof Bar.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Le Botanique z\u00e4hlt ohne Zweifel zu den sch\u00f6nsten und spektakul\u00e4rsten Veranstaltungsorten Br\u00fcssels. Das von 1826 bis 1829 von der \u201eSoci\u00e9t\u00e9 Royale d'Horticulture\u201c erbaute, ehemalige Gew\u00e4chshaus im neoklassizistischen Stil mit Eisen- und Glasarchitektur beherbergt seit 1984 einen hochkar\u00e4tigen Veranstaltungsort.\r\n\r\nInmitten des botanischen Gartens von Saint-Josse-ten-Noode, einer der 19 Br\u00fcsseler Gemeinden, w\u00e4chst und gedeiht heute ein quicklebendiger Ort der Kultur, der vor allem f\u00fcr Musikveranstaltungen, als Galerie und Caf\u00e9 genutzt wird. H\u00f6hepunkt des Jahres bildet im Fr\u00fchling das Musikfestival \u201eLes Nuits Botaniques\".","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Questo grande edificio, che doveva ospitare le collezioni di un precedente giardino botanico, \u00e8 stato costruito fra il 1826 ed il 1829. L'artista-arredatore Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois Gineste diresse i lavori secondo progetto dell'architetto Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys. Rispettando la struttura tradizionale degli aranceti, ha immaginato un'imponente cupola rotonda centrale, affiancata da due ali ciascuna delle quali terminante in un padiglione leggermente sporgente. Grazie alla sua regolarit\u00e0 e semplicit\u00e0, la costruzione illustra perfettamente i principi dello stile neoclassico. Alle vetrate che riempiono gli spazi tra le colonne della sala circolare e che coprono il portico delimitato dal colonnato stesso, si aggiungono le serre adiacenti alle ali laterali. Inizialmente si era pensato di organizzare feste all'interno di questo ambiente magico, e a questo scopo venne allestita una grande sala fra l'aranceto orientale e la sala rotonda, ma questa diventer\u00e0 poi la sala degli erbari dal 1870. Fino al 1939, l'edificio verr\u00e0 utilizzato per il suo scopo originale. Riacquistato dallo Stato nel 1970, il locale diventer\u00e0 il Centro Culturale della Federazione Vallonia-Bruxelles e verr\u00e0 inaugurato come tale nel 1984. Oggi ospita numerosi eventi culturali dedicati all'arte contemporanea e vi si svolgono festival, tra i quali il famoso Nuits du Botanique, che hanno contribuito ad affermare la sua reputazione. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Este enorme edificio, pensado para albergar las colecciones de un antiguo jard\u00edn bot\u00e1nico, fue construido entre 1826 y 1829. El artista-decorador Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois Gineste dirigi\u00f3 las obras a partir de los planos del arquitecto Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys. Respetando la estructura tradicional de los invernaderos de naranjas, imagin\u00f3 una imponente rotonda central con c\u00fapula flanqueada por dos pasillos que terminaban en un pabell\u00f3n ligeramente en relieve. Gracias a su regularidad y simplicidad, la elevaci\u00f3n ilustra a la perfecci\u00f3n los principios del estilo neocl\u00e1sico. Las vidrieras situadas en los intercolumnios de la rotonda y que cubren el p\u00f3rtico delimitado por esta misma columnata se suman a los invernaderos adosados a los pasillos laterales. Pronto se pens\u00f3 en organizar fiestas en este lugar m\u00e1gico, para lo cual se acondicion\u00f3 una sala entre el invernadero de naranjas oriental y la rotonda, pero a partir de 1870 se convirti\u00f3 en la sala de los herbarios. Hasta 1939 cumpli\u00f3 las funciones teniendo en cuenta su vocaci\u00f3n inicial. Recomprado por el Estado en 1970, el lugar se convirti\u00f3 en el centro cultural de la Federaci\u00f3n Valonia-Bruselas y se inaugur\u00f3 como tal en 1984. A d\u00eda de hoy este lugar alberga numerosas manifestaciones culturales dedicadas a la creaci\u00f3n contempor\u00e1nea y se ha vuelto prestigioso por los festivales que se celebran en \u00e9l, tales como las \u00abNoches del bot\u00e1nico\u00bb. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[15],"translations":{"fr":["Rogier"],"nl":["Rogier"],"en":["Rogier"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"fr":["Nord"],"nl":["Noord"],"en":["North"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":5,"location":{"lat":50.85461438,"lon":4.36620044},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-01-25T16:35:03+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:13+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true},"organizer":{"id":11,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"L\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gant Centre Culturel de la Communaut\u00e9 fran\u00e7aise est joliment situ\u00e9 dans les anciens jardins botaniques pr\u00e8s de la petite ceinture de Bruxelles. Vous pouvez assister \u00e0 des concerts dans les espaces intimes \u00e0 l\u2019ambiance chaleureuse, dont  les plus connus sont l\u2019Orangerie, la Rotonde, le Mus\u00e9e et le Witloof Bar. \r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Koningsstraat","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","address_line1":"Koningsstraat, 236","address_line2":"1210 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":"In de voormalige botanische tuinen aan de kleine ring, thans het klassevolle cultuurcentrum van de Franse Gemeenschap, is het goed toeven. Concerten vinden er plaats op een unieke locatie, in sfeervolle en intieme ruimtes. De kwalitatieve eclectische programmatie staat zeer open voor nieuwe trends.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"The former botanical gardens provide the unique location for the stylish cultural centre of the French community and are a great place to relax. Concerts are held in the intimate surroundings of its eight spaces and multipurpose halls, of which the most famous are the Orangerie, the Rotonde, the Museum, and the Witloof Bar.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Le Botanique z\u00e4hlt ohne Zweifel zu den sch\u00f6nsten und spektakul\u00e4rsten Veranstaltungsorten Br\u00fcssels. Das von 1826 bis 1829 von der \u201eSoci\u00e9t\u00e9 Royale d'Horticulture\u201c erbaute, ehemalige Gew\u00e4chshaus im neoklassizistischen Stil mit Eisen- und Glasarchitektur beherbergt seit 1984 einen hochkar\u00e4tigen Veranstaltungsort.\r\n\r\nInmitten des botanischen Gartens von Saint-Josse-ten-Noode, einer der 19 Br\u00fcsseler Gemeinden, w\u00e4chst und gedeiht heute ein quicklebendiger Ort der Kultur, der vor allem f\u00fcr Musikveranstaltungen, als Galerie und Caf\u00e9 genutzt wird. H\u00f6hepunkt des Jahres bildet im Fr\u00fchling das Musikfestival \u201eLes Nuits Botaniques\".","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Questo grande edificio, che doveva ospitare le collezioni di un precedente giardino botanico, \u00e8 stato costruito fra il 1826 ed il 1829. L'artista-arredatore Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois Gineste diresse i lavori secondo progetto dell'architetto Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys. Rispettando la struttura tradizionale degli aranceti, ha immaginato un'imponente cupola rotonda centrale, affiancata da due ali ciascuna delle quali terminante in un padiglione leggermente sporgente. Grazie alla sua regolarit\u00e0 e semplicit\u00e0, la costruzione illustra perfettamente i principi dello stile neoclassico. Alle vetrate che riempiono gli spazi tra le colonne della sala circolare e che coprono il portico delimitato dal colonnato stesso, si aggiungono le serre adiacenti alle ali laterali. Inizialmente si era pensato di organizzare feste all'interno di questo ambiente magico, e a questo scopo venne allestita una grande sala fra l'aranceto orientale e la sala rotonda, ma questa diventer\u00e0 poi la sala degli erbari dal 1870. Fino al 1939, l'edificio verr\u00e0 utilizzato per il suo scopo originale. Riacquistato dallo Stato nel 1970, il locale diventer\u00e0 il Centro Culturale della Federazione Vallonia-Bruxelles e verr\u00e0 inaugurato come tale nel 1984. Oggi ospita numerosi eventi culturali dedicati all'arte contemporanea e vi si svolgono festival, tra i quali il famoso Nuits du Botanique, che hanno contribuito ad affermare la sua reputazione. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Este enorme edificio, pensado para albergar las colecciones de un antiguo jard\u00edn bot\u00e1nico, fue construido entre 1826 y 1829. El artista-decorador Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois Gineste dirigi\u00f3 las obras a partir de los planos del arquitecto Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys. Respetando la estructura tradicional de los invernaderos de naranjas, imagin\u00f3 una imponente rotonda central con c\u00fapula flanqueada por dos pasillos que terminaban en un pabell\u00f3n ligeramente en relieve. Gracias a su regularidad y simplicidad, la elevaci\u00f3n ilustra a la perfecci\u00f3n los principios del estilo neocl\u00e1sico. Las vidrieras situadas en los intercolumnios de la rotonda y que cubren el p\u00f3rtico delimitado por esta misma columnata se suman a los invernaderos adosados a los pasillos laterales. Pronto se pens\u00f3 en organizar fiestas en este lugar m\u00e1gico, para lo cual se acondicion\u00f3 una sala entre el invernadero de naranjas oriental y la rotonda, pero a partir de 1870 se convirti\u00f3 en la sala de los herbarios. Hasta 1939 cumpli\u00f3 las funciones teniendo en cuenta su vocaci\u00f3n inicial. Recomprado por el Estado en 1970, el lugar se convirti\u00f3 en el centro cultural de la Federaci\u00f3n Valonia-Bruselas y se inaugur\u00f3 como tal en 1984. A d\u00eda de hoy este lugar alberga numerosas manifestaciones culturales dedicadas a la creaci\u00f3n contempor\u00e1nea y se ha vuelto prestigioso por los festivales que se celebran en \u00e9l, tales como las \u00abNoches del bot\u00e1nico\u00bb. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"