nes ayant des difficult\u00e9s de compr\u00e9hension","Am\u00e9nagements pour personnes sourdes et malentendantes","Chien d'assistance","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Brussels Health Safety Label"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Brussels Health Safety Label"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-06-08T10:05:03+02:00","published_at":"2022-06-07T17:14:35+02:00","backoffice_id":255497,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.23112042478354},{"id":533760,"date_start":"2022-06-17","date_end":"2022-06-17","date_next":"2022-06-17","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[2],"translations":{"fr":["Classique"],"nl":["Klassiek"],"en":["Classical"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["nl","en","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Arts for Education - Classical Music Charity event","shortdescr":"Venez soutenir notre initiative de collecte de fonds pour l'\u00e9ducation via la promotion d'artistes de musique classique.\r\n\r\n16 artistes albanais et le trio ukrainien \"Du coeur \u00e0 l'Ukraine\", se r\u00e9uniront pour soutenir l'initiative.","longdescr":"Un concert caritatif de musique classique, dont le but est de r\u00e9colter des fonds par la vente de billets, pour l'achat d'ordinateurs portables, qui seront donn\u00e9s aux \u00e9l\u00e8ves de plusieurs \u00e9coles en Albanie et au Kosovo.\r\n\r\n16 artistes albanais ainsi que le trio ukrainien, \u00ab Du c\u0153ur \u00e0 l'Ukraine \u00bb, se r\u00e9uniront pour contribuer par leur talent \u00e0 cette initiative.\r\n\r\nUne partie des fonds sera donn\u00e9e pour soutenir l'ONG ukrainienne Promote Ukraine.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/533760.html"},"nl":{"name":"Arts for Education - Classical Music Charity event","shortdescr":"Kom en steun ons initiatief om geld in te zamelen voor onderwijs door klassieke muziekartiesten te promoten.\r\n\r\n16 Albanese artiesten en het Oekra\u00efense trio \"From the heart to Ukraine\" komen samen om het initiatief te ondersteunen.","longdescr":"Een klassieke muziek liefdadigheidsconcert, met als doel geld in te zamelen door middel van kaartverkoop, voor de aankoop van laptops, die zullen worden gedoneerd aan leerlingen van verschillende scholen in Albani\u00eb en Kosovo.\r\n\r\n16 Albanese artiesten zullen samen met het Oekra\u00efense trio \"From the heart to Ukraine\" samenkomen om met hun talent bij te dragen aan dit initiatief.\r\n\r\nEen deel van het geld gaat naar de Oekra\u00efense NGO Promote Ukraine.","performers":"Rotaract Brussels Capital - International Club","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tickettailor.com\/events\/rotaractbrusselscapital\/693262?fbclid=IwAR3PWj_-vouo5cIAGGJ2zE6NrcuOTntsHxntusMVamfK5xWs4HpMiYrZxLU","email":"rotaract.brussels.capital@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 489 78 33 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/533760.html"},"en":{"name":"Arts for Education - Classical Music Charity event","shortdescr":"Come and support our initiative on raising funds for education via promoting classic music artists. \r\n\r\n16 Albanian artists and the Ukranian trio \"From the heart to Ukraine\", will come together to support the initiative.","longdescr":"A classical music charity concert, which purpose is to raise funds by ticket sales, for the purchase of laptops, which will be donated to students of several schools in Albania and Kosovo.\r\n\r\n16 Albanian artists together with the Ukrainian trio, \"From the heart to Ukraine\", will come together to contribute through their talent to this initiative. \r\n\r\nPart of the funds will be given to support the Ukrainian NGO Promote Ukraine.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/533760.html"},"de":{"name":"Arts for Education - Charity event","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/533760.html"},"it":{"name":"Arts for Education - Charity event","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/533760.html"},"sp":{"name":"Arts for Education - Charity event","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/533760.html"},"pt":{"name":"Arts for Education - Charity event","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/533760.html"},"cn":{"name":"Arts for Education - Charity event","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/533760.html"}},"place":{"id":265522,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"30","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.conservatoire.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 30","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Conservatoire royal de Bruxelles organise pr\u00e8s de 200 \u00e9v\u00e9nements (hors \u00e9valuations publiques) chaque saison, offrant ainsi aux \u00e9tudiants le temps de l\u2019\u00e9change avec le public. Concerts symphoniques dans la grande salle du Conservatoire, ou rencontres plus intimes \u00e0 l\u2019Auditorium Joseph Jongen et dans les lieux partenaires du Conservatoire, de nombreuses occasions leurs permettent d'appr\u00e9hender la sc\u00e8ne, encadr\u00e9s par leurs enseignants ou en \u00e9lectrons libres lors des Nocturnes ou du festival Courants d\u2019airs.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Koninklijk Conservatorium van Brussel","address_street_name":"Regentschapsstraat","address_street_number":"30","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.conservatoire.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Regentschapsstraat, 30","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De meeste concerten georganiseerd door het KCB zijn gratis toegankelijk, voor sommige echter wordt een inkomprijs gevraagd om de professionele omkadering van de verschillende projecten voor de studenten te financieren. Bijzondere concerten zijn ondermeer het Nieuwjaarsconcert met feestelijke ontvangst, musicalvoorstellingen als eigen productie van het KCB, concerten in samenwerking met de Koninklijke Muziekkapel van De Gidsen en  benefietconcerten. De reservatie voor alle betalende concerten is mogelijk via BOZAR.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Royal Concervatory of Brussels","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"30","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.conservatoire.be\/en\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 30","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Concert Society (Concertvereniging) vzw was born in the lap of the Brussels Royal Conservatory. Each year the Society programmes a series of concerts in which the students at the Conservatory get the chance to gain experience of performing on stage. Teachers and students work together intensively to prepare for these concerts, an experience which undoubtedly makes a positive contribution to the students' education.\r\nMany initiatives take place in co-production with other institutions and musical societies such as the Royal College of Music in London, the Conservatoire national sup\u00e9rieur de musique of Paris, the Musikhochschulen of Vienna, Graz and Cologne, the Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles, the Koninklijke Conservatoria in Rotterdam and in Den Haag, the Lemmensinstituut in Louvain, the Filharmonische Vereniging van Brussel, Europalia, and the arts festivals \"Ars Musica\" and \"De barokke Lente van de Zavel\".\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"30","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.conservatoire.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 30","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_