100%\u2019\u2019 Dance and Love\u2019\u2019.\r\n\r\nLe vendredi 17 juin l\u2019\u00e9t\u00e9 aura la saveur de la rencontre, la musique et l\u2019amour.\r\n\r\nLe vendredi 17 juin l\u2019\u00e9t\u00e9 ouvre ses portes d\u00e8s 22H au CACTUS pour la SUMER LOVE PARTY.\r\n\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\u25ac\r\nInfos Pratiques :\r\n1\u00b0 Nos soir\u00e9es sont destin\u00e9es \u00e0 un public de plus de 30 ans!\r\n2\u00b0 La soir\u00e9e est \u00e9galement ouverte aux non-membres de Rendez-vous.be, vos amis hors sites sont les bienvenus!\r\n3\u00b0 Une tenue correcte est exig\u00e9e !\r\n4\u00b0 Ouverture des portes \u00e0 22:30.\r\n\r\nRENDEZ-VOUS \u00e0 la Grande soir\u00e9e Rencontre en Live & plus si affinit\u00e9","performers":"Cactus Club  - Rendez-vous.be  - Sis Radio","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"info@justanight.net","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 478 58 60 39","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/535457.html"},"nl":{"name":"La Summer Love  - Grande soir\u00e9e en Live  30+ | By Rendez-vous.be","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/535457.html"},"en":{"name":"La Summer Love  - Grande soir\u00e9e en Live  30+ | By Rendez-vous.be","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/535457.html"},"de":{"name":"La Summer Love  - Grande soir\u00e9e en Live  30+ | By Rendez-vous.be","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/535457.html"},"it":{"name":"La Summer Love  - Grande soir\u00e9e en Live  30+ | By Rendez-vous.be","sh