re de Changy-Violaine Lison)","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Double lecture-spectacle musicale : La paume plus grande que toi \/ Ce soir, on dort dans les arbres (Victoire de Changy-Violaine Lison)","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Double lecture-spectacle musicale : La paume plus grande que toi \/ Ce soir, on dort dans les arbres (Victoire de Changy-Violaine Lison)","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2022-06-20","doors":"18:00:00","start":"20:00:00","end":"21:30:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":8}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-06-10T17:05:04+02:00","published_at":"2022-06-10T16:28:28+02:00","backoffice_id":255784,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":498904,"date_start":"2022-06-21","date_end":"2022-06-21","date_next":"2022-06-21","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[4,7],"translations":{"fr":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"],"nl":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"],"en":["Pop, rock, jazz\u2026","Pop, Rock"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever - Stella Donnelly","shortdescr":"Des guitares \u00e9tincelantes et \u00e9nerv\u00e9es qui s\u2019entrem\u00ealent et se r\u00e9pondent, une rythmique tr\u00e9pidante et des m\u00e9lodies ent\u00eatantes","longdescr":"Il y a deux ans, le quintet de Melbourne, Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever faisait d\u00e9couvrir au monde entier l\u2019\u00e9tendue de ses talents avec \u00ab Hope Downs \u00bb, un premier disque sorti chez Sub Pop. Le groupe australien revient aujourd\u2019hui avec \u00ab Sideways to New Italy \u00bb, un opus qui se situe quelque part entre la jangle pop de Real Estate, la discographie des Feelies et le catalogue du label n\u00e9o-z\u00e9landais Flying Nun Records - sorte d\u2019\u00e9cho aux mouvements shoegaze et post-punk venus du continent oc\u00e9anien dans les ann\u00e9es 1980. Avec des guitares \u00e9tincelantes et \u00e9nerv\u00e9es qui s\u2019entrem\u00ealent et se r\u00e9pondent, une rythmique tr\u00e9pidante et des m\u00e9lodies ent\u00eatantes, \u00ab Sideways to New Italy \u00bb, est un disque taill\u00e9 pour le live, rendez-vous \u00e0 l\u2019Orangerie donc.\r\n\r\nSTELLA DONNELLY\r\n\r\nQualifi\u00e9e par le magazine Focus Vif comme \u00ab la nouvelle voix d'ange de la sc\u00e8ne australienne \u00bb Stella Donnelly ne vous laissera pas de marbre ! La jeune Australienne fait partie des jeunes pousses \u00e0 suivre pour le moment. Avec une voix remplie de douceur et de justesse lorsqu\u2019elle se met \u00e0 chanter, Stella saura vous \u00e9mouvoir. Elle remporte le Levi\u2019s\u00ae Music Prize en 2017, prix attribu\u00e9 aux talents \u00e9mergents les plus prometteurs du moment, tandis que son premier EP intitul\u00e9 \u00ab Thrush Metal \u00bb est d\u2019une douceur sans pareille. Douce mais pas que, avec son single \u00ab Boys Will Be Boys \u00bb, elle d\u00e9veloppe la th\u00e9matique tr\u00e8s actuelle du harc\u00e8lement sexuel et du viol. Le New York Times fait d\u2019ailleurs l\u2019\u00e9loge de ce titre qu\u2019il qualifie comme une valse d\u00e9licate et sinc\u00e8re, reflet d\u2019un probl\u00e8me soci\u00e9tal certain. Rendez-vous en 1\u00e8re partie de Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever pour d\u00e9couvrir son nouvel album qui para\u00eetra dans le courant de l\u2019ann\u00e9e 2022.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","email":"info@botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 37 32","agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/498904.html"},"nl":{"name":"Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever - Stella Donnelly","shortdescr":"De lekkerst jengelende gitaartjes van het moment","longdescr":"Twee jaar geleden leerde de hele wereld het Melbournse vijftal Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever kennen met 'Hope downs', een eerste langspeler die meteen via het iconische Sub Pop werd uitgebracht. De Australi\u00ebrs zijn nu terug met nieuw werk in de vorm van 'Sideways to new Italy', een album dat invloeden samengooit uit Real Estate-achtige jangle-pop, de discografie van de Feelies en de shoegaze- en post-junkgeluiden uit de catalogus van Flying Nun Records. Met sprankelende en energieke gitaren die zich vermengen en verstrengelen, en met met hectische ritmes en onstuimige melodie\u00ebn, is 'Sideways to new Italy' een plaat gemaakt voor liveshows. Toevallig staat er zo eentje gepland in de Bota-kalender, en wel op 22 maart in de Orangerie!\r\n\r\nSTELLA DONNELLY\r\n\r\nDe Morgen noemde haar \"de meest urgente act van Sonic City\", Focus Knack spreekt over een \"feministische folkheldin in wording\". Het mag duidelijk zijn dat de toekomst er rooskleurig uitziet voor de Australische singer-songwriter Stella Donnelly die met haar mooie, zoete en zachte stemgeluid de luisteraar moeiteloos betovert, maar ook bij de les houdt.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/botanique.be\/fr\/concert\/rolling-blackouts-coastal-fever-stella-donnelly-2022","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/498904.html"},"en":{"name":"Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever - Stella Donnelly","shortdescr":"Super-catchy tuneful guitar-pop from Melbourne","longdescr":"Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever was formed in Melbourne, Australia in 2013 by three singer-guitarists: Fran Keaney, Tom Russo & Joe White. Bassist Joe Russo & drummer Marcel Tussie were recruited to round out the band. Their sound, self-described as somewhere between \u2018tough pop\u2019 and \u2018soft punk\u2019, takes in driving rhythms, interlocking guitar lines and dry wit. After self-releasing a handful of songs online, the band shared the single \u2018Clean Slate\u2019 in 2015, which won plenty of praise from the music press. Sydney label Ivy League Records dropped RBCF's first EP, Talk Tight, the same year. In 2016, legendary American indie label Sub Pop announced that they'd signed a deal with the band. The band released their second EP, The French Press, in March 2017. In June 2018, they released their debut full-length Hope Downs, which was met with worldwide critical acclaim. Their second LP, Sideways to New Italy, is due in June 2020.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/498904.html"},"de":{"name":"Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/498904.html"},"it":{"name":"Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/498904.html"},"sp":{"name":"Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/498904.html"},"pt":{"name":"Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/498904.html"},"cn":{"name":"Rolling Blackouts Coastal Fever","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/498904.html"}},"place":{"id":11,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"L\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gant Centre Culturel de la Communaut\u00e9 fran\u00e7aise est joliment situ\u00e9 dans les anciens jardins botaniques pr\u00e8s de la petite ceinture de Bruxelles. Vous pouvez assister \u00e0 des concerts dans les espaces intimes \u00e0 l\u2019ambiance chaleureuse, dont  les plus connus sont l\u2019Orangerie, la Rotonde, le Mus\u00e9e et le Witloof Bar. \r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Koningsstraat","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","address_line1":"Koningsstraat, 236","address_line2":"1210 Sint-Joost-Ten-Node","description_web":"In de voormalige botanische tuinen aan de kleine ring, thans het klassevolle cultuurcentrum van de Franse Gemeenschap, is het goed toeven. Concerten vinden er plaats op een unieke locatie, in sfeervolle en intieme ruimtes. De kwalitatieve eclectische programmatie staat zeer open voor nieuwe trends.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"The former botanical gardens provide the unique location for the stylish cultural centre of the French community and are a great place to relax. Concerts are held in the intimate surroundings of its eight spaces and multipurpose halls, of which the most famous are the Orangerie, the Rotonde, the Museum, and the Witloof Bar.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"BOTANIQUE","virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Le Botanique z\u00e4hlt ohne Zweifel zu den sch\u00f6nsten und spektakul\u00e4rsten Veranstaltungsorten Br\u00fcssels. Das von 1826 bis 1829 von der \u201eSoci\u00e9t\u00e9 Royale d'Horticulture\u201c erbaute, ehemalige Gew\u00e4chshaus im neoklassizistischen Stil mit Eisen- und Glasarchitektur beherbergt seit 1984 einen hochkar\u00e4tigen Veranstaltungsort.\r\n\r\nInmitten des botanischen Gartens von Saint-Josse-ten-Noode, einer der 19 Br\u00fcsseler Gemeinden, w\u00e4chst und gedeiht heute ein quicklebendiger Ort der Kultur, der vor allem f\u00fcr Musikveranstaltungen, als Galerie und Caf\u00e9 genutzt wird. H\u00f6hepunkt des Jahres bildet im Fr\u00fchling das Musikfestival \u201eLes Nuits Botaniques\".","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Questo grande edificio, che doveva ospitare le collezioni di un precedente giardino botanico, \u00e8 stato costruito fra il 1826 ed il 1829. L'artista-arredatore Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois Gineste diresse i lavori secondo progetto dell'architetto Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys. Rispettando la struttura tradizionale degli aranceti, ha immaginato un'imponente cupola rotonda centrale, affiancata da due ali ciascuna delle quali terminante in un padiglione leggermente sporgente. Grazie alla sua regolarit\u00e0 e semplicit\u00e0, la costruzione illustra perfettamente i principi dello stile neoclassico. Alle vetrate che riempiono gli spazi tra le colonne della sala circolare e che coprono il portico delimitato dal colonnato stesso, si aggiungono le serre adiacenti alle ali laterali. Inizialmente si era pensato di organizzare feste all'interno di questo ambiente magico, e a questo scopo venne allestita una grande sala fra l'aranceto orientale e la sala rotonda, ma questa diventer\u00e0 poi la sala degli erbari dal 1870. Fino al 1939, l'edificio verr\u00e0 utilizzato per il suo scopo originale. Riacquistato dallo Stato nel 1970, il locale diventer\u00e0 il Centro Culturale della Federazione Vallonia-Bruxelles e verr\u00e0 inaugurato come tale nel 1984. Oggi ospita numerosi eventi culturali dedicati all'arte contemporanea e vi si svolgono festival, tra i quali il famoso Nuits du Botanique, che hanno contribuito ad affermare la sua reputazione. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Este enorme edificio, pensado para albergar las colecciones de un antiguo jard\u00edn bot\u00e1nico, fue construido entre 1826 y 1829. El artista-decorador Pierre-Fran\u00e7ois Gineste dirigi\u00f3 las obras a partir de los planos del arquitecto Tilman-Fran\u00e7ois Suys. Respetando la estructura tradicional de los invernaderos de naranjas, imagin\u00f3 una imponente rotonda central con c\u00fapula flanqueada por dos pasillos que terminaban en un pabell\u00f3n ligeramente en relieve. Gracias a su regularidad y simplicidad, la elevaci\u00f3n ilustra a la perfecci\u00f3n los principios del estilo neocl\u00e1sico. Las vidrieras situadas en los intercolumnios de la rotonda y que cubren el p\u00f3rtico delimitado por esta misma columnata se suman a los invernaderos adosados a los pasillos laterales. Pronto se pens\u00f3 en organizar fiestas en este lugar m\u00e1gico, para lo cual se acondicion\u00f3 una sala entre el invernadero de naranjas oriental y la rotonda, pero a partir de 1870 se convirti\u00f3 en la sala de los herbarios. Hasta 1939 cumpli\u00f3 las funciones teniendo en cuenta su vocaci\u00f3n inicial. Recomprado por el Estado en 1970, el lugar se convirti\u00f3 en el centro cultural de la Federaci\u00f3n Valonia-Bruselas y se inaugur\u00f3 como tal en 1984. A d\u00eda de hoy este lugar alberga numerosas manifestaciones culturales dedicadas a la creaci\u00f3n contempor\u00e1nea y se ha vuelto prestigioso por los festivales que se celebran en \u00e9l, tales como las \u00abNoches del bot\u00e1nico\u00bb. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[15],"translations":{"fr":["Rogier"],"nl":["Rogier"],"en":["Rogier"]}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"fr":["Nord"],"nl":["Noord"],"en":["North"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":5,"location":{"lat":50.85461438,"lon":4.36620044},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2021-12-29T15:05:20+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:13+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true},"organizer":{"id":11,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Botanique","address_street_name":"Rue Royale","address_street_number":"236","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@botanique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.botanique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 37 32","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue Royale, 236","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"L\u2019\u00e9l\u00e9gant Centre Culturel de la Communaut\u00e9 fran\u00e7aise est joliment situ\u00e