t l\u2019\u00e9t\u00e9 ?\r\nAlors, merci le soleil \u2600\ufe0f (et nos charmants chefs","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.serrabrussels.be\/fr\/events\/terrace-bbq-solstice-dete\/","email":"info@serrabrussels.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/535461.html"},"nl":{"name":"Terrace BBQ: Summer Solstice","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Graag presenteren we onze allereerste Terras BBQ van het seizoen: Summer Solstice, een ode aan de langste dag van het jaar!\r\nLaten we deze avond buiten doorbrengen, barbecuen en genieten van een drankje op ons gezellige terras ! Want hoe kunnen wij beter de zon bedanken om de hele zomer (hopelijk) op ons te schijnen? \r\nDus, bedankt, zon \u2600\ufe0f (en onze lieve koks","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/535461.html"},"en":{"name":"Terrace BBQ: Summer Solstice","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Presenting our very first Terrace BBQ of the season: Summer Solstice, an ode to the longest day of the year.  Let\u2019s spend Friday evening out, grilling barbeques and enjoying drinks in our cosy terrace! Because what\u2019s a better way to thank the sun for (hopefully) shining on us all summer? We say, none!\r\nSo, thank you, sunshine \u2600\ufe0f (and our lovely chefs","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/535461.html"},"de":{"name":"Terrace BBQ: Summer Solstice","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/535461.html"},"it":{"name":"Terrace BBQ: Summer Solstice","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"we