oute chez lui des objets qu'il n'utilise plus, nous vous invitons \u00e0 les amener, m\u00eame quelques uns. Ceci permet de garder un relatif \u00e9quilibre dans ce moment de partage. Le march\u00e9 gratuit est une d\u00e9marche qui vise \u00e0 r\u00e9duire nos d\u00e9chets, \u00e0 diminuer la surproduction mais aussi simplement un geste d\u2019\u00e9change et de solidarit\u00e9.","performers":"Les fabuleux b\u00e9n\u00e9voles de 1000BXL en Transition","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/1000bxlentransition.be\/all-project-list\/marche-gratuit\/","email":"1000bxlentransition@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/529848.html"},"nl":{"name":"Gratis markt 1000Bxl en Transition","shortdescr":"Een GRATIS MARKT is een markt waar alles gratis is!","longdescr":"Een GRATIS MARKT is een markt waar alles gratis is!\r\nElke 4de zaterdag van de maand van 14u. tot 16u. in het Steenkoolkaaipark (in de Sint-Katelijnewijk). Kom met wat je niet meer nodig hebt of kom met lege handen. Neem mee wat je kan gebruiken. Het is niet nodig om te geven om te kunnen krijgen.","performers":"De fantastische vrijwilligers van 1000BXL en Transition","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/529848.html"},"en":{"name":"March\u00e9 Gratuit 1000Bxl en Transition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/529848.html"},"de":{"name":"March\u00e9 Gratuit 1000Bxl en Transition - 2022","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/529848.html"},"it":{"name":"March\u00e9 Gratuit 1000Bxl en Transition - 2022","shortdesc