"address_street_number":"71","address_street_box":null,"email":"musee@ixelles.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.museumofixelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 64 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 515 64 21","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Jean Van Volsem, 71","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Das Museum bietet eine reiche Sammlung mit mehr als 10 000 Werken aus der Zeit zwischen dem 16. und 21. Jahrhundert. Das Museum legte einen besonderen Schwerpunkt auf das 19., 20. und 21. Jahrhundert, d. h. die Zeit der Geschichte des modernen Belgiens mit K\u00fcnstlern wie Rik Wouters, Paul Delvaux, Ren\u00e9 Magritte oder auch Panamarenko. Weiterer H\u00f6hepunkt ist die sch\u00f6ne Plakatsammlung des Museums, die neben Albi als einzige s\u00e4mtliche Plakate des ber\u00fchmten Henri de Toulouse-Lautrec ihr eigen nennen kann.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGeschlossen wegen Renovierung bis 2024","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e d'Ixelles","address_street_name":"Rue Jean Van Volsem","address_street_number":"71","address_street_box":null,"email":"musee@ixelles.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.museedixelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 64 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 515 64 21","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Jean Van Volsem, 71","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo de Ixelles","address_street_name":"Rue Jean Van Volsem","address_street_number":"71","address_street_box":null,"email":"musee@ixelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.museumofixelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 64 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 515 64 21","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Jean Van Volsem, 71","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"El museo tiene una de las mayores colecciones de p\u00f3steres art\u00edsticos del s. XlX, as\u00ed como casi todos los carteles de Toulouse Lautrec. Esta colecci\u00f3n es completada con exhibiciones del s. XX(Art Deco, Surrealismo...etc). Dos de las salas est\u00e1n dedicadas al arte del s. XVl hasta el s. XVlll. Sin embargo, el museo es m\u00e1s bien conocido por sus colecciones del s. XlX y XX, que ofrecen una visi\u00f3n bastante completa de las diferentes escuelas art\u00edsticas: pre-impresonismo, impresionismo, neo-impresionismo, luminismo, fovismo, simbolismo, expresionismo, surrealismo, constructivismo, j\u00f3venes artistas belgas, el movimiento CoBrA y arte pop.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCerrado por reformas hasta 2024","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e d'Ixelles","address_street_name":"Rue Jean Van Volsem","address_street_number":"71","address_street_box":null,"email":"musee@ixelles.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.museedixelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 64 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 515 64 21","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Jean Van Volsem, 71","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e d'Ixelles","address_street_name":"Rue Jean Van Volsem","address_street_number":"71","address_street_box":null,"email":"musee@ixelles.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.museedixelles.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 64 21","phone_booking":"+32 2 515 64 21","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue Jean Van Volsem, 71","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":566,"location":{"lat":50.83171098,"lon":4.37262464},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-04-15T13:24:31+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:38+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_b