:{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Exposition en plein air: Van Lindt, La premi\u00e8re cit\u00e9-jardin","shortdescr":"Kom alles te weten over het ontstaan van de kleinste tuinwijk van Belgi\u00eb.","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.oudergem.be","email":"cmathues@oudergem.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 676 49 05","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/532187.html"},"nl":{"name":"Openluchttentoonstelling: Van Lindt, de eerste tuinwijk van Oudergem","shortdescr":"D\u00e9couvrez tout sur les origines de la plus petite cit\u00e9-jardin de Belgique.","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.auderghem.be","email":"cmathues@oudergem.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/532187.html"},"en":{"name":"Openluchttentoonstelling: Van Lindt, de eerste tuinwijk van Oudergem","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"cmathues@oudergem.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/532187.html"},"de":{"name":"Openluchttentoonstelling: Van Lindt, de eerste tuinwijk van Oudergem","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/532187.html"},"it":{"name":"Openluchttentoonstelling: Van Lindt, de eerste tuinwijk van Oudergem","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/532187.html"},"sp":{"name":"Openluchttentoonstelling: Van Lindt, de eerste tuinwijk van Oudergem","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/532187.html"},"pt":{"name":"Openluchttentoonstelling: Van Lindt, de eerste tuinwijk van Oudergem","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/532187.html"},"cn":{"name":"Openluchttentoonstelling: Van Lindt, de eerste tuinwijk van Oudergem","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/532187.html"}},"place":{"id":277725,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cit\u00e9-jardin Van Lindt","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Cit\u00e9-jardin Van Lindt","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"Situ\u00e9e le long de l'autoroute \u00e0 Auderghem, cette cit\u00e9-jardin n\u2019est pas tr\u00e8s \u00e9tendue et se structure autour d\u2019un espace vert, le square Van Lindt. Confi\u00e9s aux architectes Vanderslagmolen et Verbist, les 89 logements sont inaugur\u00e9s en 1922. Ils ont l'allure de cottages anglais avec un jardinet \u00e0 l'avant et un jardin plus grand \u00e0 l'arri\u00e8re. \r\n\r\nVous appr\u00e9cierez le calme de ce quartier tr\u00e8s r\u00e9sidentiel, \u00e0 deux pas pourtant d\u2019un grand axe routier, mais \u00e9galement tout proche des grandes infrastructures sportives communales, du site du Rouge-Clo\u00eetre, du Centre sportif de l\u2019ADEPS et enfin de l\u2019entr\u00e9e de la majestueuse for\u00eat de Soignes\u202f! ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Tuinwik Van Lindt","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Oudergem","address_line1":"Tuinwik Van Lindt","address_line2":"1160 Oudergem","description_web":"Deze tuinwijk langs de snelweg in Oudergem is niet erg groot en ligt rond een groene ruimte, de Antoine Lindtsquare. De 89 woningen werden ontworpen door de architecten Vanderslagmolen en Verbist   en in 1922 in gebruik genomen. Ze lijken op een Engelse cottage en hebben een voortuintje en een grotere achtertuin.\r\nHet is een rustige en heel residenti\u00eble wijk, ondanks de ligging bij een grote verkeersader. Maar ze ligt ook dicht bij grote gemeentelijke sportfaciliteiten, de Roodklooster-site, het ADEPS-sportcentrum en de ingang van het majestueuze Zoni\u00ebnwoud!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Van Lindt Garden City","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Van Lindt Garden City","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"Situated along the motorway in Auderghem, this garden city is not very large and is structured around a green space, place Van Lindt. Entrusted to architects Vanderslagmolen and Verbist, the 89 properties were inaugurated in 1922. They\u2019re like English cottages with a front garden and larger garden at the rear. \r\n\r\nYou\u2019ll love the peace and quiet of this residential neighbourhood, which lies only a stone\u2019s throw from a major traffic route and very close to large municipal sports facilities on the Rouge-Clo\u00eetre site, the ADEPS (Wallonia-Brussels Federation sports administration body) Sports Centre and finally the entrance to the majestic Sonian Forest!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Cit\u00e9-jardin Van Lindt","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Cit\u00e9-jardin Van Lindt","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Cit\u00e9-jardin Van Lindt","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Cit\u00e9-jardin Van Lindt","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Cit\u00e9-jardin Van Lindt","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Cit\u00e9-jardin Van Lindt","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Cit\u00e9-jardin Van Lindt","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Cit\u00e9-jardin Van Lindt","address_line2":"1160 Auderghem","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Cit\u00e9-jardin Van Lindt","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1160","address_city":"Auderghem","address_line1":"Cit\u00e9-jardin 