lassiek"],"en":["Classic"]}},"visit_content":{"list":[428],"values":["brussels-renaissance-festival"]},"tags":[],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-05-12T10:05:04+02:00","published_at":"2022-04-28T16:33:58+02:00","backoffice_id":252751,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"tour","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.35163388691696},{"id":532817,"date_start":"2022-06-18","date_end":"2022-07-10","date_next":"2022-07-10","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours"}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Us et coutumes de la Renaissance : Bruxelles, ville fortifi\u00e9e","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Imaginez-vous Bruxelles \u00e0 la Renaissance : la ville est prot\u00e9g\u00e9e par une enceinte\u2026 ou plut\u00f4t deux.. La premi\u00e8re date du d\u00e9but du 13\u00e8me si\u00e8cle, la seconde du 14\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. D\u2019une enceinte de 4km ponctu\u00e9e de sept portes, Bruxelles passera \u00e0 une enceinte de 8km ! Elles coexisteront jusqu\u2019\u00e0 la Renaissance\u2026 Cet \u00ab Itin\u00e9raires \u00bb reviendra sur le passage d'une enceinte seigneuriale \u00e0 une enceinte bourgeoise. Quelles \u00e9taient les habitudes des citadins de l\u2019\u00e9poque ? Quel impact cela a-t-il eu sur les orientations oppos\u00e9es des deux murailles et leurs excroissances respectives ? Vous ne regarderez plus ces vestiges de la m\u00eame mani\u00e8re !\r\n\r\nR\u00e9servation obligatoire et mise \u00e0 disposition d\u2019un guide pendant 2h. Visite du mus\u00e9e des Arbal\u00e9triers et de celui de la Porte de Hal en suppl\u00e9ment (selon les conditions tarifaires des partenaires).","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 541 03 77","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/fr\/detail\/id\/532817.html"},"nl":{"name":"Brussel, versterkte stad","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Zo zag Brussel eruit in de renaissance: een stad beschermd door twee omwallingen , waarvan de eerste dateert uit het begin van de 13de eeuw en de tweede uit de 14de eeuw. De oorspronkelijke omwalling rond Brussel was vier km lang en telde zeven stadspoorten.  De tweede daarentegen had een afstand van 8 km! Tot in de renaissance bestonden ze naast elkaar. Deze wandeling staat stil bij de overgang van een feodale omwalling naar een stadsmuur en bij de gewoonten van de inwoners in die periode. Ten slotte reflecteren we ook over wat de impact was van de tegengestelde functies van beide ringmuren die uit hun voegen barstten. Je gaat voortaan de overblijfselen met andere ogen bekijken! \r\n\r\nReserveren is noodzakelijk en een gids is beschikbaar voor 2 uur. Bezoek aan het Kruisboogschuttersmuseum en het Hallepoortmuseum tegen betaling (volgens de tariefvoorwaarden van de partners).","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/nl\/detail\/id\/532817.html"},"en":{"name":"Brussels, fortified town","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Imagine Brussels in the Renaissance: the city is protected by a wall... or rather two. The first city wall dates from the early 13th century, and the second from the 14th century. Starting with a wall 4km long and seven gates, Brussels grew to need an 8km wall! The two walls coexisted until the Renaissance. This itinerary follows the change from a lordly precinct to a bourgeois town. What were the customs of its citizens at that time? What impact did it have on each side of the two walls and their respective expansions? You\u2019ll never look at these ruins in the same way again!  \r\n\r\n\u20ac160 for a guide for 2 hours. Possibility of visiting the Crossbow Guild Museum as an extra. Possibility of visiting the Halle Gate Museum as an extra. Depending on the price conditions of our partners","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/en\/detail\/id\/532817.html"},"de":{"name":"Us et coutumes de la Renaissance : Bruxelles, ville fortifi\u00e9e","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/de\/detail\/id\/532817.html"},"it":{"name":"Us et coutumes de la Renaissance : Bruxelles, ville fortifi\u00e9e","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/it\/detail\/id\/532817.html"},"sp":{"name":"Costumbres y tradiciones renacentistas: Bruselas, ciudad fortificada","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Imag\u00ednate Bruselas durante el Renacimiento: la ciudad est\u00e1 protegida por una muralla... o m\u00e1s bien por dos... La primera data de principios del siglo XIII, la segunda del siglo XIV. Desde una muralla de 4 km marcada por siete puertas, Bruselas pasar\u00e1 a contar con una muralla de 8 km. Ambas coexistir\u00e1n hasta el Renacimiento... Este \u00abItinerario\u00bb volver\u00e1 al paso de una transici\u00f3n de un recinto se\u00f1orial a uno burgu\u00e9s. \u00bfCu\u00e1les eran las costumbres de los habitantes de la ciudad en esa \u00e9poca? \u00bfQu\u00e9 impacto tuvo esto en las orientaciones opuestas de las dos murallas y sus respectivas protuberancias? \u00a1Ya no ver\u00e1s estos vestigios de la misma manera!  \r\n\r\nEs necesario reservar y un gu\u00eda est\u00e1 disponible durante 2 horas. Visita al Museo de los Ballesteros y al Museo de la Puerta de Hal con un coste adicional (seg\u00fan las condiciones de las tarifas de los socios).","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/sp\/detail\/id\/532817.html"},"pt":{"name":"Us et coutumes de la Renaissance : Bruxelles, ville fortifi\u00e9e","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/pt\/detail\/id\/532817.html"},"cn":{"name":"Us et coutumes de la Renaissance : Bruxelles, ville fortifi\u00e9e","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/agenda.brussels\/cn\/detail\/id\/532817.html"}},"place":{"id":203657,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Porte de Hal - MRAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ce monument f\u00e9erique, vieux de plus de 600 ans, constitue le t\u00e9moin le plus remarquable du pass\u00e9 m\u00e9di\u00e9val de la ville.\r\nDernier vestige de la seconde enceinte de Bruxelles, la porte de Hal accueille aujourd\u2019hui une belle collection d\u2019\u0153uvres et de multiples supports didactiques mettant en lumi\u00e8re son histoire et celle des fortifications bruxelloises. La fa\u00e7ade n\u00e9ogothique et la haute toiture ajout\u00e9es par l\u2019architecte Henry Beyaert au XIXe si\u00e8cle n\u2019ont rien enlev\u00e9 \u00e0 la splendeur des salles m\u00e9di\u00e9vales \u00e0 l\u2019int\u00e9rieur du b\u00e2timent. Au sommet de la tour, depuis le chemin de ronde cr\u00e9nel\u00e9, vous pourrez profiter d\u2019un spectaculaire panorama sur Bruxelles et sa r\u00e9gion. Une visite id\u00e9ale pour enfants et adultes.","description_print":"Ce monument f\u00e9\u00e9rique, vieux de plus de 600 ans, constitue le t\u00e9moin le plus remarquable du pass\u00e9 m\u00e9di\u00e9val de la ville. Dernier vestige de la seconde enceinte de Bruxelles, la porte de Hal accueille aujourd\u2019hui une belle collection d\u2019\u0153uvres et de multiples supports didactiques mettant en lumi\u00e8re son histoire et celle des fortifications bruxelloises. La fa\u00e7ade n\u00e9ogothique et la haute toiture ajout\u00e9es par l\u2019architecte Henry Beyaert au XIXe si\u00e8cle n\u2019ont rien enlev\u00e9 \u00e0 la splendeur des salles m\u00e9di\u00e9vales \u00e0 l\u2019int\u00e9rieur du b\u00e2timent. Au sommet de la tour, depuis le chemin de ronde cr\u00e9nel\u00e9, vous pourrez profiter d\u2019un spectaculaire panorama sur Bruxelles et sa r\u00e9gion. Une visite id\u00e9ale pour enfants et adultes.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Hallepoort \u2013 KMKG","address_street_name":"Zuidlaan","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallepoortmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zuidlaan, 150","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De Hallepoort is een sprookjesachtig monument, meer dan 600 jaar oud en de meest opmerkelijke getuige van het middeleeuwse verleden van de stad Brussel.\r\nDe Hallepoort is het laatste overblijfsel van de tweede omwalling van Brussel. Vandaag vind je er een prachtige collectie kunstwerken en vele didactische hulpmiddelen rond de geschiedenis van de Brusselse omwallingen en de stedelijke ambachtsgilden.\r\nDe neogotische fa\u00e7ade en het hoge dak, toegevoegd door architect Henry Beyaert in de 19de eeuw hebben niets afgedaan aan de pracht van de middeleeuwse zalen binnenin het gebouw.\r\nBoven op de toren kan je genieten van een spectaculair panorama over Brussel en omgeving.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Halle Gate \u2013 RMAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kmkg-mrah.be\/halle-gate","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"This last preserved gate will catapult you centuries back. An interactive tour through the striking rooms of the 14th century city gate will reveal how Brussels defended itself against external attacks during the Middle Ages and present the role that townspeople played in defence of their city. Visitors will gain a better understanding of the medieval city and its impact on present-day metropolitan Brussels by trying on a piece of armour, checking out models and short films,  exploring multimedia activities or just simply admiring the beautiful selection of museum pieces.\r\nAnd, the changing temporary exhibits on past and current life in the city are always a great reason to return to the Halle Gate. Best of all, the crenellated walkway around the top of the monument offers a spectacular view of the sprawling capital.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Porte de Hal - K\u00f6nigliche Museen f\u00fcr Kunst und Geschichte","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das ehemalige Stadttor Porte de Hal ist einer der bemerkenswertesten Zeugen der mittelalterlichen Vergangenheit Br\u00fcssels: Es handelt sich um das einzige noch erhaltene Tor der sieben Stadttore der mittelalterlichen Festungsmauern.\r\n\r\nFestung mit bewegter Vergangenheit: Das heute wie eine verwunschene Burg anmutende Geb\u00e4ude blickt auf eine bewegte Geschichte zur\u00fcck und war mehrfach vom Abriss bedroht: Nach der milit\u00e4rischen Funktion bis zum Jahr 1564 folgten verschiedenste Arten der Nutzung - unter anderem als lutherische Kirche, als Kontrollstelle f\u00fcr die Wareneinfuhr und -ausfuhr, als Kornspeicher und als Archiv! \r\n\r\nDas Museum Porte de Hal: 1847 wird das Geb\u00e4ude erstmals als Museum genutzt, 1860 wird der Architekt Henri Beyaert offiziell mit dem Umbau beauftragt: Er nimmt tiefgreifende bauliche Ver\u00e4nderungen und Neuinterpretation im neogotischen Stil vor. Vorherrschend ist die romantische Vision eines mittelalterlichen Bauwerks mit T\u00fcrmchen, Zinnen, Scharten, Verzierungen und verschiedenen dekorativen Elementen. \r\n\r\nHeute verbirgt sich hinter der renovierten wei\u00dfen Fassade das Museum \u201eMus\u00e9e du Porte de Hal\" mit Sammlungen \u00fcber das mittelalterliche Br\u00fcssel und die Geschichte des Geb\u00e4udes, die naturgem\u00e4\u00df eng miteinander verkn\u00fcpft sind. \r\n\r\nBesonderer Tipp: Vom Turm aus haben Sie einen fantastischen Ausblick auf Br\u00fcssel. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Porte de Hal - Musei Reali d'Arte e Storia, Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Edificio che risale a oltre 600 anni fa in stile neogotico ottimamente conservato, la Porte de hal \u00e8 il monumento pi\u00f9 importante del passato medievale della citt\u00e0.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEdificio che risale a oltre 600 anni fa in stile neogotico ottimamente conservato, la Porte de hal \u00e8 il monumento pi\u00f9 importante del passato medievale della citt\u00e0.\u00a0Si tratta dell'unica porta fortificata della seconda cinta delle\u00a0mura Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nLa funzione di prigione la risparmi\u00f2 dalla demolizione delle porte del XVIII secolo. Tuttavia, nel 1869, l'architetto Beyaert realizz\u00f2 alcune modifiche alterandone l'aspetto iniziale che nulla tolgono allo splendore delle sale medievali interne.\u00a0Dall'alto della torre si gode un bel<b> panorama su Bruxelles.\u00a0\r\n\r\nLa Porte de Hal oggi accoglie una bella collezione di opere che, con l'aiuto di supporti didattici, mettono in luce la sua storia e quella delle fortificazioni brussellesi.\u00a0\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Puerta de Hal - MRAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.laguiadeviaje.com\/puerta-de-hal\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La Puerta de Hal, en los Museos Reales de Arte y de Historia, es un monumento de m\u00e1s de 600 a\u00f1os, que constituye el testigo m\u00e1s destacado del medievo en Bruselas.\u00a0\r\n\r\nLa Puerta de Hal, en los Museos Reales de Arte y de Historia, es un monumento de m\u00e1s de 600 a\u00f1os, que constituye el testigo m\u00e1s destacado del medievo en Bruselas.\r\n\r\n\u00daltimo vestigio de la segunda muralla de Bruselas, la Puerta de Hal, alberga a fecha de hoy una magn\u00edfica colecci\u00f3n de obras de arte y m\u00faltiples soportes did\u00e1cticos, que ponen de relieve su historia y la de las fortificaciones bruselenses.\u00a0\r\n\r\nLa fachada neog\u00f3tica y los altos techos a\u00f1adidos por el arquitecto Henry Beyaert en el s. XIX no han acabado con el esplendor de las salas medievales en el interior del edificio.\r\n\r\nEn lo alto de la torre, desde el camino de ronda almenado, podr\u00e1s disfrutar de unas vistas espectaculares de Bruselas y de su regi\u00f3n.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Porte de Hal - MRAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Porte de Hal - MRAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"fr":["Sud"],"nl":["Zuid"],"en":["South"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":414,"location":{"lat":50.83309758,"lon":4.34491654},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-05-12T10:35:08+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:30+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":230072,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 541 03 77","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Aqueduc, 171","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Professionnels dans l'organisation d\u2019\u00e9v\u00e9nements culturels depuis 1986.\r\nVous \u00eates \u00e0 la recherche d'un team-building cr\u00e9atif et culturel pour vos collaborateurs? Ou d'un programme social pour vos clients? Contactez-nous et d\u00e9couvrez nos propositions:\r\n- Rallyes inoubliables: New: \"Enigme sanglant, mais qui a tu\u00e9 monsieur le Comte?\" devenez un detective et trouvez la solution: \u00e0 pied, en tuk tuk, dans une old timer...\r\n- Dine Around (Entr\u00e9e, plat et dessert en trois restaurant) et sa version Best Of: avec un workshop chocolat chez Laurent Gerbaud comme dessert!\r\n- Chateaux et lieux exclusifs pour vos \u00e9v\u00e9nements d\u2019atmosph\u00e8re et tour VIP\r\n- Diner Thematique: Ex: Art Nouveau, possibilit\u00e9 de l'agr\u00e9menter avec: guides costum\u00e9s, musique live, interpr\u00e8te de Jacques Brel, magiciens, danseurs, acteurs,...\r\n- Itin\u00e9raires sur mesure: Art Nouveau, Anvers \u00e0 la mode, hommage \u00e0 Brel, Brussels by night, Bi\u00e8re et Chocolat, Bruxelles insolite, Simenon et Maigret, Atelier mode, design, Le Gay Bruxelles, \"Qui a tu\u00e9...\", Bruxelles durable.\r\n\r\nSur Bruxelles et toute la Belgique. Nous r\u00e9pondons sur mesure et \u00e0 la demande.\r\nNotre Equipe:\r\n- 4 professionnels pour s'assurer que votre programme atteigne vos objectifs et d\u00e9passe les attentes de vos clients.\r\n- 200 guides multilingues, acteurs, coordinateurs, hotesses,... sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s dans la mise \u00e0 l'honneur de la Belgique et ses tr\u00e9sors cach\u00e9s.\r\n- 7 jours sur 7\r\n- Notre objectif: vivre l'Art comme un Art de Vivre.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Waterleidingsstraat","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 541 03 77","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Waterleidingsstraat, 171","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 541 03 77","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Aqueduc, 171","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CULTURAL EVENTS SINCE 1986 \r\nAre you looking for fresh and creative incentive, team-building, or social programs for your clients? Contact us and fi nd out what\u2019s on the \u201cmenu\u201d: \r\n\u2022  Unforgettable rallies: NEW! \u201cBloody inquiry, become one of our most famous detective\u201d -> On foot, tuk tuk, old street car,... \r\n\u2022  Dine Around (3 courses in 3 differents venues). Best of version: with a chocolat workshop at Laurent Gerbaud \u2022 Private Castles for exclusive events & atmosphere and exclusive tours \r\n\u2022  Thematic Diner: Ex: Art Nouveau, possibilities of : costumed guides, live band, a Jacques Brel singer,... \r\n\u2022  Custom-tailored itineraires: Art Nouveau, Trendy Antwerp, Brel and Brussels by night, Beer and chocolate, another Bruges, Simenon and Maigret, Fashion workshops, design, Brussels is there for y